      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: You reach a clearing with a strange amount of crows circling above. You don't think much of it... until they start to <shake>drop <style=stone>stones</style></shake> on you!
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: You reach a clearing with a strange amount of crows <wave>circling</wave> above. You don't think much of it... until they start to <shake>drop <style=stone>Pebballs</style></shake> on you!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Du erreichst eine Lichtung mit einer verdächtigen Menge an Krähen, die über dir kreisen. Du denkst dir nicht viel dabei... bis sie <shake><style=stone>Steine</style> auf dich fallenlassen!</shake>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Je bereikt een open plek met een verrassend aantal kraaien die rondcirkelen. Je trekt er niks van aan... totdat ze <shake><style=stone>stenen</style></shake> op je beginnen te laten vallen!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Raggiungi una radura sulla quale volano in circolo dei corvi. Inizialmente non ci fai molto caso... finché non iniziano a farti <shake>cadere delle <style=stone>Sassosfere</style></shake> in testa!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você encontra uma clareira com uma estranha quantidade de corvos sobrevoando a área. Você não se importa muito... até eles começarem a <shake>jogar <style=stone>Cascalhorbes</style></shake> em você!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Вы вышли на поляну, над которой кружит до странного много ворон. Вы не обращаете на них внимания... пока они не начинают <shake>кидать в вас <style=stone>камни</style></shake>!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 你到達了一片空地，奇怪的烏鴉群在空中盤旋。你沒有多想 ···直到牠們開始向你<shake>扔<style=stone>圓石彈珠</style></shake>！
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 당신은 수상할 정도로 많은 까마귀들이 날아다니고 있는 빈터를 발견했습니다. 별로 수상쩍지는 않았는데... 갑자기 <shake><style=stone>펩볼</style>이 떨어지기 시작합니다!</shake>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous arrivez dans une clairière avec un nombre étrange de corbeaux dans le ciel. Vous n’y prêtez pas plus attention que ça... jusqu’au moment où ils commencent à vous <shake>jeter des <style=stone>Cailloux</style></shake> !
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Llegas a un claro donde ves una extraña cantidad de cuervos volando en círculos. No les das mucha importancia... ¡Hasta que empiezan a <shake> soltar <style=stone>Guijarros</style></shake> sobre ti!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 你走到了一片空地，奇怪的鸦群在空中盘旋。你没有多想 ······直到他们开始对你<shake>扔<style=stone>石头</style></shake>！
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "何羽かのカラスが上空を飛び交う空き地に辿り着いた。\nどうやら君はカラスを甘く見ていたらしい……\nカラス達は君めがけて<shake><style=stone>石ころ</style></shake>を<shake>落とし始めたのだ！</shake>"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: Du når en skogsglänta med onaturligt många kråkor som cirkulerar ovanför. Du tänker inte så mycket på det... fram tills de börjar att <shake>släppa <style=stone>stenar</style></shake> på dig!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Docierasz do polany z podejrzaną liczbą szybujących wysoko kruków.. Nie przejmujesz się tym zbytnio… dopóki nie zaczynają <shake>zrzucać <style=stone>kamieni</style></shake> na ciebie!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: Bir sürü karganın üzerinde daireler çizdiği bir açıklığa vardın. Pek umurunda değillerdi... kafana <shake>kocaman <style=stone>taşlar</style></shake> atmaya başlayıncaya kadar!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value: Dostanete sa na čistinku nad ktorou krúži množstvo vrán. Nemyslíš na to... kým na teba nezačnú <shake>padať <style=stone>kamene</style></shake>!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
