      - title: en
        value: Use your satchel to catch the Pebballs! (<style=stone>+3 Pebballs</style>)
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Benutze deine Tasche, um die Steine aufzufangen! <style=stone>(+3 Steine)</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Gebruik je schoudertas om de stenen op te vangen! <style=stone>(+3 stenen)</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Usa il tuo zaino per raccogliere le Sassosfere! <style=stone>(+3 Sassosfere)</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Usar sua bolsa para pegar os Cascalhorbes! <style=stone>(+3 Cascalhorbes)</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Поймать камни в сумку! <style=stone>(+3 камня)</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 用彈珠袋接住圓石彈珠！（<style=stone>+ 3 圓石彈珠</style>）
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 가방을 열어 펩볼을 받아보기! <style=stone>(펩볼 +3개)</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Utiliser votre sacoche pour attraper les pierres ! <style=stone>(+3 Cailloux)</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: ¡Usar tu bolso para atrapar los Guijarros! <style=stone>(+ 3 Guijarros)</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 把石头装进挎包！<style=stone>（ + 3 石头）</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: カバンで石ころをつかむ！<style=stone>（石ころ +3）</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: Använd din säck för att fånga stenarna! <style=stone>(+3 stenar)</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Użyj swej torby, aby złapać kamienie! <style=stone>(+3 Kamienie)</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: Çantanla taşları yakala! <style=stone>(+3 Taş)</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value: Použite svoju tašku na chytanie kameňov! <style=stone>(+3 kamene)</style>
