        value: You sprint through the clearing as the stones rain down on you. You  <style=damage>take a few knocks</style>, but at least you don't have to lug around any extra stones.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: You sprint through the clearing as the stones rain down on you. You  <style=damage>take a few knocks</style>, but at least you don't have to lug around any extra Pebballs.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Du sprintest durch die Lichtung, während die Steine auf dich herabregnen. Du <style=damage>kriegst ein paar Einschläge ab</style>, aber wenigstens musst du keine zusätzlichen Steine herumschleppen.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Je sprint door de open plek terwijl de stenen op je neer kletteren. Je <style=damage>incasseert een paar klappen</style>, maar je hoeft in ieder geval geen extra stenen mee te sjouwen.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Attraversi di corsa la radura, evitando la pioggia di sassi. Subisci <style=damage>qualche colpo</style>, ma almeno non dovrai trascinarti in giro altre pesanti Sassosfere.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você dispara pela clareira enquanto chove Cascalhorbes em você. Você <style=damage>leva algumas pedradas</style>, mas pelo menos não terá que carregar nenhum Cascalhorbe a mais.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Вы бежите через дождь из камней. В вас <style=damage>попадает пара камней</style>, но зато хотя бы не нужно нести лишний груз.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 一陣石雨中，你快速衝過空地。你<style=damage>被砸了幾下</style>，但至少你不用拖著更多圓石彈珠到處跑。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 당신은 펩볼이 비처럼 내리는 빈터를 달립니다. <style=damage>몇 번 맞기는 했지만</style>, 적어도 펩볼을 더 이고 다닐 일은 없게 되었네요.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous courez à travers la clairière, les Cailloux pleuvant sur vous. Vous <style=damage>prenez quelques coups</style>. Au moins, vous n’avez pas besoin de vous trimballer d’autres Cailloux.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Atraviesas el claro corriendo mientras las piedras caen sobre ti. <style=damage>Recibes algunos golpes</style>, pero al menos no tienes que cargar con Guijarros adicionales.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 你快速冲过空地，石头像雨点般落下。你<style=damage>被砸了几下</style>，但至少你不需要拖着石头到处跑了。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "雨あられのごとく<style=stone>石ころ</style>が降り注ぐ中、\n君は辺り一面を全速力でトテトテと駆け回った。\n……<style=damage>少々ひどい目にあった</style>ものの、\n余計なものを無理して持ち歩く必要も無いだろう。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: Du springer genom skogsgläntan medans stenarna regnar ner på dig. Du <style=damage>tar några träffar</style>, men du behöver iallafall inte bära runt på några extra stenar.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Gdy kamienie na ciebie spadają, przebiegasz szybko przez pole. <style=damage>Łapiesz parę guzów</style>, ale przynajmniej nie musisz taszczyć ze sobą dodatkowych kamieni.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: Kafana taşlar yağarken koşarak açıklığı geçtin. <style=damage>Birkaç darbe aldın</style>, ama en azından fazladan taş taşımak zorunda değilsin.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value: Šprintuješ cez čistinku, keď na teba pršia kamene. Urobíte <style=damage>niekoľko úderov</style>, ale aspoň nemusíte so sebou vláčiť žiadne kamene navyše.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
