      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: You hold the satchel above your head and run through the field. You avoid any bruises but your satchel absorbs <style=stone>[var=orb0], [var=orb1], and [var=orb2]</style>.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: You hold the satchel above your head and run through the field. You avoid any bruises but your satchel absorbs the <style=stone>[var=orb0], [var=orb1], and [var=orb2]</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous courez à travers la clairière en tenant votre sacoche au-dessus de votre tête. Vous évitez les ecchymoses mais votre sacoche absorbe les <style=stone>[var=orb0], [var=orb1], et [var=orb2]</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Sostienes el bolso encima de tu cabeza. Evitas todos los moretones, pero tu bolso absorbe los <style=stone>[var=orb0], [var=orb1], y [var=orb2]</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Du hältst deine Tasche über deinen Kopf und rennst durch das Feld. Du vermeidest größere Verletzungen, aber deine Tasche absorbiert ein <style=stone>[var=orb0], [var=orb1] und [var=orb2]</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Je houdt de schoudertas boven je hoofd en rent door het veld. Je kan blauwe plekken voorkomen, maar je tas absorbeert de <style=stone>[var=orb0], [var=orb1] en [var=orb2]</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Tenendo lo zaino sopra la testa, attraversi di corsa il campo. Eviti i colpi e lo zaino assorbe <style=stone>[var=orb0], [var=orb1] e [var=orb2]</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você coloca a bolsa por cima da cabeça e corre pela clareira. Você evita quaisquer arranhões, mas sua bolsa absorve <style=stone>[var=orb0], [var=orb1], e [var=orb2]</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Вы держите сумку над головой и бежите через поле. Обошлось без синяков, а в сумке оказались <style=stone>[var=orb0], [var=orb1] и [var=orb2]</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 你把挎包举在头顶，然后跑过这片区域。你没有受到任何伤害，但<style=stone>[var=orb0]、[var=orb1]和[var=orb2]</style>却掉进了你的挎包。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 你把彈珠袋舉過頭頂，然後跑過這片區域。你沒受到任何傷害，但<style=stone>[var=orb0]、[var=orb1]和[var=orb2]</style>掉進你的彈珠袋中了。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "カバンを頭上にかざしながら、君は辺り一面を走り回った。\nなんとか無傷ですんだものの、カバンの中に\n「<style=stone>[var=orb0]</style>」、「<style=stone>[var=orb1]</style>」、\n「<style=stone>[var=orb2]</style>」が入っていく……"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 당신은 가방을 머리 위에 이고 상처 하나 없이 빈터를 달리고, 가방 속에는 <style=stone>[var=orb0], [var=orb1], 그리고 [var=orb2]</style>가 담겼습니다.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: Du håller säcken ovanför huvudet och springer genom fältet. Du undviker blåmärken men din skolväska absorberar <style=stone>[var=orb0], [var=orb1] och [var=orb2]</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Trzymając worek nad głową, przebiegasz przez pole. Unikasz wszelakich siniaków, a twoja torba wciąga <style=stone>[var=orb0], [var=orb1], i [var=orb2]</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: Çantanı kafanın üstünde tutarak açıklığı geçtin. Herhangi bir darbe almaktan kurtuldun ama çantan <style=stone>[var=orb0], [var=orb1], ve [var=orb2]</style> ile doldu.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value: S vrecom nad hlavou bežíte po poli. Vyhnete sa všetkým druhom modrín a vaša taška nazbiera <style=stone>[var=orb0], [var=orb1] a [var=orb2]</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
