        value: You quickly reach into your satchel and hold up the first orb your little fingers find, it's your <style=damage>[var=orb0]</style>! The crows seem pleased  with your offering, and a few even <bounce>swoop down</bounce> and leave you <style=gold>[var=goldToGrant] gold</style> as a gift.
