      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: From seemingly nowhere, <shake><style=fire>an inferno</style></shake> ignites in a circle around you. There are two <style=fire>fireballs</style> <bounce>bouncing</bounce> and <wave>circling</wave> around each other in the center of the ring.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: From seemingly nowhere, <shake><style=fire>an inferno</style></shake> ignites in a circle around you. There are two <style=fire>fireballs</style> <bounce>bouncing</bounce> and <wave>circling</wave> around each other in the center of the ring.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Scheinbar aus dem Nirgendwo entzündet sich <shake><style=fire>ein Inferno</style></shake> kreisförmig um dich herum. Zwei <style=fire>Infernorbs</style> <bounce>springen umher</bounce> und <wave>umkreisen</wave> sich in der Mitte des Feuerrings.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Vanuit schijnbaar nergens ontbrandt <shake><style=fire>een inferno</style></shake> in een cirkel om je heen. Er zijn twee <style=fire>vuurballen</style> die al <bounce>stuiterend</bounce> om elkaar heen <wave>draaien</wave> in het midden van de ring.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Come apparso dal nulla, <shake><style=fire>un inferno</style></shake> si accende creando un cerchio attorno a te. Ci sono due <style=fire>palle di fuoco</style><bounce> che rimbalzano</bounce> e <wave>girano</wave> l’una attorno all’altra, al centro del cerchio.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Aparentemente do nada, <shake><style=fire>um fogo intenso</style></shake> se acende em um círculo a sua volta. Há duas <style=fire>bolas de fogo</style> <bounce>quicando</bounce> e <wave>rodopiando</wave> entre si no centro do círculo de fogo.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Из ниоткуда вокруг вас вспыхивает <shake><style=fire>кольцо огня</style></shake>. Два <style=fire>огненных шара</style> <bounce>скачут</bounce> и <wave>кружатся</wave> в самом его центре.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 突然間你周圍燃起了一圈<shake><style=fire>地獄之火</style></shake>。火圈中央有兩顆<style=fire>火球</style>正來回<bounce>跳動</bounce>並<wave>盤旋</wave>。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 뜬금없이 <shake><style=fire>지옥불</style></shake>이 당신을 둥글게 둘러쌉니다. 불 고리의 중앙에는 두 개의 <style=fire>화염구</style>가 <bounce>통통 튀며</bounce> 서로를 <wave>쫓으며 돌고</wave> 있습니다.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: De nulle part, <shake><style=fire>un brasier</style></shake> s’allume en cercle autour de vous. Deux <style=fire>boules de feu</style> commencent à <bounce>danser</bounce> et <wave>tourner</wave> l’une autour de l’autre au centre du cercle.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Sin aviso alguno, <shake><style=fire>un círculo de llamas infernales</style></shake> se enciende a tu alrededor. En el centro del anillo hay dos <style=fire>bolas de fuego</style> <bounce>rebotando</bounce> y <wave>dando vueltas</wave> una alrededor de la otra.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 突然之间，你的周围燃起了一圈<shake><style=fire>地狱之火</style></shake>。火圈中央有两个<style=fire>狱焰弹珠</style>相互<wave>旋转</wave><bounce>跳动着</bounce>。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "突然、どこからともなく<shake><style=fire>燃え盛る炎</style></shake>が現れて君を取り囲んだ。\n\nメラメラと燃える炎の輪の中心で、二つの<style=fire>火の玉</style>が\n互いに<bounce>ピョンピョン</bounce>跳ねたり、<wave>クルクル</wave>回っている。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: Från till synes ingenstans, <shake><style=fire>en inferno</style></shake> tänds i en cirkel runtom dig. Det finns två <style=fire>eldklot</style> som <bounce>studsar</bounce> och <wave>cirkulerar</wave> runt varandra i mitten av ringen.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Ni stąd ni zowąd, <shake><style=fire>płomienie</style></shake> pojawiają się wokół ciebie w okręgu.. Dwie <style=fire>kule ognia</style> <bounce>odbijają się</bounce> i <wave>krążą</wave> wokół siebie w środku okręgu.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: Beklenmedik bir anda <shake><style=fire>bir ateş çemberi</style></shake> etrafını sardı. Çemberin ortasında <bounce>zıplayarak</bounce> <wave>birbirini takip eden</wave> iki <style=fire>ateştopu</style> var.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
