        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Nimm die Infernorbs (<style=fire>+2 Infernorbs,</style> <style=damage>-[var=fireball_take_dmg] HP</style>)
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Grijp de vuurballen <style=fire>(+2 vuurballen,</style><style=damage>-[var=fireball_take_dmg] HP)</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Afferra le palle di fuoco <style=fire>(+2 palle di fuoco,</style><style=damage>-[var=fireball_take_dmg] PS)</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Pegar as bolas de fogo. <style=fire>(+2 bolas de fogo,</style><style=damage>-[var=fireball_take_dmg] PV)</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Схватить шары<style=fire>(+2 огненных шара,</style><style=damage>-[var=fireball_take_dmg] ОЗ)</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 抓住火球（<style=fire>+ 2 顆獄焰彈珠</style>，<style=damage>- [var=fireball_take_dmg] 點血量</style>）
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 화염구들을 잡기 <style=fire>(화염구 +2개, </style><style=damage>체력 -[var=fireball_take_dmg])</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Attraper les boules de feu <style=fire>(+2 Infernorbes</style>, <style=damage>-[var=fireball_take_dmg] PV)</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Agarrar las bolas de fuego <style=fire>(+2 Infiernorbes,</style><style=damage>-[var=fireball_take_dmg] PV)</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 抓住狱焰弹珠<style=fire>（ + 2狱焰弹珠，</style><style=damage> - [var=fireball_take_dmg] 血量）</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: 火の玉をつかむ （<style=fire>インフェルノーブ +2</style>、<style=damage>HP -[var=fireball_take_dmg]</style>）
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: Ta eldkloten <style=fire>(+2 Eldklot,</style><style=damage>-[var=fireball_take_dmg] HP)</style>
        type: 4
