      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: You dash bravely through the <style=fire>flames</style>! You're a <style=damage>little singed</style>, but otherwise unscathed.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: You dash bravely through the <style=fire>flames</style>! You're a <style=damage>little singed</style>, but otherwise unscathed.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Du springst mutig durch die <style=fire>Flammen</style>! Du bist <style=damage>ein wenig angesengt</style>, aber ansonsten unversehrt.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Je springt dapper door de <style=fire>vlammen</style>! Je bent een <style=damage>beetje verschroeid</style> maar verder ongedeerd.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Corri coraggiosamente attraverso le <style=fire>fiamme</style>! Ti procuri qualche <style=damage>scottatura</style>, ma ne esci indenne.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você corre corajosamente pelas <style=fire>chamas</style>! Você sai um <style=damage>pouco chamuscado</style>, porém ileso.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Вы смело рветесь через <style=fire>огонь</style>! Вы немного <style=damage>обожглись</style>, но в целом не пострадали.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 你勇敢地衝出<style=fire>火圈</style>！雖然受到了<style=damage>輕微燒傷</style>，但並無大礙。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 당신은 용감하게도 <style=fire>불길</style>을 뚫고 갑니다! <style=damage>약간의 화상</style>을 입긴 했지만, 크게 다친 것 같진 않습니다.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous plongez courageusement à travers le <style=fire>feu</style> ! Vos poils <style=damage>roussissent un peu</style>, mais vous vous en sortez indemne.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: ¡Te lanzas con valentía a través de las <style=fire>llamas</style>! Sales <style=damage>un poco chamuscado</style>, pero por lo demás ileso.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 你勇敢地冲出了<style=fire>火焰</style>！被<style=damage>轻微烧伤</style>，但并没有什么大碍。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "<style=fire>燃え盛る炎</style>の中を勇敢に駆け抜けた！\n少しばかり<style=damage>焦げついた</style>が、それ以外は問題なしだ。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: Du rusar modigt genom <style=fire>flammorna</style>! Du är <style=damage>lite brännd</style> men annars oskadd.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Odważnie przebiegasz przez <style=fire>płomienie</style>! Jesteś <style=damage>trochę przypalony</style>, ale w jednym kawałku.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: Cesurca <style=fire>ateşin</style> içinden koştun! Biraz <style=damage>piştin</style>, ama ağır bir yara almadan kurtuldun.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
