        value: You pull an orb from your satchel and with incredible effort (and some <style=damage>singed fingers</style>) sandwich it between the <style=fire>fireballs</style>. The orbs implode with a satisfying *POP!* and the wall of fire subsides, leaving you free to continue on your way.
