        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: You go to place the <style=loseOrb>[var=lostOrb]</style> on the altar, but it sinks right into the solid slab of stone. As your offering disappears, you feel your other hand grow warm and realize your <style=upgradeOrb>[var=upgradedOrb] is now level [var=upgradedLevel].</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Du gehst zum Altar, um dein <style=loseOrb>[var=lostOrb]</style> darauf zu platzieren, aber das Orb sinkt sofort in die feste Steinplatte ein. Als dein Opfer verschwindet, fühlst du eine Wärme in deiner anderen Hand und merkst, dass dein <style=upgradeOrb>[var=upgradedOrb] jetzt auf Level [var=upgradedLevel] ist.</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Je gaat de <style=loseOrb>[var=lostOrb]</style> op het altaar plaatsen, maar hij zakt helemaal weg in de stenen plaat. Terwijl je offer verdwijnt voel je je andere hand warm worden en realiseer je je dat je <style=upgradeOrb>[var=upgradedOrb] nu level [var=upgradedLevel] is.</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Stai per piazzare la <style=loseOrb>[var=lostOrb]</style> sull'altare, ma questa affonda immediatamente nella lastra di roccia. Mentre la tua offerta sparisce, senti l’altra mano riscaldarsi e noti che la tua <style=upgradeOrb>[var=upgradedOrb] è salita al livello [var=upgradedLevel].</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você coloca <style=loseOrb>[var=lostOrb]</style> no altar, mas a oferenda afunda dentro da laje de pedra sólida. Enquanto isso, você sente a sua outra mão ficar quente e percebe que <style=upgradeOrb>[var=upgradedOrb] está agora no nível [var=upgradedLevel].</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Вы кладете <style=loseOrb>[var=lostOrb]</style> на алтарь, и его засасывает прямо в каменную плиту. Вдруг вы чувствуете, что ваша вторая рука стала теплее. <style=upgradeOrb>[var=upgradedOrb] теперь [var=upgradedLevel] уровня.</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 你上前將<style=loseOrb>[var=lostOrb]</style>擺到祭壇上，而它沉入石板內。你感到另一只手上傳來一股暖流，然後發現手中的<style=upgradeOrb>[var=upgradedOrb] 現在是 Lv[var=upgradedLevel]</style>了。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 제단 위에 <style=loseOrb>[var=lostOrb]</style> 하나를 놓았더니, 바로 돌 속으로 흡수되어 버립니다. 제단에 바친 제물은 사라지고, 다른 손에서는 <style=upgradeOrb>레벨 [var=upgradedLevel]의 [var=upgradedOrb]</style>의 따듯함이 느껴집니다.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous décidez de placer votre <style=loseOrb>[var=lostOrb]</style> sur l’autel, qui disparaît à l’intérieur de la dalle de pierre. Vous sentez alors votre autre main bouillonner d’énergie et réalisez que votre <style=upgradeOrb>[var=upgradedOrb] est maintenant niveau [var=upgradedLevel].</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Vas a colocar el <style=loseOrb>[var=lostOrb]</style> en el altar, pero el orbe se hunde en la losa de piedra sólida. Mientras tu ofrenda desaparece, sientes que tu otra mano se calienta y te das cuenta de que tu <style=upgradeOrb>[var=upgradedOrb] ahora es de nivel [var=upgradedLevel].</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 你上前把<style=loseOrb>[var=lostOrb]</style>放在祭坛上，它竟然没入了坚固的石板中。随着祭品消失，你的另一只手传来一股暖意，<style=upgradeOrb>[var=upgradedOrb]已经升为 [var=upgradedLevel] 级。</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "祭壇に置いた「<style=loseOrb>[var=lostOrb]</style>」が硬い石版とともに沈む……\n差し出したオーブが消えると、もう片方の手が温かくなり、\n「<style=upgradeOrb>[var=upgradedOrb]</style>」が <style=upgradeOrb>Lv[var=upgradedLevel] に強化されたことを肌で感じた</style>。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: Du går för att placera <style=loseOrb>[var=lostOrb]</style> på altaret, men den sjunker rakt in i den solida stenplattan. Medans det du offrade försvinner känner du att din andra hand börjar bli varm och du inser att din <style=upgradeOrb>[var=upgradedOrb] är nu nivå [var=upgradedLevel].</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Podchodzisz, aby umieścić <style=loseOrb>[var=lostOrb]</style> na ołtarzu, lecz wnika on w kamienną płytę. Gdy twa ofiara znika, czujesz w swojej drugiej ręce ciepło i spostrzegasz, że <style=upgradeOrb>[var=upgradedOrb] ma poziom [var=upgradedLevel].</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: Sunağa koyduğun <style=loseOrb>[var=lostOrb]</style> taş levhanın derinliklerine batarak kayboldu. Adağının gidişini izlerken diğer elinde bir sıcaklık hissettin, ve <style=upgradeOrb>[var=upgradedOrb] artık [var=upgradedLevel].</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
