      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "You reach a clearing that is <style=slime>unusually slimy</style>. You progress cautiously, but still <shake>lose your step.</shake>\n\nThree orbs fall into the slime and you only have two hands. Which one do you <style=loseOrb>let sink</style> into the <style=slime>slimy abyss</style>?"
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: "You reach a clearing that is <style=slime>unusually slimy</style>. You progress cautiously, but still <shake>lose your step.</shake>\n\nThree orbs fall into the slime and you only have two hands. Which one do you <style=loseOrb>let sink</style> into the <style=slime>slimy abyss</style>?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: "Du erreichst eine <style=slime>ungewöhnlich schleimige</style> Lichtung. Du schreitest vorsichtig voran, aber <shake>verlierst dennoch dein Gleichgewicht.</shake>\n\nDrei Orbs fallen in den Schleim, aber du hast nur zwei Hände. Welches möchtest du in den <style=slime>schleimigen Abgrund</style> <style=loseOrb>sinken lassen</style> ?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: "Je bereikt een open plek die <style=slime>ongewoon slijmerig</style> is. Je loopt voorzichtig vooruit maar begaat een <shake>misstap</shake>\n\nDrie bollen vallen in het slijm en je hebt maar twee handen. Welke laat je <style=loseOrb>in de <style=slime>slijmerige afgrond</style> zinken</style>?\""
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Raggiungi uno spiazzo <style=slime>stranamente melmoso</style>. Avanzi con cautela, ma comunque finisci per <shake>inciampare.</shake> Tre sfere finiscono nella melma, ma hai solo due mani...   Quale <style=loseOrb>lasci affondare</style> nel <style=slime>melmoso abisso</style>?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você encontra uma clareira <style=slime>estranhamente gosmenta</style>. Você avança cautelosamente, mas mesmo assim <shake>escorrega.</shake>  Três orbes caem na gosma e você tem apenas duas mãos. Qual deles você <style=loseOrb>deixará afundar</style> no <style=slime>abismo gosmento</style>?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Вы доходите до <style=slime>необычно склизкой</style> поляны. Вы пытаетесь осторожно пройти через нее, но все равно <shake>поскальзываетесь.</shake>  В слизь упали три шара, а у вас только две руки. Какому из этих шаров вы <style=loseOrb>позволите утонуть</style> в <style=slime>слизи</style>?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: "你來到一塊<style=slime>黏糊糊</style>的空地。你小心翼翼地邁進，但仍然不小心<shake>摔倒了</shake>。\n\n有三顆彈珠不小心掉進黏液中，但你只有兩隻手，你要選擇讓哪顆彈珠<style=loseOrb>沉沒</style>到<style=slime>黏液深淵</style>呢？"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: "당신은 이상할 정도로 <style=slime>끈적이고 미끌거리는</style> 빈터에 도착합니다. 조심스럽게 나아갔지만, 당신은 여전히 <shake>균형을 잃고 맙니다.</shake>\n \n 세 개의 구슬을 점액으로 떨어뜨렸는데 손은 두 개뿐. <style=slime>점액 속</style>으로 가라앉는 구슬 중 어떤 것을 <style=loseOrb>포기</style>할 건가요?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous arrivez dans une clairière marécageuse <style=slime>étrangement visqueuse</style>. Vous avancez prudemment, mais finissez par <shake>trébucher dans la vase.</shake>  Trois de vos orbes tombent dans la vase et vous n’avez que deux mains. Quel orbe <style=loseOrb>laissez-vous couler</style> dans les <style=slime>abysses boueuses</style>?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Llegas a un claro que es <style=slime>extrañamente viscoso</style>. Avanzas con cautela, pero aun así <shake>te resbalas.</shake>  Tres de tus orbes caen en el cieno y solo tienes dos manos. ¿Cuál <style=loseOrb>dejarás que se hunda</style> en el <style=slime>abismo viscoso</style>?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: "你来到一块<style=slime>黏糊糊的</style>的空地。你小心翼翼地前进，但仍然不小心<shake>摔倒了。</shake>\n\n三颗弹珠掉落到粘液中，但你只有两只手。你会选择让哪颗弹珠<style=loseOrb>沉没</style>到<style=slime>无尽的粘液中</style>？"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "<style=slime>非常にベトベトした</style>場所に辿り着いた。慎重に前に進んだものの、\n不幸にも<shake>足を踏み外してしまった。</shake>\n\n三個のオーブがスライムに沈んでいくが、それを拾う手は二つだけ。\nどのオーブを<style=slime>底無しのスライム</style>へと<style=loseOrb>沈めようか</style>？"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: Du når en skogsglänta som är <style=slime>ovanligt slemmig</style>. Du går frammåt försiktigt, men <shake>halkar</shake> ändå. Tre klot ramlar in i slemmet och du har bara två händer. Vilken <style=loseOrb>låter du sjunka</style> in i den <style=slime>slemmiga abyssen</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Docierasz do polany, która jest <style=slime>niespotykanie oślizgła</style>. Poruszasz się ostrożnie, lecz pomimo tego <shake>potykasz się.</shake> Trzy kulki wpadają do szlamu, a ty masz tylko dwie ręce. Której <style=loseOrb>pozwolisz zatonąć</style> w <style=slime>oślizgłej otchłani</style>?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: "<style=slime>Balçık dolu</style> bir açıklığa vardın. Dikkatlice ilerlemeye çalışırken <shake>ayağın kayıverdi!</shake>\n\nÜç tane topu bataklığa düşürdün ve sadece iki tanesini kurtarabilirsin. Hangi topun<style=slime>balçığa batmasına</style> <style=loseOrb>göz yumacaksın</style>?\n"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
