        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: You instinctively snatch up an orb in each hand, but you watch as the <style=loseOrb>[var=lostOrb]</style> disappears deep into the muck.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Du greifst mit jeder Hand instinktiv nach einem Orb, aber siehst, wie dein <style=loseOrb>[var=lostOrb]</style> schließlich tief im Dreck verschwindet.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Instinctief grijp je met elke hand een bol, maar je ziet hoe de <style=loseOrb>[var=lostOrb]</style> diep in de modder verdwijnt.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Raccogli istintivamente una sfera per mano, ma non puoi che stare a guardare la <style=loseOrb>[var=lostOrb]</style> mentre sparisce nella melma.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você instintivamente agarra um orbe em cada mão, mas observa enquanto o <style=loseOrb>[var=lostOrb]</style> desaparece na gosma.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Вы инстинктивно хватаете по шару в каждую руку и наблюдаете как <style=loseOrb>[var=lostOrb]</style> все глубже и глубже погружается в слизь.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 你本能地出手各抓住一顆彈珠，但只能眼看著<style=loseOrb>[var=lostOrb]</style>消失在黏液當中。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 당신은 본능적으로 손을 뻗어 양손에 구슬을 잡습니다. 하지만 점액 속으로 가라앉는 <style=loseOrb>[var=lostOrb]</style>만은 지켜볼 수밖에 없었습니다.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous attrapez instinctivement un orbe dans chaque main, mais vous ne pouvez que regarder avec impuissance votre <style=loseOrb>[var=lostOrb]</style> disparaître dans les profondeurs visqueuses.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Por instinto agarras un orbe con cada mano, pero ves cómo el <style=loseOrb>[var=lostOrb]</style> desaparece en las profundidades del lodo.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 你两只手本能地各抓起一颗弹珠，但只能眼看着<style=loseOrb>[var=lostOrb]</style>消失在黏液里。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "とっさに両手でオーブをつかみ取ったが、\n「<style=loseOrb>[var=lostOrb]</style>」がスライムの奥底に消えていった……"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: Du plockar upp ett klot i varje hand instinktivt, men du kan bara titta medans <style=loseOrb>[var=lostOrb]</style> försvinner djupt ner i sörjan.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Instynktownie łapiesz kulki w obie ręce, lecz spostrzegasz jak <style=loseOrb>[var=lostOrb]</style> niknie głęboko w paskudztwie.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: İçgüdüsel olarak iki topu hemen yakaladın fakat <style=loseOrb>[var=lostOrb]</style> batarken tek yapabildiğin izlemek oldu.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
