      - title: en
        value: You reach a clearing in the forest where the sun shines through brightly.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Du erreichst eine Lichtung im Wald, in der hell die Sonne scheint.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Je bereikt een open plek in het bos waar de zon fel doorkomt.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Raggiungi una radura nella foresta, dove i raggi del sole splendono attraverso gli alberi.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você encontra uma clareira na Floresta onde os raios de sol incidem de forma encantadora.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: В лесу вы находите ярко освещенную солнцем поляну.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 你抵達了森林中一塊被陽光照耀著的空地。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 당신은 햇살이 밝게 비치는 숲속 빈터에 도착했습니다.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous atteignez un coin de la forêt où le soleil brille ardemment à travers le feuillage.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Llegas a un claro en el bosque donde el sol brilla intensamente.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 你来到了森林中的一块空地，这里被明亮的阳光照耀着。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: 森を歩いていると、日差しが心地よい開放的な空間に辿り着いた。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: Du når en skogsglänta där solen skiner starkt.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Docierasz do polany w lesie, gdzie słońce jasno świeci.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: Güneş güzelce parıldadığı bir açıklığa vardın.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
