      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: A few moments of solace with the sun beaming on your face leave you feeling quite refreshed, and you continue on your journey with a fresh bounce in your step.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: A few moments of solace with the sun beaming on your face leave you feeling quite refreshed, and you continue on your journey with a fresh bounce in your step.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Nach einer kurzen Ruhezeit mit vielen Sonnenstrahlen fühlst du dich sehr erfrischt und setzt deine Reise mit neuem Mut fort.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Een paar momenten van verlichting met de zon op je bolletje zorgen ervoor dat je je behoorlijk verfrist voelt en je vol frisse moed je reis kunt vervolgen.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Qualche minuto di risposo col sole che bacia il tuo volto è sufficiente a farti riprendere le forze e proseguire il tuo viaggio con rinnovato vigore.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Um momento de alívio com o sol em seu rosto te deixa bem tranquilo e você continua sua jornada com um caminhar mais alegre.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: После небольшой передышки под падающими на лицо лучами солнца вы чувствуете себя отдохнувшим. Вприпрыжку вы продолжаете путешествие.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 陽光灑在臉上使你神清氣爽，在休息片刻後你步履輕盈地繼續旅程。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 햇살이 얼굴에 비치는 평화로운 시간을 보내니 상쾌해진 기분입니다. 당신은 더 힘찬 걸음으로 여행을 계속할 수 있게 되었습니다.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous passez quelques instants réconfortants, le soleil illuminant votre visage, et repartez du bon pied la mine rafraîchie.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Unos minutos de respiro con el sol brillando en tu rostro te dejan con la energía renovada y continúas tu viaje con más vitalidad.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 温暖的阳光撒在脸上，片刻的休息让你感到精力充沛，你接着欢欣地继续踏上旅程。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "日光を浴びながら安らぎのひと時を過ごしたおかげで\nスッキリし、軽やかな足取りで旅を再開することができた。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: Några få ögonblick av tröst då solskenet träffar ditt ansikte lämnar dig mycket återhämtad, och du fortsätter vidare på din resa med ett studs i dina steg.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Parę chwil ukojenia pod słońcem świecącym na twą twarz, zostawia cię całkiem wypoczętym i kontynuujesz swą podróż w lepszym zdrowiu.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: Güneşin altında sakince dinlenmek sana iyi geldi, yenilenmiş bir şekilde yoluna devam ediyorsun.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
