        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: You are refreshed by the sun beaming down on you but while you are resting <style=damage>a strong monster</style> sneaks up on you!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Du fühlst dich von der herabstrahlenden Sonne erfrischt, <style=damage> jedoch überrascht dich ein starkes Monster während du dich ausruhst</style>!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Je wordt verfrist door een lekker zonnetje, maar terwijl je uitrust, besluipt <style=damage>een sterk monster</style> je!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Ti rilassi sotto i caldi raggi del sole, ma mentre riposi un <style=damage>enorme mostro</style> ti sorprende!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você se sente revigorado com o sol batendo em seu rosto, mas <style=damage>um monstro forte</style> se aproximou enquanto você descansava!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Под сияющим солнцем вы чувствуете себя свежее. Но пока вы отдыхали, к вам подкрался <style=damage>сильный монстр</style>!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 陽光浴使你精力充沛，但<style=damage>強大的怪物</style>趁你休息時悄悄來襲。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 얼굴에 비치는 평화로운 햇살 덕에 기분이 상쾌해지긴 했지만, 당신이 쉬는 동안 <style=damage>강한 몬스터</style>가 당신을 덮칩니다!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous vous sentez revigoré par le soleil sur votre visage, mais <style=damage>un puissant monstre</style> vous attaque par surprise pendant votre sommeil !
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Te sientes renovado por el sol brillante, pero mientras estás descansando, ¡<style=damage>un monstruo poderoso</style> te ataca por sorpresa!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 沐浴阳光让你感到精力充沛，但<style=damage>一只强大的怪兽</style>趁你休息时悄然来袭。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "日光浴でスッキリできたのは良かったものの、\n休んでいる合間に背後から<style=damage>強そうなモンスター</style>が忍び寄ってきた！"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: Du är återhämtad av solen som skiner ner på dig, men medans du vilar smyger en stark fiende bakom dig!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Gdy wypoczywasz sobie pod słońcem, podczas drzemki potężny potwór podkrada się do ciebie!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: Güneşin altında dinlenirken gizlice yaklaşan <style=damage>bir canavar</style> sana saldırdı!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
