        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: The woods grow <color=#888888>darker</color> and <color=#666666>darker</color> as you progress, until you find a clearing where it is pouring rain.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: The woods grow <color=#888888>darker</color> and <color=#666666>darker</color> as you progress, until you find a clearing where it is pouring rain.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Der Wald wird <color=#888888>dunkler</color> und <color=#666666>dunkler</color> mit jedem Schritt den du gehst, bis du schließlich eine Lichtung findest, in der es in Strömen regnet.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: De bossen worden <color=#888888>donkerder</color> en <color=#666666>donkerder</color> naarmate je vordert, totdat je een open plek vindt waar de regen met bakken naar beneden komt.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: La foresta si fa <color=#888888>sempre più scura</color> man mano che avanzi, finché non raggiungi una <color=#666666>radura</color> battuta da una pioggia fitta e incessante.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: A Floresta fica mais <color=#888888>escura</color> e<color=#666666> sombria</color> à medida que você avança, até que se depara com uma clareira onde cai uma forte chuva.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Грохочет гром, сверкает молния в <color=#888888>ночи</color>, а на холме стоите вы.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 隨著你往森林深處前進，前路變得<color=#888888>黯淡</color>，越來越<color=#666666>暗</color>，直到你發現一片下著暴雨的空地。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 숲이 점점 <color=#888888>어두워지고</color> <color=#666666>어두워집니다</color>. 당신은 걷던 도중 비가 퍼붓고 있는 빈터에 도착합니다.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Les bois deviennent <color=#888888>de plus en plus sombres</color> à mesure que vous vous enfoncez, jusqu’à ce que vous atteigniez une clairière où la pluie tombe à verse.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: El bosque se vuelve <color=#888888>más</color> y <color=#666666>más oscuro</color> a medida que avanzas, hasta que encuentras un claro donde está lloviendo a cántaros.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 随着你朝树林深处前进，前路变得越来越<color=#666666>暗</color>，你找到了一块正下着暴雨的空地。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "森の中を進むにつれて、辺りが<color=#888888>段々と</color><color=#666666>暗くなる……</color>\nこの暗闇は、雨が降り注ぐ空き地を発見するまで続いた。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: Skogen blir <color=#888888>mörkare</color> och <color=#666666>mörkare</color> ju längre fram du kommer, tills du hittar en skogsglänta där det regnar.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Las robi się <color=#888888>ciemniejszy</color> i <color=#666666>ciemniejszy</color> z każdym krokiem, aż natrafiasz na polanę, gdzie pada deszcz.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: Orman git gide <color=#888888>kararmaya</color> başladı. Biraz ileride sağanak yağmur yağan bir açıklığa geldin.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
