      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: You make it through the clearing unscathed and the weather has already improved... but which way were you going again?
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
