      - title: EventGuid
        value: 501bf1d4-ac76-40ef-8356-d86d4e93eb67
        type: 0
        typeString:
      - title: en
        value: You make it through the clearing unscathed and the weather has already improved... but which way were you going again?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Du schaffst es unbeschadet durch die Lichtung und der Himmel klart schon wieder auf... Aber wo wolltest du doch gleich hin?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Je komt ongeschonden door de open plek en het weer is opgeklaard... maar welke kant ging je ook alweer op?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Riesci ad attraversare la radura incolume e il tempo inizia già a migliorare... ma da che parte stavi andando?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você atravessa a clareira e o clima já até melhorou... mas para onde você estava indo mesmo?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Вы то к лесу мчитесь, то к полю, то к ручью, ведь вы так боитесь молнии. Вы сбежали от непогоды, но где же вы сейчас?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 你毫髮無損地通過了這片空地，天氣也好轉起來，但 ···你跑到哪條路上了？
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 당신은 상처 하나 없이 빈터에서 벗어났고 날씨는 벌써 나아졌지만... 어느 방향으로 가는 중이었더라요?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous traversez la clairière indemne et le temps s’est éclairci... mais quel chemin prendre ?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Consigues atravesar el claro ileso y el tiempo ya ha mejorado... ¿Pero hacia dónde estabas yendo?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 你毫发无损地通过了这片空地，天气也已好转 ······但你接下来该走哪条路呢？
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "なんとか無傷で雷雨をかいくぐり、気づけば天気も良くなっていた。\n……ところで、どっちに行けば良かったっけ？"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: Du klarar det genom gläntan oskadd och vädret har redan blivit bättre... men åt vilket håll gick du igen?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Przebiegasz przez polanę w jednym kawałku, a pogoda już się poprawiła... ale w którą to stronę szedłeś?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: Açıklığı zarar almadan geçtin ve üstündeki kara bulutlar dağıldı... ama hangi yöne gidiyordun acaba?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
