      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: As you walk into the middle of the clearing you are struck by <style=lightning>lightning!</color> You shiver as the energy courses through you but it harmlessly congeals in your satchel in the form of a <style=lightning>[var=orb0]</style>
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: As you walk into the middle of the clearing you are struck by <style=lightning>lightning!</style> You shiver as the energy courses through you but it harmlessly congeals in your satchel in the form of a <style=lightning>[var=orb0]</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Als du dich langsam auf die Mitte der Lichtung zubewegst, wirst du vom <style=lightning>Blitz</style> getroffen! Du schauderst, als die Energie dich durchströmt, aber sie erstarrt vollkommen harmlos in deiner Tasche - in Form eines <style=lightning>[var=orb0]!</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Als je naar het midden van de open plek loopt, word je getroffen door <style=lightning>bliksem!</style> Je huivert terwijl de energie door je heen stroomt, maar het stolt ongevaarlijk in je tas in de vorm van een <style=lightning>[var=orb0]</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Mentre attraversi la radura, <style=lightning>un fulmine ti colpisce</style> improvvisamente! Tremi, mentre l'energia ti attraversa e va ad agglomerarsi nel tuo zaino sotto forma di una <style=lightning>[var=orb0]</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Enquanto você anda pelo meio da clareira, você é atingido por um <style=lightning>raio!</style> Você treme enquanto a energia atravessa seu corpo, mas ela se condensa em sua bolsa na forma de <style=lightning>[var=orb0]</style> sem causar nenhum dano.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: 'Вы, видно, в ссоре с головою. Видно, сам себе вы враг. Надо ж выдумать такое, во дурак! Но вы поймали её в сумку, и сверкает она в ней! Ты так счастлив: стала <style=lightning>молния</style> твоей! <style=lightning>([var=orb0])</style>'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 當你走到空地中央時，被一道<style=lightning>閃電</style>擊中了！你因能量流過而全身顫抖，但閃電不但沒有傷害到你，還在彈珠袋中凝聚成了一顆<style=lightning>[var=orb0]</style>。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 빈터의 중앙으로 걸어간 당신은 <style=lightning>벼락</style>에 맞게 됩니다! 당신은 몸을 타고 내려가는 힘에 몸을 떨지만, 그 힘은 당신을 해치지 않고 그대로 가방 속에 <style=lightning>[var=orb0]</style> 하나로 응축됩니다.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Pendant que vous marchez au milieu de la clairière, vous êtes frappé par un <style=lightning>éclair !</style> Vous tremblez pendant que l’énergie traverse votre corps, mais sans aucune douleur elle vient se compacter dans votre sacoche en prenant la forme d’un <style=lightning>[var=orb0]</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: ¡Cuando entras en el claro te golpea un <style=lightning>rayo</style>! Tiemblas mientras la energía pasa a través de ti, pero no te daña y se condensa en tu bolso en la forma de un <style=lightning>[var=orb0]</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 当你走到空地中央时，被一道<style=lightning>闪电</style>击中了！能量流过全身，你颤抖了一下，但闪电不但没有伤害到你，还在挎包里凝聚成了一个<style=lightning>[var=orb0]</style>。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "空き地を歩いていると突然、君めがけて<style=lightning>雷</style>が落ちてきた！\n電流が全身を駆け巡り、身体がブルブルと震える……！\nしかし幸いなことに、体内を流れたそれは、君に害を及ぼすことなく\nカバンの中で「<style=lightning>[var=orb0]</style>」へと変化していた。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: Medans du går in i mitten av gläntan träffas du av <style=lightning>blixten!</style> Du darrar då energin går igenom dig men den koagulerar harmlöst i din sävk i formen av ett <style=lightning>[var=orb0]</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Gdy podchodzisz do środka polany, zostajesz porażony<style=lightning> piorunem!</style> Drżysz, gdy prąd przenika przez ciebie, lecz ostatecznie energia nieszkodliwie zastyga w twojej torbie w formie<style=lightning> [var=orb0]</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: Açıklığın ortasına geldiğinde devasa bir <style=lightning>yıldırımla çarpıldın!</style> Ürpererek vücudunda dolaşan enerji zararsızca çantanda şekil alıp bir <style=lightning>[var=orb0]</style> oluşturdu.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
