      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: With <style=lightning>lightning-fast reflexes</style> you scatter gold to intercept the lightning and are able to harness its power into your [var=chosenOrb]. Unfortunately the <style=gold>scattered coins</style> have been blasted to <shake>smithereens</shake>, but you've diverted the worst of the strikes and can make your way safely through the clearing.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: With <style=lightning>lightning-fast reflexes</style> you lay a line of coins to intercept the lightning and are able to harness its power into your [var=upgradedOrb]. Unfortunately <style=gold>your coins</style> have been blasted to <shake>smithereens</shake>, but you've diverted the worst of the strikes and can make your way safely through the clearing.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
