    - id: 1
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Pictures
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Description
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "You stumble into a kitchen and are quickly accosted by<style=peglin> a Peglin</style> dressed up as... a human chef? They've crudely attempted to hide their ears and the humans seem to be buying it.\n<wave>\"What are you doing in here?! You're going to blow my cover!\"</wave> they squawk at you. \"Please, <style=objectOfInterest>take this relic I found</style> and get out of here!\""
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: "You stumble into a kitchen and are quickly accosted by<style=peglin> a Peglin</style> dressed up as... a human chef? They've crudely attempted to hide their ears and the humans seem to be buying it.\n<wave>\"What are you doing in here?! You're going to blow my cover!\"</wave> they squawk at you. \"Please, <style=objectOfInterest>take this relic I found</style> and get out of here!\""
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Du stolperst in eine Küche und wirst gleich von <style=peglin>einem Peglin</style> angesprochen. Dieser hat sich als menschlicher Koch verkleidet. Etwas unbeholfen hat er versucht, seine Ohren zu verstecken - die Menschen kaufen es ihm allerdings ab. <wave>"Was machst du hier?! Du lässt meine Tarnung auffliegen!"</wave>, kreischt er in deine Richtung. "Bitte, <style=objectOfInterest>nimm dieses Relikt, das ich gefunden habe</style>, und hau von hier ab!"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: "Je strompelt een keuken binnen en wordt al snel aangesproken door <style=peglin>een Peglin</style> verkleed als... een menselijke kok? Ze hebben enigzins geprobeerd hun oren te verbergen en de mensen lijken het niet door te hebben.\n<wave>\"Wat doe jij hier?! Je gaat mijn dekmantel verpesten!\"</wave> krijsen ze naar je. \"Alsjeblieft, <style=objectOfInterest>neem dit relikwie dat ik heb gevonden</style> en maak dat je wegkomt!\""
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Ti imbatti in una cucina dove ti si avvicina un <style=peglin>Peglin</style> vestito da... chef umano? Ha tentato di coprire le sue orecchie alla bell’e meglio, e gli umani sembrano essersela bevuta. <wave>“Che ci fai qui?! Così farai saltare la mia copertura!”</wave> geme. “Ti prego, <style=objectOfInterest>prendi questa reliquia che ho trovato</style> e vattene di qui!”
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você se encontra dentro de uma cozinha e é logo abordado por <style=peglin>um Peglin</style> disfarçado de... cozinheiro humano? Ele esconde suas orelhas toscamente, mas parece que os humanos não perceberam. <wave>"O que você tá fazendo aqui?! Assim eles vão descobrir!"</wave>, ele grasna. "Por favor, <style=objectOfInterest>toma essa Relíquia que eu achei</style> e dá o fora daqui!"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Вы натыкаетесь на кухню, и вас сразу замечает <style=peglin>пеглин</style>, одетый как... человеческий повар? Он попытался спрятать свои уши под колпаком, и люди, кажется, этого не замечают. <wave>«Что ты тут делаешь?! Ты сейчас меня раскроешь!»</wave>, — кричит он. «Пожалуйста, <style=objectOfInterest>возьми эту реликвию</style> и уходи!»
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: "你誤打誤撞走進了一間廚房，有個像是人類大廚 ···的<style=peglin>哥布林</style>走向了你。他用粗糙的偽裝手法隱藏耳朵，但似乎沒有人類發現。\n<wave>「你來這裡幹嘛？你會害我露餡的！」</wave>他衝著你尖叫怒斥。「求求你，<style=objectOfInterest>拿著這個我找到的遺物</style>然後趕緊離開！」"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: "당신은 어쩌다 한 주방에 들어서게 되고 곧바로 <style=peglin>페글린</style> 중에서도... 인간(?) 요리사의 모습을 한 녀석을 만나게 됩니다. 인간들은 어찌 된 일인지 엉성하게 가린 귀를 보고도 별 생각이 없는 것 같습니다. \n <wave>\"여기서 뭐하는 거야?! 내 변장을 까발릴 셈이야!?\"</wave> 요리사는 당신에게 까악댑니다. \"제발, 이 <style=objectOfInterest>유물</style>을 줄 테니까, 가지고 빨리 사라져!\""
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous arrivez dans une cuisine et êtes rapidement accosté par un <style=peglin>Peglin</style> déguisé en... cuisinier humain ? Il a grossièrement essayé de cacher ses oreilles, mais les humains semblent dupes. <wave>« Que fais-tu ici ?! Tu vas ruiner ma couverture ! »</wave> piaille-t-il. « S’il te plaît, <style=objectOfInterest>prends cette relique que j’ai trouvée</style> et va-t’en d’ici ! »
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Entras en una cocina y te aborda rápidamente <style=peglin>un Peglin</style> disfrazado de ... ¿chef humano? Ha intentado burdamente ocultar sus orejas y los humanos parecen estar creyéndoselo.  <wave>"¡¿Qué haces aquí ?! ¡Me vas a delatar!"</wave>, te grita. "¡Por favor, <style=objectOfInterest>toma esta reliquia que encontré</style> y lárgate de aquí!"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: "你误打误撞地走进一间厨房，一个伪装成 ······人类大厨的<style=peglin>哥布林</style>正向你搭讪？！他用粗劣的手法隐藏起自己的耳朵，而且似乎还未被人类揭穿。\n<wave>“你在这里干嘛呢？你会让我露馅的！”</wave> 他冲你叫道。“求求你，<style=objectOfInterest>拿着这个我找到的遗物</style>然后赶紧离开！”"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "偶然見つけたキッチンに足を運ぶと、人間のシェフ（？）の格好をした\n<style=peglin>ペグリン</style>に突然声をかけられた。彼はとがった耳を荒っぽく隠しながら、\n人間相手に商売をしているらしい。\n\n<wave>「オマエ、そこで何してる？！　オレの正体がバレちゃうだろ！」</wave> \n――君に向かって彼は怒鳴る。\n「<style=objectOfInterest>オレのレリック</style>やるから、とっとと出てってくれ！」"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: Du snubblar in i ett kök och är snabbt bemött av <style=peglin> en Peglin</style> klädd som... en mänsklig kock? De har försökt gömma sina öron grovt och människorna verkar köpa det. <wave>"Vad gör du här inne?! Du kommer blåsa min beklädnad!"</wave> de klagar högt på dig. "Snälla, <style=objectOfInterest>ta den här reliken som jag hittade</style> och stick härifrån!"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Natrafiasz na kuchnię i natychmiast jesteś zaczepiony przez <style=peglin>Peglina</style> przebranego za... ludzkiego kucharza? Niechlujnie starał się ukryć swe uszy, ale wygląda na to, że ludzie to kupili. <wave>”Co ty tutaj robisz?! Zaraz mnie zdemaskujesz!</wave> - skrzeczy na ciebie. "Błagam, <style=objectOfInterest>weź ten relikt, który znalazłem</style> i znikaj stąd!"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: "Bir mutfağa rastladın ve içeride... insan bir şef(???) kılığında <style=peglin> bir Peglin</style> tarafından karşılandın. Onun şef şapkasının içine kabaca saklanmış kulaklarına ve bu numarayı yemiş gibi gözüken insanlara bir bakış attın.\n<wave>\"Burada ne işin var?! Beni ele vereceksin!\"</wave> \"Lütfen, <style=objectOfInterest>bulduğum bu yadigarı al</style> ve burayı terket!\""
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value: "Zakopnete o kuchyňu a vo vnútri vás privíta <style=peglin>Peglin</style> prezlečený za... ľudského kuchára?. Zazreli ste jeho uši, ktoré boli slabo ukryté v kuchárskej čiapke a ľudí, ktorí vyzerali, že si ten trik nevšimli.\n<wave>\"„Čo tu robíš?! Chystáš sa odhaliť moje prestrojenie!\"</wave> kriči na teba. \"Prosím, <style=objectOfInterest>vezmite si túto relikviu, ktorú som našiel</style> a vypadnite odtiaľto!\""
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
