        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: You are able to sneak out through the nearest door and you leave the other Peglin to its business.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Du schaffst es, dich durch die nächste Tür herauszuschleichen und störst den anderen Peglin nicht weiter bei seinen Angelegenheiten.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Het lukt je om door de dichtstbijzijnde deur naar buiten te sluipen en je laat de andere Peglin met rust.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Sgattaiola fuori dalla prima porta che incontri e lascia il Peglin alle sue faccende.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você consegue se esgueirar pela porta mais próxima e deixa o outro Peglin com seus afazeres.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Вы смогли тихо скрыться через ближайшую дверь, оставив другого пеглина при своих делах.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 你從最近的一道門溜走，讓哥布林做他的大廚夢。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 당신은 가까운 출구를 찾아 페글린이 알아서 할 수 있도록 조용히 빠져나갑니다.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous réussissez à vous en aller et laissez l’autre Peglin à ses affaires.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Consigues salir sigilosamente por la puerta más cercana y dejas que el otro Peglin siga con lo suyo.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 你从最近的大门悄悄离开，让哥布林忙自己的事。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "君は、シェフペグリンの商売をジャマすることなく、\n近くにあるドアからこっそりと抜け出した。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: Du lyckas smyga ut genom närmaste dörr och du lämnar den andra Peglinen till sitt.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Zdołałeś wykraść się przez najbliższe drzwi i zostawiłeś Peglina w spokoju.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: En yakın kapıdan dikkat çekmeden çıktın ve diğer Peglini kendi haline bıraktın.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value: Môžete sa vykradnúť cez najbližšie dvere a nechať druhého Peglina, aby sa mu venoval.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
