      - title: pt-BR
        value: Fai la spia e rivela l'identità dello chef
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Dedurar o cozinheiro Peglin.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Раскрыть повара-пеглина
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 揭發哥布林大廚
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 페글린 요리사의 정체를 폭로하기
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
