    - id: 5
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Pictures
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Description
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: You yell to reveal the chef's secret and the humans look truly surprised. Unfortunately for you the chef's time in the kitchen has made them faster than you. They get away <style=damage>and the humans catch you instead!</style>
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: You yell to reveal the chef's secret and the humans look truly surprised. Unfortunately for you the chef's time in the kitchen has made them faster than you. They get away <style=damage>and the humans catch you instead!</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Du schreist, um das Geheimnis des Kochs zu enthüllen - die Menschen sind sichtlich überrascht. Pech für dich, dass der Koch während seiner Zeit in der Küche schneller geworden ist als du. Er kommt weg <style=damage>und die Menschen fangen stattdessen dich!</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Je schreeuwt het uit om het geheim van de chef te verklappen en de mensen kijken echt verrast. Helaas voor jou heeft de tijd van chef-kok in de keuken hun sneller gemaakt dan jij. Ze ontsnappen <style=damage>en in plaats van hun pakken de mensen jou!</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Ti sgoli per rivelare il segreto dello chef; gli umani appaiono sinceramente stupiti. Purtroppo per te, il tempo trascorso in cucina ha reso lo chef più veloce di te. Riesce a scappare <style=damage>e gli umani catturano te al suo posto!</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você grita para revelar o segredo do cozinheiro e os humanos parecem realmente surpresos. Infelizmente para você, sua experiência na cozinha deixou o outro Peglin muito mais rápido. Ele foge <style=damage>enquanto os humanos te capturam!</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Вы начинаете кричать и показывать на повара пальцем. Люди в ресторане удивленно смотрят в вашу сторону. Увы, но повар оказался быстрее. Он убежал, и вместо него <style=damage>люди поймали вас!</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 你大聲揭發了大廚的秘密，人類大吃一驚。不幸的是，熟悉廚房的哥布林大廚早你一步逃離現場，而<style=damage>人類抓住了你！</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 당신은 크게 소리를 질러 페글린 요리사의 정체를 폭로했고, 인간들은 진심으로 놀란 것 같습니다. 안타깝게도, 주방에서 일을 하던 페글린 요리사는 몸이 재빨랐습니다. 페글린 요리사는 탈출했고, <style=damage>대신 당신이 잡혀버렸습니다!</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous hurlez pour révéler le secret du cuistot et les humains semblent très surpris. Malheureusement pour vous, le temps passé par le cuistot en cuisine l’a rendu plus rapide que vous. Il s’échappe et <style=damage>les humains vous attrapent à sa place !</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Gritas para revelar el secreto del chef y los humanos parecen realmente sorprendidos. Desafortunadamente para ti, el tiempo que lleva el chef en la cocina lo ha hecho más rápido que tú. Se escapa, <style=damage>¡y los humanos te atrapan a ti en su lugar!</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 你大声揭发了哥布林大厨的伪装，人类大吃一惊。不幸的是，哥布林大厨比你更加熟悉厨房。他先行一步逃离了厨房，而<style=damage>人们抓住了你！</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "食堂に飛び出してシェフのヒミツを声高に叫ぶと、\n人間達はそれを聞いて心底驚きながら君に視線を向けた。\n\n……しかし残念なことに、キッチンで逃げ支度をすませていた\nシェフペグリン達は既にその場からとんずらしていた！\nそして今、<style=damage>大声をあげた君を捕まえるべく、人間達が襲いかかる！</style>"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: Du ropar för att avslöja kockens hemlighet och människorna ser verkligen förvånade ut. Otur för dig, kockens tid i köket har gjort dem snabbare än dig. De springer därifrån <style=damage>och människorna fångar dig istället!</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Krzyknąłeś, aby ujawnić sekret kucharza, a ludzie wydają się doprawdy zaskoczeni. Pechowo dla ciebie, czas spędzony w kuchni sprawił, że kucharz jest szybszy od ciebie. On uciekł,<style=damage> a ludzie łapią ciebie!</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: Şefin sırrını bağırarak açıkladın ve insanları şok içinde bıraktın. Ne yazık ki şefin mutfakta geçirdiği zaman onu senden daha atik yapmış. Şefi ellerinden kaçıran insanlar <style=damage>onun yerine seni yakaladı!</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
