      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: '<style=peglin>The Peglin</style> happily snatches the egg from your hands, and returns surprisingly quickly with a freshly baked cake!'
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: '<style=peglin>Egglin</style> joyously snatches the egg from your hands, and returns surprisingly quickly with a freshly baked cake!'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: '<style=peglin>Le Peglin</style> vous retire avec joie l’œuf des mains et revient presque immédiatement avec un gâteau fraîchement cuit !'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: '<style=peglin>Cheflin</style> te arrebata alegremente el huevo de las manos ¡y regresa en un santiamén con un pastel recién horneado!'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: '<style=peglin>Der Peglin</style> ist hocherfreut, als er sich das Ei schnappt - und er kehrt erstaunlich schnell mit einem frisch gebackenen Kuchen zurück!'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: '<style=peglin>De Peglin</style> grist het ei vrolijk uit je handen en komt verrassend snel terug met een versgebakken taart!'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: '<style=peglin>Cuochin</style> ti strappa allegramente l''uovo dalle mani e torna sorprendentemente in fretta, con una torta appena sfornata!'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: '<style=peglin>O Peglin</style> rapidamente pega o ovo de suas mãos com um sorriso no rosto, e retorna rapidamente com um bolo que acabou de ser assado!'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: '<style=peglin>Пеглин</style> радостно выхватывает яйцо у вас из рук и на удивление быстро возвращается со свежеиспеченным пирогом!'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: '<style=peglin>哥布林</style>兴奋地从你手中抢过鸟蛋，过了一会，他拿来了一个新鲜出炉的蛋糕。'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: '<style=peglin>哥布林大廚</style>痛快地從你手中搶過鳥蛋，不一會兒就帶著一個新鮮出爐的蛋糕回來！'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "<style=peglin>シェフペグリン</style>は大喜びしながら、君の手から\n「タマゴ」をもぎ取ってキッチンに駆け込むやいなや、\n『<style=objectOfInterest>焼きたてのケーキ</style>』を持って舞い戻ってきた！"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: '<style=peglin>에그린</style>은 재밌다는 듯이 당신의 손에서 달걀을 뺏어가더니, 놀랄 만한 속도로 빠르게 갓 구운 케이크를 가지고 돌아옵니다!'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: '<style=peglin>Peglin</style> z chęcią wyrywa jajko z twych rąk i wraca niespodziewanie szybko ze świeżo upieczonym ciastem!'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: '<style=peglin>Peglin</style> mutluca elinden yumurtayı kapıveriyor ve sana taze pişmiş bir pasta veriyor!'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
