    - id: 1
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Pictures
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Description
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: You find something faintly glinting in a dark corridor as you walk- you pick it up and quickly stuff it into your satchel. On further inspection, it appears you've found an <style=crystal>Oreb Lvl. 1</style>.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: As you walk along a darker corridor a shiny gleam catches your eye. Your <style=peglin>little peglin hands</style> dart out outside your control and you instinctively shove it into your satchel. On further inspection, it appears you've found an <style=crystal>Oreb Lvl. 1</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Während du läufst, siehst du ein schwach glitzerndes Objekt in einem dunkleren Gang - du nimmst es an dich und packst es schnell in deine Tasche. Nach näherer Betrachtung erkennst du, dass du ein <style=crystal>Erzorb Lvl. 1</style> gefunden hast!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Je ziet iets glinsteren tijdens het lopen door een donkere gang, je pakt het op en stopt het snel in je schoudertas. Bij nadere inspectie lijkt het erop dat je een <style=crystal>Ertspellet Lvl. 1</style> hebt gevonden.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Mentre cammini, trovi qualcosa che luccica debolmente in un corridoio buio; lo raccogli e lo metti rapidamente nel tuo zaino. Dopo un'ulteriore ispezione, sembra che tu abbia trovato una <style=crystal>Cristallosfera di livello 1</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Enquanto avança, você encontra algo brilhando fracamente em um corredor escuro. Você pega e rapidamente enfia dentro da sua bolsa. Olhando mais de perto, percebe ter encontrado um <style=crystal>Geodorbe Nvl. 1</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Вы находите что-то слабо светящееся в темном коридоре. Проходя мимо, вы подбираете это и быстро кладете в сумку. После дальнейшего исследования оказалось, что вы нашли <style=crystal>Шаруду (Ур. 1)</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 你行經一段幽暗長廊時，發現一個微微閃爍的東西，你迅速撿起來塞進背包裡。仔細檢查後原來是一顆<style=crystal>礦晶彈珠 Lv1</style>。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 길을 걷던 중, 어두운 공간 속에서 뭔가가 반짝입니다. 당신은 그것을 재빨리 집어 가방 속에 넣었습니다. 자세히 살펴보니, <style=crystal>돌멩이? 레벨 1</style>을 찾은 것 같군요.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Alors que vous marchez, vous remarquez quelque chose qui brille légèrement au détour d’un couloir sombre ; vous le ramassez et le rangez rapidement dans votre sacoche. Après inspection, il semblerait que vous ayez trouvé un <style=crystal>Cristorbe Niv. 1</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: A medida que avanzas, encuentras algo que brilla débilmente en un pasillo oscuro; lo recoges y lo guardas rápidamente en tu bolso. Al inspeccionarlo, te das cuenta de que has encontrado un <style=crystal>Minorberal Nvl.1</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 你在行经一段幽暗长廊时，发现一个微微闪光的东西，你把它迅速捡起来塞进挎包。检查一番后，原来是一个<style=crystal>矿石弹珠（ 1 级）</style>。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "暗い廊下を歩いていると、足元でかすかに光るモノを見つけたので、\n君はそれを急いでカバンにしまった。後でくわしく調べたところ、\nそれは「<style=crystal>原石のオーブ（Lv1）</style>」であることが分かった。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: Du hittar någonting som glimtar lite i en mörkare korridor då du passerar- du plockar upp den och hastigt stoppar ned den i din säck. Vid ytterligare inspektion verkar det som att du har hittat ett <style=crystal>Malmklot Lvl. 1</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Idąc mroczniejszym korytarzem, spostrzegasz błyszczący przedmiot - podnosisz go i szybko chowasz do swojego worka. Po bliższym spojrzeniu, okazuje się, że znalazłeś <style=crystal>Rudę Kulek Pz. 1</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: Karanlık koridorun bir köşesinde hafifçe parlayan bir şey gördün -ve hemen çantana attın. Tekrardan ışığa döndüğünde bulduğun şeyin <style=crystal>Maden Topu Svy. 1</style> olduğunu anladın.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
