    - id: 5
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Pictures
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Description
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: The brick slime crunches the stones to dust, lets out a satisfied grunt, and then returns to its slumber. You continue on your way.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: The old Brick Slimebox crunches the Pebballs to dust, lets out a satisfied grunt, and then returns to its slumber. You continue on your way.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: La gelée de brique dévore les cailloux, ne laissant que de la poussière. Elle laisse échapper un grognement de satisfaction puis se rendort. Vous continuez votre chemin.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: La vieja Babacaja de Ladrillo convierte los Guijarros en polvo, suelta un gruñido de satisfacción y vuelve a su letargo. Continúas tu camino.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Der Ziegelschleim zermalmt genüsslich die Steine, die du ihm gegeben hast, grunzt zufrieden und verfällt dann wieder in seinen sanften Schlummer. Du setzt deinen Weg fort.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Het baksteenslijm vermaalt de stenen tot stof, laat een tevreden grom horen en valt dan weer in slaap. Je vervolgt je weg.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Il vecchio Melmattone sgranocchia le Sassosfere in un baleno, emette un grugnito soddisfatto, e se ne torna a dormire. Tu prosegui finalmente per la tua strada.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: A geleca-tijolo tritura os Cascalhorbes, solta um grunhido de satisfação e volta a dormir. Você toma o seu rumo.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Коробка слизней съедает камни с удовольствием и громкой отрыжкой и возвращается к себе в «постель». Вы идете дальше.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 砖头史莱姆把弹珠嚼碎成灰，发出了一声满意的咕噜声，然后又回到了睡梦中。你则继续赶路。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 方磚史萊姆把圓石彈珠嚼碎成粉，發出一聲滿意的咕嚕聲後就轉身繼續睡覺。而你繼續上路。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "レンガスライムは、渡した<style=stone>石ころ</style>をボリボリと食べ砕き、\n上機嫌なうなり声をあげながら眠りについた……先を急ごう。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 오래된 벽돌 슬라임박스가 펩볼을 먼지나게 씹어먹은 후, 만족스럽게 골골대다가 다시 잠들었습니다. 당신은 계속 갈 길을 갑니다.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: Tegelstensslimen krossar stenarna till pulver, grymter belåtet och går sedan tillbaka till söms. Du fortsätter på din väg.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Ceglany szlam miażdży kulki na pył, odchrząkuje usatysfakcjonowany, a potem powraca do swej drzemki. Kontynuujesz swą podróż.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: Balçıkçık zevkle taşları mideye indirdi, mutlulukla mırıldandı ve uykusuna geri döndü. Sen de tekrar yola koyuldun.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value: Tehlový sliz rozdrví kamene na prach, vydá spokojné chrochtanie a potom sa vráti do spánku. Pokračujte v ceste.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
