      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: You easily make it away from the tired old Brick Slimebox.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous vous éloignez facilement de la vieille gelée de brique fatiguée.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Fácilmente te alejas de la vieja Babacaja de Ladrillo.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Du kannst ganz einfach vor dem müden, alten Ziegelschleim weglaufen.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Je komt gemakkelijk weg van het vermoeide oude baksteenslijm.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Ti allontani facilmente dal vecchio e stanco Melmattone.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você facilmente conseguiu fugir da velha e cansada Gelecaixa de Tijolos.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Вы легко отрываетесь от усталой старой коробки слизней.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 你轻易地从那块疲惫的砖头史莱姆手下逃走了。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 你輕易地逃離那塊疲倦的方磚史萊姆。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: くたびれたレンガスライムから逃げるのは、造作もないことだった。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 당신은 낡고 지친 벽돌 슬라임박스로부터 쉽게 도망칠 수 있었습니다.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: Du smiter enkelt iväg från den trötta och gamla tegelstens slimen.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Z łatwością wymykasz się starszemu, zmęczonemu ceglanemu szlamowi.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: Yorgun ve yaşlı tuğla balçıkçığından kolaylıkla kaçtın.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value: Ľahko sa dostanete preč z unaveného starého tehlového slizu.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
