        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: You're able to lure the bricks into a tight spot where they smash themselves against each other. However while protecting yourself from the shrapnel you end up catching <style=stone>[var=orb0]</style>, <style=stone>[var=orb1]</style>, and <style=stone>[var=orb2]</style>.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: You're able to lure the bricks into a tight spot where they smash themselves against each other. However while protecting yourself from the shrapnel you end up catching <style=stone>[var=orb0]</style>, <style=stone>[var=orb1]</style>, and <style=stone>[var=orb2]</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous arrivez à attirer les briques dans un lieu étroit où elles se cognent les unes sur les autres. Pendant ce temps, vous vous protégez des éclats et vous finissez par ramasser <style=stone>[var=orb0]</style>, <style=stone>[var=orb1]</style> et <style=stone>[var=orb2]</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Logras atraer a los ladrillos a un lugar estrecho en el que se aplastan unos contra otros. Mientras te proteges de la metralla acabas atrapando <style=stone>[var=orb0]</style>, <style=stone>[var=orb1]</style>, y <style=stone>[var=orb2]</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Du schaffst es, die Ziegelschleime in eine Ecke zu locken, in der sie sich gegenseitig zerschmettern. Um dich vor den Einschlagsplittern zu verteidigen, fängst du allerdings letztlich ein <style=stone>[var=orb0]</style>, ein <style=stone>[var=orb1]</style> sowie ein <style=stone>[var=orb2]</style> auf.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Je bent in staat om de bakstenen naar een krappe plek te lokken waar ze zichzelf verpletteren. Maar terwijl je jezelf tegen het rondvliegend puin beschermt, vang je uiteindelijk <style=stone>[var=orb0]</style>, <style=stone>[var=orb1]</style> en <style=stone>[var= orb2]</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Riesci ad attirare i Melmattoni in un angolo, dove iniziano a colpirsi l’un l’altro. Tuttavia, mentre ti ripari dalle schegge, subisci i colpi di <style=stone>[var=orb0]</style>, <style=stone>[var=orb1]</style> e <style=stone>[var=orb2]</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você foi capaz de atrair os tijolos a um local fechado onde eles se esmagaram uns contra os outros. No entanto, ao se proteger dos estilhaços você acaba apanhando <style=stone>[var=orb0]</style>, <style=stone>[var=orb1]</style>, e <style=stone>[var=orb2]</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Вам удается заманить коробки слизней в узкое место, где они разбиваются друг об друга. Уворачиваясь от осколков, вы ловите <style=stone>[var=orb0]</style>, <style=stone>[var=orb1]</style> и <style=stone>[var=orb2]</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 你成功引诱砖头史莱姆到了一个狭窄的角落，它们乱作一团把自己砸得稀碎。你在保护自己免受碎屑击中时意外获得了<style=stone>[var=orb0]</style>、<style=stone>[var=orb1]</style>和<style=stone>[var=orb2]</style>。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 你成功將方磚史萊姆們引誘到一個狹窄的角落，它們互相碰撞把自己砸成稀巴爛。你在擋住碎屑時，意外獲得<style=stone>[var=orb0]</style>、<style=stone>[var=orb1]</style>和 <style=stone>[var=orb2]</style>。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "レンガスライム達を狭い場所に誘い込み、\n互いをぶつけ合うことに成功した！\n君は、砕け散るレンガスライムの破片から身を守りながら\n「<style=stone>[var=orb0]</style>」、「<style=stone>[var=orb1]</style>」、「<style=stone>[var=orb2]</style>」を\nガシっとキャッチした。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 당신이 속인 벽돌들은 좁은 공간으로 이끌리고 서로 부딪쳐 부스러집니다. 날아오는 파편을 피하며 당신은 <style=stone>[var=orb0]</style>, <style=stone>[var=orb1]</style>, 그리고 <style=stone>[var=orb2]</style>를 얻게 됩니다.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: Du är skicklig när du lurar tegelstenarna in i ett hörn där de hoppar in i varandra. Dock flyger splitter in i dina händer när du skyddar digsjälv. Du lyckas fånga <style=stone>[var=orb0]</style>, <style=stone>[var=orb1]</style>, och <style=stone>[var=orb2]</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Byłeś w stanie zwabić cegły w ciasne miejsce, gdzie porozbijały się o siebie. Podczas gdy chroniłeś się przed odłamkami, zdołałeś wyłapać <style=stone>[var=orb0]</style>, <style=stone>[var=orb1]</style> i <style=stone>[var=orb2]</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: Tuğlaları dar bir yere sıkıştırıp kendi kendilerini parçalamalarını sağladın. Ayrıca kendini kopan parçalardan korurken <style=stone>[var=orb0]</style>, <style=stone>[var=orb1]</style>, ve <style=stone>[var=orb2]</style> yakaladın.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value: Podarilo sa vám nalákať tehly na tesné miesto, kde sa o seba lámali. Kým ste sa chránili pred úlomkami, podarilo sa vám chytiť <style=stone>[var=orb0]</style>, <style=stone>[var=orb1]</style>, a <style=stone>[var=orb2]</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
