      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: In the woods you find a clearing with a <style=objectOfInterest>strange tree</style> directly in the center. There is a nook in the trunk with <style=bramble>brambles</style> twisting wildly out of it.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: In the woods you find a clearing with a <style=objectOfInterest>strange tree</style> directly in the center. There is a nook in the trunk with <style=bramble>brambles</style> twisting wildly out of it.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Im Wald findest du eine Lichtung mit einem <style=objectOfInterest>seltsamen Baum</style> ganz in der Mitte. Im Stamm ist ein Loch, aus dem <style=bramble>wilde Dornen</style> herausranken.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: In het bos vind je een open plek met een <style=objectOfInterest>vreemde boom</style> precies in het midden. Er zit een gat in de stam waar <style=bramble>bramentakken</style> verwilderd uitgroeien.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Nel bosco, ti imbatti in una radura con uno <style=objectOfInterest>strano albero</style> proprio al centro. C'è un buco nel tronco, con <style=bramble>rovi</style> aggrovigliati che ne fuoriescono.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Na Floresta, você encontra uma clareira com uma <style=objectOfInterest>árvore estranha</style> bem no centro. Há um buraco no tronco com <style=bramble>espinhos</style> se retorcendo loucamente para fora.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: В лесу вы находите поляну со <style=objectOfInterest>странным деревом</style> прямо по центру. В стволе вы замечаете дупло, заросшее дико извивающимися <style=bramble>колючками</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 在樹林深處你找到了一塊的空地，中央聳立著一棵<style=objectOfInterest>奇怪的樹</style>。一些<style=bramble>荊棘</style>從它的樹洞裡蔓延出來。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 당신은 숲 속에서 <style=objectOfInterest>이상한 나무</style>가 정중앙에 있는 빈터를 발견합니다. 나무의 껍질에는 구멍이 있는데, <style=bramble>가시덤불</style>이 속에서 마구 쏟아져 나오듯 자라고 있습니다.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Dans les bois, vous trouvez une clairière avec un <style=objectOfInterest>arbre étrange</style> en son centre. Il y a un trou dans le tronc avec des <style=bramble>sarments</style> qui en sortent.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: En el bosque encuentras un claro con un <style=objectOfInterest>árbol extraño</style> justo en el centro. Hay un agujero en el tronco de donde sale un manojo de <style=bramble>zarzas</style> retorcidas.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 你在树林深处找到了一块空地，中间耸立着一棵<style=objectOfInterest>奇怪的树</style>。<style=bramble>荆棘</style>从树洞里扭曲蔓延出来。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "森の中を進んでいると、大きく開けた空き地を発見した。\nその中央には、<style=objectOfInterest>奇妙な木</style>がどっしりと生えている。\n木の方に近づいてよーく見てみると、\nその幹には大きなくぼみがポッカリと空いており、\nそこから<style=bramble>トゲだらけのツタ</style>が荒々しく根を伸ばしている。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: I skogen hittar du ett fält med ett <style=objectOfInterest>underligt träd</style> precis i mitten. Det finns ett hål i trädstammen med <style=bramble>törnbuskar</style> som vrider sig vilt.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: W lesie natrafiasz na polanę z <style=objectOfInterest>dziwnym drzewem</style> stojącym na środku. Na pniu znajduje się dziura z dziwacznie powykręcanymi <style=bramble>cierniami</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: Ormanın içinde, tam ortasında <style=objectOfInterest>garip bir ağaç</style> olan bir açıklığa rastladın. Ağacın gövdesinde, içinden <style=bramble>dikenli çalılar</style> fışkıran bir oluk var.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
