    - id: 3
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Pictures
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Description
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: You reach into the nook, which has been overgrown with rampant brambles! <style=damage>You suffer minor scratches</style>, and a <style=bramble>[var=orb0]</style> is stuck to your hand when you pull it back. Hopefully it will come in handy.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: You reach into the nook, which has been overgrown with rampant brambles! <style=damage>You suffer minor scratches</style>, and a <style=bramble>[var=orb0]</style> is stuck to your hand when you pull it back. Hopefully it will come in handy.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Du greifst in das Loch, das mit widerspenstigen Dornen überwachsen ist. Du kriegst <style=damage>ein paar Kratzer ab</style> und ein <style=bramble>[var=orb0]</style> hakt an deiner Hand, als du sie wieder hinausziehst. Hoffentlich wird es dir noch nützlich werden.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Je reikt in het gat dat dicht begroeid is met bramentakken! Je voelt dat je <style=damage>lichte krassen</style> hebt opgelopen en als je je hand terugtrekt zie je dat er een <style=bramble>[var=orb0]</style> aan je hand vast zit. Hopelijk komt het van pas.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Rovisti nel buco, che è stato invaso da rovi rampicanti! <style=damage>Ti fai qualche graffietto</style>, e quando tiri fuori la mano ti ritrovi con una <style=bramble>[var=orb0]</style> . Potrebbe tornarti utile.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você coloca a mão no buraco espinhoso! <style=damage>Eles te causam pequenos arranhões</style> e um <style=bramble>[var=orb0]</style> se prende na sua mão ao tirá-la do buraco. Tomara que seja útil...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Вы суете руку прямо в колючки! <style=damage>Получив мелкие царапины</style>, вы вытаскиваете из дупла <style=bramble>[var=orb0]</style>, который зацепился за вашу руку! Скорее всего, он вам пригодится.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 你把手伸進長滿荊棘的樹洞裡！<style=damage>你被劃了幾道傷口</style>而痛得縮手，一顆<style=bramble>[var=orb0]</style>就刺在手上。希望它能派上用場。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 당신은 가시덤불이 마구잡이로 자라난 구멍에 손을 집어넣습니다! <style=damage>손에 가벼운 상처를 입었지만</style>, 손을 빼니 <style=bramble>[var=orb0]</style>이 달라붙어 있었습니다. 쓸모가 있기를 바라야겠군요.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous plongez les mains dans le trou plein de sarments ! <style=damage>Vous vous égratignez</style>, et un <style=bramble>[var=orb0]</style> se coince dans votre main quand vous l’en retirez. Espérons que ça servira.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: ¡Metes la mano en el agujero que ha sido invadido por zarzas silvestres! <style=damage>Sufres pequeños arañazos</style>, y un <style=bramble>[var=orb0]</style> se te pega a la mano cuando la retiras. Con suerte te será útil.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 你把手伸进长满了荆棘的树洞里！<style=damage>你被刺划出了几道伤口</style>，当你缩回手时，一个<style=bramble>[var=orb0]</style>就刺在手上。希望这颗弹珠能派上用场。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "ツタが荒々しく伸びるくぼみの中に手を伸ばす！\n\n少しばかり傷を負ったものの、手を引っ込めると\n「<style=bramble>[var=orb0]</style>」がくっついてきた。\nこれはきっと、何かの役に立つだろう。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: Du når in i hålet, som har blivit överväxt av vildvuxna törnbuskar. <style=damage>Du lider av små skråmor</style>, och en <style=bramble>[var=orb0]</style> är fast i din hand när du drar ut den. Förhoppningsvist kommer den till nytta.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Sięgasz do dziury, która w środku została przerośnięta ciernistymi pnączami! <style=damage>Zadrapałeś się trochę</style> i <style=bramble>[var=orb0]</style> wbiła ci się w dłoń, gdy ją wyciągałeś. Miejmy nadzieję, że się przyda.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: Dikenli çalılarla dolu oluğun içine uzandın. <style=damage>Ufak tefek çiziklerle kurtuldun</style> ve elini geri çektiğinde eline takılmış bir <style=bramble>[var=orb0]</style> buldun. Belki bir gün işine yarar.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      conversationID: 13
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor:
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: Block
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks: []
      conditionsString:
      userScript:
