    - id: 7
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Pictures
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Description
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: You shake the tree with all your might and from somewhere high in the boughs <style=egg>an egg</style> shakes loose! You are able to save it by catching it in your satchel.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: You shake the tree with all your might and from somewhere high in the boughs <style=egg>an egg</style> shakes loose! You are able to save it by catching it in your satchel.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous secouez l’arbre de toutes vos forces et <style=egg>un œuf</style> tombe des branches les plus hautes ! Vous parvenez à l’attraper au vol avec votre sacoche.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Sacudes el árbol con todas tus fuerzas y de algún lugar en lo alto de las ramas se desprende <style=egg>un huevo</style>. Consigues evitar que se rompa atajándolo con tu bolso.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Du schüttelst den Baum mit all deiner Kraft und von irgendwo hoch in den Zweigen löst sich <style=egg>ein Ei!</style> Du fängst es behutsam mit deiner Tasche auf.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Je schudt de boom uit alle macht en vanuit ergens hoog in de takken schudt <style=egg>een ei</style> los! Je kunt het redden door het in je schoudertas op te vangen.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Scuoti l'albero con tutta la tua forza e da qualche parte, lassù tra i rami ,<style=egg>un uovo</style> viene giù! Lo salvi catturandolo al volo con lo zaino.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você chacoalha a árvore com toda sua força, e do alto <style=egg>um ovo</style> cai! Você consegue salvá-lo com sua bolsa.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Вы трясете дерево со всей силы, и откуда-то с верхних веток срывается <style=egg>яйцо</style>! Вам удается подставить сумку и спасти его.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 你用尽全力去摇晃树干，树枝高处的<style=egg>一个鸟蛋</style>掉落下来！你用挎包接住了它。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 你用盡全力去搖晃樹幹，樹枝高處的<style=egg>鳥蛋</style>掉了下來！你用彈珠袋接住了它。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "全力で木を揺らすと、高枝から「<style=egg>タマゴ</style>」が落ちてきた！\n君はなんとかそれをキャッチし、カバンにしまいこんだ。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 온 힘을 다해서 나무를 흔들었더니 높은 나뭇가지 어딘가에서 <style=egg>알</style>이 하나 떨어졌습니다! 당신은 다행히 알을 가방으로 받아냈습니다.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: 'Du skakar trädet med all din styrka och från någonstans högt i grenarna skakas <style=egg>ett ägg</style> ner. Du lyckas rädda den genom att fånga den i din säck. '
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Potrząsasz drzewem z całej swojej siły, a gdzieś z górnych gałęzi wypada <style=egg>jajko</style>! Udało ci się je uratować, łapiąc je do swej torby.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: Bütün gücünle ağacı salladın ve yukarıda bir yerden <style=egg>bir yumurta</style> düşürdün! Yumurtayı çantanla yakalamayı başardın.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value: Zo všetkých síl zatrasiete stromom a odniekiaľ vysoko z konároch sa uvoľní <style=egg>vajce</style>! Môžete ho zachrániť tak, že ho chytíte do tašky.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
