    - id: 9
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Pictures
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Description
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: You reach into the nook, which has been overgrown with rampant brambles! <style=objectOfInterest>Your Gardener's Gloves keep your little hands safe</style>, and you claim a <style=bramble>[var=orb0]</style> from the nook.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: You reach into the nook, which has been overgrown with rampant brambles! <style=objectOfInterest>Your Gardener's Gloves keep your little hands safe</style>, and you claim a <style=bramble>[var=orb0]</style> from the nook.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Du greifst in das Loch, das mit widerspenstigen Dornen überwachsen ist. <style=objectOfInterest>Deine Handschuhe des Gärtners schützen deine kleinen Händchen</style> und du ergatterst ein <style=bramble>[var=orb0]</style> aus dem Loch.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Je reikt in het gat dat dicht begroeid is met bramentakken! <style=objectOfInterest>Je Tuinhandschoenen beschermen je kleine handjes</style>, en je claimt een <style=bramble>[var=orb0]</style> uit het gat.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Rovisti nel buco, che è stato invaso da rovi rampicanti! <style=objectOfInterest>I tuoi Guanti da giardiniere tengono le tue preziose mani al sicuro</style>, e riesci a estrarre una <style=bramble>[var=orb0]</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você coloca a mão no buraco espinhoso! <style=objectOfInterest>Suas Luvas de Jardinagem mantém suas mãos seguras</style>, e você consegue um <style=bramble>[var=orb0]</style> do buraco.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Вы суете руку прямо в колючки! <style=objectOfInterest>Перчатки садовника защищают ваши маленькие ручки </style>, и вы достаете из дупла <style=bramble>[var=orb0]</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 你把手伸進長滿荊棘的樹洞裡！所幸<style=objectOfInterest>園藝手套護住了你的小手</style>，你還從樹洞中掏出了一顆<style=bramble>[var=orb0]</style>。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 당신은 가시덤불이 마구잡이로 자라난 구멍에 손을 집어넣습니다! <style=objectOfInterest>정원사의 장갑이 당신의 작은 손을 보호해줬고</style>, 당신은 구멍에서 <style=bramble>[var=orb0]</style>을 얻었습니다.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous tendez la main dans le recoin, qui a été envahi par des sarments rampants ! <style=objectOfInterest>Vos Gants de jardinier protègent vos petites mains</style>, et vous récupérez un <style=bramble>[var=orb0]</style> du recoin.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: ¡Metes la mano en el agujero que ha sido invadido por zarzas silvestres! <style=objectOfInterest>Tus Guantes de Jardinero mantienen tus manitos a salvo</style> mientras extraes un <style=bramble>[var=orb0]</style> del agujero.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 你把手伸进了树洞，里面已经荆棘丛生！<style=objectOfInterest>所幸园艺手套护住了你的小手</style>，你还从树洞中掏出了一个<style=bramble>[var=orb0]</style>。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "ツタが荒々しく伸びるくぼみの中に手を伸ばす！\n\n……でも大丈夫！\n両手にはめていた『<style=objectOfInterest>園芸師の手袋</style>』のおかげで\n<style=objectOfInterest>怪我をせずにすんだし</style>、中に入っていた\n「<style=bramble>[var=orb0]</style>」を安全に取り出すことができた！"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: Du når in i hålet, som har blivit överväxt av vildvuxna törnbuskar. <style=objectOfInterest> Dina Trädgårdsmästarens Handskar gör dig oskadd</style>, och du tar ut en <style=bramble>[var=orb0]</style> från hålet.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Sięgasz do dziury, która w środku została przerośnięta ciernistymi pnączami! <style=objectOfInterest>Rękawice Ogrodnika ochroniły twoje małe dłonie</style> i wyciągnąłeś<style=bramble>[var=orb0]</style> z dziury.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: Dikenli çalılarla dolu oluğun içine uzandın. <style=objectOfInterest>Bahçıvan Eldivenlerin minnak ellerini korudu</style>, ve sen oluktan bir <style=bramble>[var=orb0]</style> aldın.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value: Siahnete do kúta, ktorý je zarastený bujnou ostružinou! <style=objectOfInterest>Vaše záhradnícke rukavice udržia vaše malé ručičky v bezpečí</style> a vy z kúta získate <style=bramble>[var=orb0]</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
