        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: Haglin takes your <style=loseOrb>[var=chosenOrb]</style> and tosses it into their own satchel, and then pulls out a <style=upgradeOrb>[var=upgradedOrb]</style>. You're not entirely convinced that they didn't just replace your orb, but either way you're impressed!
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: Haglin takes your <style=loseOrb>[var=chosenOrb]</style> and tosses it into their own satchel, and then pulls out a new <style=upgradeOrb>[var=upgradedOrb]</style>. You're not entirely convinced that they didn't just replace your orb, but either way you're impressed!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Haglin prend votre <style=loseOrb>[var=chosenOrb]</style> et le jette dans sa sacoche, puis il en ressort un <style=upgradeOrb>[var=upgradedOrb]</style>. Vous n’êtes pas entièrement convaincu qu’il n’a pas simplement remplacé votre orbe, mais vous êtes quand même impressionné !
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Haglin toma tu <style=loseOrb>[var=chosenOrb]</style>, lo mete en su propio bolso y luego saca un <style=upgradeOrb>[var=upgradedOrb]</style>. No estás del todo convencido de que no haya simplemente sustituido tu orbe, ¡pero en cualquier caso estás impresionado!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Haglin nimmt dein <style=loseOrb>[var=chosenOrb]</style> und wirft es in seinen eigenen Beutel, danach zieht er ein <style=upgradeOrb>[var=upgradedOrb]</style> heraus. Du bist dir nicht ganz sicher, ob er nicht einfach dein Orb ersetzt hat, aber du bist auf jeden Fall beeindruckt!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Pingelin pakt je <style=loseOrb>[var=chosenOrb]</style> en gooit het in hun eigen schoudertas, en haalt er dan een <style=upgradeOrb>[var=upgradedOrb]</style> uit. Je bent er niet helemaal van overtuigd dat ze niet gewoon je bol hebben omgewisseld, maar hoe dan ook, je bent onder de indruk!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Mercantin prende la tua <style=loseOrb>[var=chosenOrb]</style> e la getta nel suo zaino, poi tira fuori una <style=upgradeOrb>[var=upgradedOrb]</style>. Potrebbe aver semplicemente ritirato fuori la tua sfera... in ogni caso, ti ha convinto!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Haglin toma o seu <style=loseOrb>[var=chosenOrb]</style> e o joga em sua própria bolsa, então ele retira de dentro dela um <style=upgradeOrb>[var=upgradedOrb]</style>. Você não está completamente convencido de que ele não simplesmente trocou o seu orbe por um outro, mas de qualquer modo você ficou impressionado!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Торговлин берет <style=loseOrb>[var=chosenOrb]</style> и закидывает себе в сумку. Затем он вытаскивает <style=upgradeOrb>[var=upgradedOrb]</style>. Вы не совсем уверены в том, что он только что изменил ваш шар, но вы все равно впечатлены!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 哈布林拿起了你的<style=loseOrb>[var=chosenOrb]</style>，丢进了自己的包里，接着拿出了<style=upgradeOrb>[var=upgradedOrb]</style>。你不确定他是不是单纯替换了弹珠，但无论如何也令你感到惊讶！
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 哈格林拿走你的<style=loseOrb>[var=chosenOrb]</style>並丟進他的彈珠袋中，然後取出了<style=upgradeOrb>[var=upgradedOrb]</style>。雖然你不確定他是否只是替換掉彈珠，但這仍使你印象深刻。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "ハグリンは「<style=loseOrb>[var=chosenOrb]</style>」をカバンにしまい、\nすぐさま中から「<style=upgradeOrb>[var=upgradedOrb]</style>」を取り出した。\n\nただ単に持っていたオーブを取り替えただけのようにも見えたが……\nいずれにせよ、すごいテクだ！"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 해글린은 당신이 건넨 <style=loseOrb>[var=chosenOrb]</style> 하나를 가져가 자신의 가방에 넣고, <style=upgradeOrb>[var=upgradedOrb]</style> 하나를 꺼냅니다. 당신의 구슬을 바꾼 것 이상으로 뭔가 한 것 같다는 생각이 들지만, 어쨌든 꽤 신기하네요!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: Haglin tar din <style=loseOrb>[var=chosenOrb]</style> och kastar in den i sin egen säck, och sedan drar den ut en <style=upgradeOrb>[var=upgradedOrb]</style>. Du är inte helt övertygat att den inte bara ersatte ditt klot, men vilket fall som helst är du imponerad!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Targulin zabiera <style=loseOrb>[var=chosenOrb]</style> i wrzuca ją do swojej własnej torby, a potem wyciąga <style=upgradeOrb>[var=upgradedOrb]</style>. Nie jesteś do końca przekonany, czy czasem nie podmienił twojej kulki, ale tak czy siak jesteś pod wrażeniem!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: Haglin senin <style=loseOrb>[var=chosenOrb]</style>nu aldı ve çantasından bir <style=upgradeOrb>[var=upgradedOrb]</style> çıkardı. Topu yükseltmek yerine sana yeni bir top verdiğine eminsin ama yine de etkilendin!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value: Haglin vezme váš <style=loseOrb>[var=chosenOrb]</style> a hodí ho do svojej tašky a potom vytiahne nový <style=upgradeOrb>[var=upgradedOrb]</style>. Nie ste úplne presvedčení že nahradili len vašu guľu, ale v každom prípade ste ohromení!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
