    - id: 7
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Pictures
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Description
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: '"Ooh, new inventory!", Haglin squeals while taking the <style=loseOrb>[var=chosenOrb]</style> off your hands. You wonder just how many orbs Haglin has collected...'
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: '"Ooh, new inventory!", Haglin squeals while taking the <style=loseOrb>[var=chosenOrb]</style> off your hands. You wonder just how many orbs Haglin has collected...'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: « Oh, une nouvelle marchandise! », s’écrie Haglin d’une voix stridente en vous chipant votre <style=loseOrb>[var=chosenOrb]</style>. Vous vous demandez combien d’orbes Haglin a récupérés...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: ¡Ooh, equipo nuevo!, chilla Haglin mientras te quita de las manos el <style=loseOrb>[var=chosenOrb]</style>. Te preguntas cuántos orbes tiene en su colección...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: '"Oh, neue Waren!", quietscht Haglin, während er dir den <style=loseOrb>[var=chosenOrb]</style> abnimmt. Du fragst dich, wie viele Orbs Haglin schon gesammelt hat...'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: '"Ooh, nieuwe spullen!", gilt Pingelin terwijl ze de <style=loseOrb>[var=chosenOrb]</style> uit handen nemen. Je vraagt je af hoeveel bollen Pingelin al heeft verzameld...'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Ooh, nuova merce!, squittisce Mercantin mentre prende la <style=loseOrb>[var=chosenOrb]</style> dalle tue mani. Ti chiedi quante ne abbia già collezionate...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Olha só, estoque novo!, Haglin guincha enquanto toma o <style=loseOrb>[var=chosenOrb]</style> de suas mãos. Você imagina quantos orbes Haglin já deve ter coletado...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: «Ух ты, новый шар!», — пищит Торговлин, взяв <style=loseOrb>[var=chosenOrb]</style> из ваших рук. Интересно, сколько их у него набралось?..
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: “哦，新东西！”哈布林一边念叨着一边从你手上拿走了<style=loseOrb>[var=chosenOrb]</style>。这让你好奇哈布林到底收集了多少弹珠 ······
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 「噢，新發現！」哈格林一邊念叨一邊從你手上拿走<style=loseOrb>[var=chosenOrb]</style>。這讓你好奇究竟哈格林收集了多少彈珠 ···
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "「わーーい！新商品だーー！」\nハグリンは大きな声でそう叫びながら、\n君から「<style=loseOrb>[var=chosenOrb]</style>」を取り上げた。\n\n彼は一体、どれだけのオーブを集めたのだろうか……"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: '"오, 새로운 수집품이라니!" 해글린은 당신의 <style=loseOrb>[var=chosenOrb]</style> 하나를 가져가며 신난 듯이 말합니다. 당신은 해글린이 얼마나 많은 구슬을 모은 걸지 궁금해합니다...'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: '"Ooh, nytt lager!", Haglin tjuter medans han tar <style=loseOrb>[var=chosenOrb]</style> från dina händer. Du undrar bara hur många klot Haglin har samlat...'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: “Och, nowy towar!”, Targulin kwiknął, zabierając <style=loseOrb>[var=chosenOrb]</style> z twych rąk. Zastanawiasz się, jak dużo kulek zebrał już Targulin...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: '"Ooh, yeni stok!", Haglin <style=loseOrb>[var=chosenOrb]</style> ellerinden aldı. Haglinin böyle kaç top topladığını merak ediyorsun...'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
