    - id: 8
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Pictures
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Description
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "You find another Peglin intensely surveying the area.\n\"Hello! I'm Haglin... have we met before? I'm trying to find some good areas to open up shop. In the meantime I can offer you a free sample!\""
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: "You find <style=peglin>another Peglin</style> intensely surveying the area.\n\"Hello! I'm Haglin... have we met before? I'm afraid I haven't quite set up shop here yet, but in the meantime I can offer you a free sample!\""
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value: Updated 11/18/22 to reflect that Haglin just hasn't set up shop yet
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous trouvez <style=peglin>un autre Peglin</style> scrutant attentivement les environs. « Bonjour ! Je suis Haglin... nous sommes-nous déjà rencontrés auparavant ? Je crains de ne pas avoir encore tout à fait installé mon magasin ici, mais en attendant, je peux vous offrir un échantillon gratuit ! »
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Encuentras a <style=peglin>otro Peglin</style> inspeccionando minuciosamente la zona. "¡Hola! Soy Haglin... ¿Nos conocemos? Estoy tratando de encontrar un buen lugar para abrir una tienda. Mientras tanto, puedo ofrecerte una muestra gratis".
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: "Du entdeckst <style=peglin>einen anderen Peglin</style>, der die Umgebung intensiv untersucht.\n\"Hallo! Ich bin Haglin... Kennen wir uns? Ich habe es irgendwie noch nicht geschafft, hier einen Laden zu eröffnen. In der Zwischenzeit kann ich dir eine kostenlose Probe anbieten!\""
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: "Je ziet <style=peglin>een andere Peglin</style> die de omgeving nauwlettend overziet.\n\"Hallo! Ik ben Pingelin... kennen we elkaar? Ik heb hier helaas nog geen winkel opgezet. In de tussentijd kan ik je een gratis monster aanbieden!\""
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Trovi <style=peglin>un altro Peglin</style> che sorveglia intensamente la zona. "Salve! Io sono Mercantin... ci siamo già incontrati? La mia bottega non è ancora pronta, ma nel frattempo posso offrirti un campione gratuito!"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você encontra um <style=peglin>outro Peglin</style> examinando o local intensamente. "Olá! Eu sou Haglin... já nos encontramos antes? Eu meio que não terminei de montar minha lojinha ainda, até lá, aproveite essa amostra grátis!"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Вы находите <style=peglin>другого пеглина</style>, тщательно осматривающего территорию. «Привет! Я Торговлин... Мы раньше не встречались? Я пытаюсь найти хорошее место, чтобы открыть свой магазин. Но пока я могу сделать тебе что-нибудь бесплатно!»
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: "你遇到了<style=peglin>另一个哥布林</style>正在紧张地检查这个地方。\n“你好！我叫哈布林 ······我们见过面吗？我正准备在这里找个地方开间商店，现在可以免费帮你一次！”"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: "你發現<style=peglin>某個哥布林</style>正認真地勘察這片區域。\n「你好 ···我們見過面嗎？我叫哈格林！真不巧，本地的分店還在搭建中，但作為開業宣傳我可以讓你免費體驗本店的服務！」"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "熱心に周囲を観察している<style=peglin>もう一人のペグリン</style>を見つけた。\n\n「やあ！　ボクはハグリン……前にも会ったことあるかな？\n　来てくれたのは嬉しいけど、お店の準備がまだなんだ。\n　でもせっかくだから、無料サンプルをあげるよ！」"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: "당신은 구역을 샅샅이 수색하고 있던 <style=peglin>다른 페글린</style>을 발견합니다.\n \"안녕! 난 해글린인데... 전에 만난 적이 있던가? 난 가게를 열만한 좋은 자리를 찾고 있어. 무료 샘플 하나 가져갈래?\""
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: "Du hittar en annan Peglin som söker genom området intensivt.\n\"Hejsan! Jag är Haglin... har vi träffats förr? Jag försöker bara hitta ett bra ställe att ha min affär. Sålänge kan jag ge dig ett gratis smakprov!\" "
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Spotykasz innego Peglina intensywnie rozglądającego się po okolicy. “Witaj! Jestem Targulin… nie spotkaliśmy się już? Przykro mi to mówić, ale jeszcze nie otworzyłem tutaj sklepu, lecz w międzyczasie mogę zaoferować ci darmową usługę!”
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: "Etrafı yoğun bir şekilde kolaçan eden <style=peglin>başka bir Peglin</style> buldun.\n\"Merhaba! Benim adım Haglin... Daha önce tanışmış mıydık? Yeni bir dükkan açmak için güzel bir mekan arıyordum. İstersen sana bedava bir numune verebilirim!\""
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
