      - title: en
        value: You find {vertexp}<style=water>a waterfall{/vertexp}</style> just off the path. What secrets might it be hiding?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Du findest {vertexp}<style=water>einen Wasserfall{/vertexp}</style> direkt neben dem Weg. Welche Geheimnisse könnte er verbergen?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Pal naast het pad vind je {vertexp}<style=water>een waterval{/vertexp}</style>. Welke geheimen zou het kunnen verbergen?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Trovi {vertexp}<style=water>una cascata{/vertexp}</style> poco distante dal sentiero. Quali segreti potrebbe nascondere?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você encontra {vertexp}<style=water>uma cachoeira{/vertexp}</style> pelo caminho. Que segredos será que ela esconde?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: В стороне от тропы виднеется {vertexp}<style=water>водопад{/vertexp}</style>. Какие тайны он может скрывать?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 你發現旁邊有{vertexp}<style=water>一座瀑布{/vertexp}</style>。那裡會隱藏著什麼秘密呢？
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 당신은 길가에서 {vertexp}<style=water>폭포{/vertexp}</style>를 발견합니다. 어떤 비밀들이 숨겨져 있을까요?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous trouvez {vertexp}<style=water>une cascade{/vertexp}</style> sur le rebord du chemin. Quels secrets peut-elle bien cacher ?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Encuentras {vertexp}<style=water>una cascada{/vertexp}</style> justo al lado del camino. ¿Qué secretos esconderá?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 你看到{vertexp}<style=water>一座瀑布{/vertexp}</style>就在旁边。那里会隐藏着什么秘密呢？
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "小道を出てすぐのところで{vertexp}<style=water>滝{/vertexp}</style>を見つけた。\n中には一体、どんな秘密が隠されているだろうか？"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: Du hittar {vertexp}<style=water>ett vattenfall{/vertexp}</style> på sidan om vägen. Vilka hemligheter kan det gömma?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Odnajdujesz {vertexp}<style=water>wodospad{/vertexp}</style> przy drodze. Jakież sekrety może skrywać?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: Yolun hemen yanında bir {vertexp}<style=water>şelale{/vertexp}</style> ile karşılaştın. Acaba ne tür sırlar saklıyor olabilir?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value: Hneď vedľa cesty nájdete {vertexp}<style=water>vodopád{/vertexp}</style>. Aké tajomstvá môže skrývať?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
