    - id: 1
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Pictures
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Description
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "You just barely notice an elongated figure lurking <color=#666666>in the shadows</color>...\nYou hear an oddly alluring voice in your head,\n\"Do you crave power, little <style=peglin>Peglin</style>? Would you like to make a deal?\""
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: "You just barely notice an elongated figure lurking <color=#666666>in the shadows</color>...\nYou hear an oddly alluring voice in your head,\n\"Do you crave power, little <style=peglin>Peglin</style>? Would you like to make a deal?\""
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: "Du erkennst eine kaum sichtbare, langgestreckte Figur, die <color=#666666>in den Schatten</color> lauert...\nDu hörst in deinem Kopf eine seltsam verführerische Stimme:\n\"Ist es Macht, die Ihr sucht, kleiner <style=peglin>Peglin</style>? Lasst uns handeln.\""
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: "Je kunt een langgestrekt figuur die zich ophoudt <color=#666666>in de schaduw</color> nog net opmerken...\nJe hoort een verleidelijke stem in je hoofd,\n\"Verlang je naar macht, kleine <style=peglin>Peglin</style>? Wil je soms een deal maken?\""
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: 'Noti di sfuggita una silhouette allampanata che ti osserva <color=#666666>nell’ombra</color>...  Avverti una voce suadente nella tua testa, che chiede: “Brami il potere, piccolo <style=peglin>Peglin</style>? Vuoi stringere un patto?”'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você mal percebe uma figura alongada espreitando <color=#666666>nas sombras</color>... Você ouve uma estranha voz sedutora em sua cabeça,  "Você deseja poder, queridinho <style=peglin>Peglin</style>? Quer fazer um acordo?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: 'Вы едва замечаете вытянутую фигуру, скрывающуюся <color=#666666>в тени</color>... В голове звучит странно манящий голос: «Жаждешь власти, маленький <style=peglin>пеглин</style>? Не хотел бы ты заключить сделку?»'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: "你隱約看到一個細長的身影<color=#666666>在陰影中</color>蠢蠢欲動 ······\n你聽到一個奇怪誘人的聲音在腦海中響起，\n「你渴望力量嗎，小<style=peglin>哥布林</style>？想和我做一個交易嗎？」"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: "당신은 길쭉한 형체가 <color=#666666>그림자 속</color>에 숨어있는 것을 발견합니다...\n 당신의 머릿속에서 이상하리만큼 매혹적인 목소리가 들려옵니다.\n \"힘을 갈망하니, 작은 <style=peglin>페글린</style>아? 나와 거래를 하지 않을래?\""
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: 'Vous remarquez un visage tapi <color=#666666>dans l’ombre</color>... Vous entendez une voix étrangement séduisante dans votre tête : « As-tu soif de pouvoir, petit <style=peglin>Peglin</style> ? Veux-tu passer un marché ? »'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: 'Apenas percibes una figura alargada que acecha <color=#666666>en las sombras</color>... Oyes una voz extrañamente seductora en tu cabeza: "¿Ansías poder, pequeño <style=peglin>Peglin</style>? ¿Te gustaría hacer un trato?"'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: "你隐约看到一个细长的身影<color=#666666>在黑暗处</color>蠢蠢欲动 ······\n你听到一个奇怪诱人的声音在脑海中响起，\n“你渴望力量吗，小<style=peglin>哥布林</style>？想和我做一个交易吗？”"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "君はふと、<color=#666666>物陰</color>に潜む細長い影の存在に気づいた……\n頭の中でやけに魅力的な声が響き渡る……\n\n「力が欲しいか……小さき<style=peglin>ペグリン</style>よ。取引はどうだ？」"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: "Du märker knappt en långsträckt figur smygandes <color=#666666>i skuggorna</color>...\r\nDu hör en underligt anspelande röst i huvudet,\r\n\"Längtar du efter kraft, lilla <style=peglin>Peglin</style>? Skulle du vilja göra ett avtal?\""
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: EventGuid
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString:
      - title: tr
        value: "Ledwo dostrzegasz podłużną sylwetkę czającą się <color=#666666>w cieniu</color>...\nSłyszysz dziwnie kuszący głos w swej głowie,\n\"Czy pożądasz mocy, mały <style=peglin>Peglinie</style>? Chciałbyś zawrzeć umowę?\""
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: "<color=#666666>Gölgelerin içinde</color> uzun boylu bir figürü zar zor farkedebildin.\nKafanın içinde tuhaf ama cazip bir ses duyuyorsun,\n\"Güce hasret misin küçük <style=peglin>Peglin</style>? Bir anlaşma yapmaya ne dersin?\""
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value: "Sotva si všimnete podlhovastú postavu číhajúcu <color=#666666>v tieni</color>...\nVo svojej hlave počuješ zvláštne lákavý hlas,\n\"Túžiš po moci, malý <style=peglin>Peglin</style>? Chcel by si sa dohodnúť?\""
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
