    - id: 3
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Pictures
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Description
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: You feel a low chuckle as a long arm emerges from the shadows to hand you an unpolished gem. Stars dance on the edge of your vision as lightheadedness hits you suddenly but you do feel an <style=objectOfInterest>incredible new power</style>... and a new <shake>hunger</shake>.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: You feel a low chuckle as a long arm emerges from the shadows to hand you an unpolished gem. Stars dance on the edge of your vision as lightheadedness hits you suddenly but you do feel an <style=objectOfInterest>incredible new power</style>... and a new <shake>hunger</shake>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Du vernimmst ein schwaches Kichern, als sich ein langer Arm aus den Schatten erhebt und dir einen ungeschliffenen Edelstein überreicht. Sterne tanzen am Rande deines Sichtfelds, als du schließlich vollkommen benommen wirst. Danach fühlst du aber eine <style=objectOfInterest>neue, unglaubliche Macht</style>... und einen neuen <shake>Hunger</shake>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Je voelt een zacht gegrinnik wanneer een lange arm uit de schaduw komt om je een ongepolijste edelsteen te overhandigen. Sterretjes dansen aan de rand van je zicht terwijl je plotseling duizelig wordt, maar je voelt een <style=objectOfInterest>ongelooflijke nieuwe kracht</style>... en een nieuwe <shake>trek</shake>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Senti una risatina sommessa, poi un lungo braccio emerge dall’ombra, porgendoti una gemma grezza. Improvvisamente la vista ti si oscura, ti gira la testa... ma percepisci anche un <style=objectOfInterest>nuovo, incredibile potere</style>... e una nuova <shake>fame</shake>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você ouve uma risadinha baixa enquanto um braço alongado emerge das sombras para te entregar uma joia sem polimento. Estrelas dançam na beira de sua visão enquanto delírio e tontura te acertam, subitamente você sente um <style=objectOfInterest>incrível novo poder</style>... e uma nova <shake>fome</shake>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Вы слышите басовитый смешок, и длинная рука, протянутая из тени, дает вам неполированный самоцвет. У вас закружилась голова, а перед глазами начинают мелькать звездочки, но вы чувствуете <style=objectOfInterest>новую невероятную силу</style>... и новую <shake>жажду</shake>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 你聽到一陣低沉的笑聲，一隻細長的手臂從陰影中伸出，遞給你一塊未經打磨的寶石。你突然感到頭暈目眩，伴隨而來的還有一股<style=objectOfInterest>難以置信的力量</style> ······和<shake>飢餓感</shake>。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 낮은 웃음소리가 들려옴과 동시에 그림자 속에서 길쭉한 팔이 나와 당신에게 가공되지 않은 보석을 건넵니다. 감기는 눈 앞에서 별들이 반짝이기 시작하더니, 갑자기 어지러움이 찾아오지만, 그러는 와중에도 <style=objectOfInterest>놀라운 새로운 힘</style>과 함께... 새로운 <shake>굶주림</shake>이 느껴지는군요.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous entendez un petit gloussement pendant qu’un long bras émerge des ombres pour vous tendre une gemme polie. Vous voyez des étoiles et vous sentez subitement très léger puis vous sentez un <style=objectOfInterest> incroyable pouvoir</style>... et une nouvelle <shake>sensation de faim</shake>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Sientes una risita baja mientras un brazo emerge de las sombras para darte una gema sin pulir. Las estrellas bailan en el borde de tu visión mientras te invade un mareo repentino, pero sientes un <style=objectOfInterest>increíble nuevo poder</style>... y un <shake>ansia</shake> nueva.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 你听到一阵低沉的笑声，一只细长的手臂从阴影中伸出，递给你一块未经打磨的宝石。你突然感到头晕目眩，伴随而来的还有一股<style=objectOfInterest>难以置信的力量</style> ······和<shake>饥饿感</shake>。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "クスクスと低い笑い声が聞こえる中、物陰から細長い腕が現れ、\n磨かれていない宝石を君に手渡す。それを手にした途端、\n視界の隅で星々が踊りだし、突然のめまいに襲われた。\n\n――君は今、新たに<style=objectOfInterest>驚くべき力</style>と……<shake>渇き</shake>を感じている。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: Du känner ett lågt skrockande medans en lång arm reser sig från skuggorna för att räcka dig en oslipad ädelsten. Stjärnor dansar på kanten av ditt synhåll då yrseln plötsligt träffar dig men du känner ju en <style=objectOfInterest>otrolig ny kraft</style>... och en ny <shake>hunger</shake>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: EventGuid
        value: 320d5195-a5b3-47ec-b31e-52ef1561a2c5
        type: 0
        typeString:
      - title: tr
        value: Słyszysz cichy chichot, podczas gdy z cienia wynurza się długa ręka, trzymająca nieoszlifowany klejnot. Widzisz gwiazdy przed oczami, czując nagłe zawroty głowy, lecz wyczuwasz <style=objectOfInterest>niesamowitą, nową moc</style>... oraz nowy <shake>głód</shake>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: Gölgelerin içinden bir kol boğuk bir kıkırdamayla sana cilasız bir mücevher uzattı. Aniden başın dönmeye başladı, yıldızlar kafan kadar güzel bir şekilde dans etmeye başladılar ve sen içinde <style=objectOfInterest>yeni muazzam bir güç</style> hissettin... ve yeni bir <shake>açlık</shake>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
