        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: The figure makes no movement to follow you and you're out of the clearing in just a few seconds. It takes much longer for the chill to leave your body though...
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: The figure makes no movement to follow you and you're out of the clearing in just a few seconds. Though it takes much longer for the chill to leave your body...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Le visage vous suit sans bouger tandis qu’en quelques secondes, vous vous retrouvez dans une clairière. Il vous faut du temps pour que le frisson quitte votre corps...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: La figura no hace ningún movimiento para seguirte y sales del claro en unos segundos. Aunque el escalofrío tarda mucho más en salir de tu cuerpo...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Die Figur macht keine Anstalten, dir in irgendeiner Weise zu folgen und du bist schon nach wenigen Sekunden außer Sichtweite. Der Schauer sitzt dir aber noch immer im Nacken...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: De figuur maakt geen aanstalte om je te volgen en je bent binnen een paar seconden uit de open plek. Het duurt echter veel langer voor je uitgerild bent van de kou...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Il personaggio non dà cenno di seguirti e in pochi secondi sei fuori dalla radura. Tuttavia, ci vuole molto di più perché lo strano gelo abbandoni il tuo corpo...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: A figura não faz nenhum movimento para te seguir e você dá o fora daquele lugar em segundos. Porém os arrepios demoram muito mais para deixar seu corpo...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Фигура не пытается вас преследовать, и вы покидаете поляну всего за несколько секунд. Холоду же потребуется гораздо больше времени, чтобы покинуть ваше тело...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 那个身影并不打算跟着你，你快速跑出了空地。但回想起来还是觉得心有余悸 ······
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 那個身影並沒有追逐你，但在快步逃離後，你仍感到心有餘悸 ······
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "謎の影は君を追いかけようとはしなかったので、\nほんの数秒でその場から逃げることができた。\n\n身体から寒気が抜けるには、もう少し時間がかかるだろう……"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 형체는 당신을 쫓아오려 하지 않고, 얼마 지나지 않아 당신은 그곳을 빠져나옵니다. 하지만 당신의 몸에서 오한이 떨어져 나가기까지는 시간이 한참 더 걸립니다.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: Varelsen gör inga rörelser för att följa dig och du är ute ur gläntan i bara ett fåtal sekunder. Det tar mycket längre för rysningen att lämna din kropp dock...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Postać nie podąża za tobą, gdy szybko uciekasz z polany. Długo jeszcze czujesz na swoim ciele dreszcze...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: Figür seni takip etmeye tenezzül etmiyor ve açıklıktan birkaç saniyede kaçıyorsun. Ürpetinin vücudunu terk etmesi daha uzun zaman alıyor...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
