      - title: en
        value: You feel <style=damage>an unpleasant transfer of energy</style> but your [var=orb0] has been duplicated.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous sentez <style=damage>un transfert d’énergie déplaisant</style> mais votre [var=orb0] a été dupliqué.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Sientes <style=damage>una transferencia de energía poco placentera</style>, pero tu [var=orb0] ha sido duplicado.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Du verspürst <style=damage>eine unangenehme Energieübertragung</style>, woraufhin dein [var=orb0] verdoppelt wurde.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Je voelt <style=damage>een onaangename energieoverdracht</style> maar je [var=orb0] is gedupliceerd.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Avverti <style=damage>uno spiacevole trasferimento di energia</style> ma la tua [var=orb0] è stata duplicata.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você sente <style=damage>uma desagradável transferência de energia</style> mas seu [var=orb0] foi duplicado.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Вы чувствуете <style=damage>неприятное перетекание энергии</style>, но [var=orb0] дублируется.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 你感到<style=damage>一股不祥的能量流过</style>，[var=orb0]被复制了。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 你感到<style=damage>一股難受的能量流過</style>，你的[var=orb0]被複製了。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "<style=damage>不快なエナジー</style>が身体を通り抜けるのを感じる……\nどうやら「[var=orb0]」がコピーされたようだ。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 당신은 <style=damage>에너지가 이동하는 듯한 불쾌한 기분</style>을 느끼지만, 이내 손에 [var=orb0] 두 개가 들려있는 것을 확인합니다.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: Du känner <style=damage>en obekväm överföring av energi</style> men ditt [var=orb0] har duplicerats.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Odczuwasz <style=damage>nieprzyjemny przypływ energii</style>, ale [var=orb0] ulega zduplikowaniu.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: Ürpertici <style=damage>bir enerji akımı</style> hissettin ama artık elinde iki tane [var=orb0] var.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value: Cítite <style=damage>nepríjemný prenos energie</style>, ale vaša [var=orb0] bola duplikovaná.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
