        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: You embrace the infernal energy and push your [var=chosenOrb] through the mirror. You hope the shadows make good use of it.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: You embrace the infernal energy and push your [var=chosenOrb] through the mirror. You hope the shadows make good use of it.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous cédez à l’énergie infernale et poussez votre [var=chosenOrb] au travers du miroir. Vous espérez que les ombres en feront bon usage.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Aceptas la energía infernal y empujas tu [var=chosenOrb] a través del espejo. Esperas que la sombras hagan buen uso de él.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Du absorbierst die höllische Energie und schiebst dein [var=chosenOrb] durch den Spiegel. Du hoffst, dass die Schatten es gut verwahren werden.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Je omarmt de helse energie en duwt je [var=chosenOrb] door de spiegel. Je hoopt dat de schaduwen het goed kunnen gebruiken.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Accogli l'energia infernale e spingi la tua [var=chosenOrb] attraverso lo specchio. Speri che le ombre ne facciano buon uso.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você desbrava a energia infernal e empurra seu [var=chosenOrb] através do espelho. Você espera que as sombras o aproveitem.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Вы вбираете адскую энергию и проталкиваете [var=chosenOrb] сквозь зеркало. Наверное, теням это пригодится.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 你拥抱了来自地狱的邪恶能量，并把[var=chosenOrb]放入了镜中。希望影子能好好利用它。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 你接受了來自地獄的能量，並把[var=chosenOrb]放進鏡子，希望影子能好好利用它。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "地獄のエナジーを受け入れ、\n「<style=loseOrb>[var=chosenOrb]</style>」を鏡の中に押し入れた。\n影がオーブを有効活用することを願うばかりだ。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 당신은 어두운 에너지를 받아들이고 거울로 [var=chosenOrb] 하나를 밀어넣습니다. 그림자들이 잘 사용하길 바라야겠네요.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: Du omfamnar den infernaliske energin och trycker ditt [var=chosenOrb] genom spegeln. Du hoppas att skuggorna gör bra nytta av det.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Akceptujesz tę piekielną energię i wpychasz [var=chosenOrb] przez lustro. Masz nadzieję, że cienie dobrze to spożytkują.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: Aynanın şeytani gücünü kabullendin ve [var=chosenOrb]u aynaya ittirdin. Umarsın ki gölgelerin ona senden daha çok ihtiyaçları olsun.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      conversationID: 18
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor:
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: Block
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks: []
      conditionsString:
      userScript:
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
