      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "\"Consssider it done.\"\nYou're less than thrilled with the price that was paid, but your [var=chosenOrb] has in fact been upgraded to [var=upgradedOrb]."
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: "\"Consssider it done.\"\nYou're less than thrilled with the price that was paid, but your [var=chosenOrb] has in fact been upgraded to [var=upgradedOrb]."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: « Vos désirs sssont des ordres » Vous n’êtes pas enchanté au vu du prix payé, mais votre [var=chosenOrb] a en fait été amélioré en [var=upgradedOrb].
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Consssidéralo hecho.  No estás muy contento por el precio que tuviste que pagar, pero tu [var=chosenOrb] ha mejorado a [var=upgradedOrb].
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: "\"Sssofort erledigt.\"\nDu bist vom Preisleistungsverhältnis nicht gerade überwältigt, aber zumindest wurde dein [var=chosenOrb] tatsächlich verbessert zu einem [var=upgradedOrb]."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: "\"Bessschouw het als gedaan.\"\nJe bent niet zo blij met de prijs die betaald is, maar je [var=chosenOrb] is in feite opgewaardeerd naar [var=upgradedOrb]."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Consssideralo fatto. Il prezzo pagato è oltraggioso, ma in effetti la tua [var=chosenOrb] è stata migliorata in una [var=upgradedOrb].
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Consssidere feito. Você não fica muito empolgado com o preço que foi pago, mas seu [var=chosenOrb] realmente foi melhorado para [var=upgradedOrb].
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: «Сссчитай, что уже сссделано». Вы не в восторге от цены, которую пришлось заплатить, но ваш шар [var=chosenOrb] и вправду был улучшен до [var=upgradedOrb].
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: "“汝愿已成。”\n虽然对付出的代价不太满意，但你的[var=chosenOrb]已经升级为[var=upgradedOrb]。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: "「汝願已成！」\n雖然你對付出的代價不太滿意，但你的[var=chosenOrb]已升級成[var=upgradedOrb]。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "「お任せえ……あれ……」\n\n支払った代償のせいであまり嬉しくなかったが、\n「[var=chosenOrb]」は確かに\n「<style=upgradeOrb>[var=upgradedOrb]</style>」へと強化された。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: "\"네 명대로.\"\n 큰 값을 치른 탓에 그렇게 기쁘진 않지만, [var=chosenOrb] 하나는 확실히 [var=upgradedOrb]로 업그레이드 되었습니다."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: "\"Anssse det som färdigt\"\r\nDu är mindre än spänd över priset som betalades,  men ditt [var=chosenOrb] har faktiskt uppgraderats till [var=upgradedOrb]."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: "\"Ssssprawię, że tak się ssstanie.\"\nNie jesteś podekscytowany ceną, jaka została zapłacona, ale [var=chosenOrb] faktycznie zmienia się w [var=upgradedOrb].\""
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: "\"Oldu bil.\"\nÖdediğin bedelin değdiğine emin değilsin, fakat [var=chosenOrb] gerçekten de [var=upgradedOrb]na yükseltildi."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value: "\"Považujte to za hotové.\"\nZ ceny, ktorú ste zaplatili, nie ste nadšení, ale vaša [var=chosenOrb] bola v skutočnosti vylepšená na [var=upgradedOrb]."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
