      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: You find Haglin standing motionless on your path. Something about it gives you the creeps, but they seem to be offering the same services as usual...
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: You find what looks like <style=peglin>Haglin</style> standing motionless on your path. Something about it gives you the creeps, but they seem to be offering the same services as usual...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous trouvez ce qui ressemble à un <style=peglin>Haglin</style>, restant de marbre sur votre chemin. Quelque chose en lui vous terrifie, mais il a l’air d’offrir les mêmes services que d’habitude...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Encuentras a quien parece ser <style=peglin>Haglin</style> inmóvil en tu camino. Hay algo en todo esto que te da escalofríos, pero parece que está ofreciendo los mismos servicios de siempre...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Du siehst, wie Haglin völlig regungslos am Wegesrand steht. Irgendetwas daran jagt dir Schauer über den Rücken, aber er scheint die gleichen Dienste wie immer anzubieten...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Je ziet wat eruit ziet als <style=peglin>Pingelin</style> bewegingloos op je pad staan. Je krijgt er de kriebels van, maar ze lijken dezelfde diensten aan te bieden als gewoonlijk...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Trovi ciò che appare come <style=peglin>Mercantin</style>, in piedi, immobile in mezzo al sentiero. C’è qualcosa di inquietante in lui, tuttavia sembra offrirti i suoi servigi come sempre...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você encontra o que parece ser <style=peglin>Haglin</style> parado em seu caminho. Algo nele te dá calafrios, mas ele parece estar oferecendo os serviços de sempre...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Вы находите <style=peglin>Торговлина</style>, неподвижно стоящего на вашем пути. Что-то в этой ситуации вызывает мурашки; но, кажется, он предлагает все те же услуги...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 你看到一些看起来像<style=peglin>哈布林</style>的生物站在你前进的道路上一动不动。这让你感到毛骨悚然，但他们似乎还像往常一样提供同样的服务 ······
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 你發現一個疑似<style=peglin>哈格林</style>的物體一動不動地站在你的前方。這讓你感到毛骨悚然，但它似乎還像往常一樣提供同樣的服務 ···
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "道すがら、<style=peglin>ハグリン</style>らしき生物が\n立ったまま動かずにいるのを見つけた。\n\nどことなく不気味な感じがするが、\nいつもと同じサービスを提供しているようだ……"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 당신은 가던 길에 <style=peglin>해글린</style>으로 보이는 것이 미동도 하지 않은 채로 서 있는 것을 발견합니다. 어쩐지 으스스한 기분이 들긴 하지만, 평소와 다름없이 같은 도움을 제공하는 듯하네요...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: Du hittar vad som ser ut som Haglin ståendes orörligt på din väg. Något om det ger dig rysningar, men hen verkar erbjuda samma tjänster som vanligt...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Odnajdujesz Targulina stojącego nieruchomo na twej drodze. Coś w nim przyprawia cię o dreszcze, ale wygląda na to, że oferuje to samo, co zwykle...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: 'Önüne yolun ortasında hareketsiz duran bir Haglin çıktı. Tipinde hoşuna gitmeyen bir şeyler var ama her zamanki hizmetlerinu sunuyor gibi gözüküyor. '
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
