      - title: en
        value: "\"Consssider it done.\"\nYour [var=chosenOrb] has been upgraded to [var=upgradedOrb]."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: « Consssidérez que c’est fait. » Votre [var=chosenOrb] a été amélioré en [var=upgradedOrb].
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Consssidéralo hecho.  Tu [var=chosenOrb] se ha mejorado a un [var=upgradedOrb].
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: "\"Sssofort erledigt.\"\nDein [var=chosenOrb] wurde verbessert zu einem [var=upgradedOrb]."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: "\"Bessschouw het als gedaan.\"\nJe [var=chosenOrb] is opgewaardeerd naar [var=upgradedOrb]."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Consssideralo fatto.  La tua [var=chosenOrb] è stata potenziata in [var=chosenOrb].
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Consssidere feito. Seu [var=chosenOrb] foi melhorado para [var=upgradedOrb].
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: «Сссчитай, что уже сссделано». Ваш [var=chosenOrb] был улучшен до [var=upgradedOrb].
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: "\"汝愿已成。\"\n你的[var=chosenOrb]已升级为[var=upgradedOrb]。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: "「汝願已成！」\n你的[var=chosenOrb]已升級成[var=upgradedOrb]。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "「お任せえ……あれ……」\n「[var=chosenOrb]」が\n「<style=upgradeOrb>[var=upgradedOrb]</style>」へと強化された。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: "\"네 명대로.\"\n [var=chosenOrb]가 [var=upgradedOrb]로 업그레이드 됐습니다.\""
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: '"Sssprawię, że tak się ssstanie." [var=chosenOrb] ulepsza się do [var=upgradedOrb].'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
