    - id: 1
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Pictures
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Description
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: '<style=objectOfInterest>A dark Obelisk</style> looms before you. It hums with a tantalizing power and you can feel its connection to the Earth.'
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: '<style=objectOfInterest>A dark Obelisk</style> looms before you. It hums with a tantalizing power and you can feel its connection to the earth.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: '<style=objectOfInterest>Un sombre obélisque</style> se dresse devant vous. Il ronronne avec un pouvoir alléchant et vous pouvez ressentir sa connexion à la Terre.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: '<style=objectOfInterest>Un Obelisco oscuro</style> se encuentra ante ti. Emite un zumbido de poder tentador y puedes sentir su conexión con la Tierra.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: '<style=objectOfInterest>Ein dunkler Obelisk</style> ragt vor dir auf. Er summt verlockend und du spürst seine Verbindung zur Erde.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: '<style=objectOfInterest>Een donkere Obelisk</style> doemt voor je op. Het zoemt met een prikkelende kracht en je kunt de verbinding ervan met de aarde voelen.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: '<style=objectOfInterest>Un oscuro obelisco</style> si delinea di fronte a te. L’oggetto mormora con un potere inebriante e percepisci la sua connessione alla terra.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: '<style=objectOfInterest>Um Obelisco escuro</style> se encontra a sua frente. Ele murmura com uma força tentadora e você consegue sentir sua conexão com a terra.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Сквозь туман проступает <style=objectOfInterest>темный обелиск</style>. Он гудит с дразнящей силой, и вы чувствуете его связь с землей.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: '<style=objectOfInterest>一座黑色的方尖碑</style>在你面前显现。它散发出了诱人的能量，你能感觉到它与地球之间有着某种联系。'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: '<style=objectOfInterest>一座黑色的方尖碑</style>在你面前顯現。它散發出了誘人的能量，你能感覺到它與地球之間有著某種聯繫。'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "君の前に、<style=objectOfInterest>闇のオベリスク</style>が立ち塞がる。それは、大地との繋がりを\n感じさせる力で「ゴゴゴゴ……」とうなりを上げていた。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: '<style=objectOfInterest>어둠의 오벨리스크</style>가 서 있습니다. 매혹적인 힘을 뿜으며 진동하는 오벨리스크로부터 지구와의 연결이 느껴집니다.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: '<style=objectOfInterest>En mörk Obelisk</style> skymtar framför dig. Den nynnnar med en frestande kraft och du kan känna dess samband till jorden.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: '<style=objectOfInterest>Mroczny Obelisk</style> unosi się przed tobą. Szumi z pociągającą mocą i wyczuwasz jego ścisłą więź z ziemią.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: '<style=objectOfInterest>Siyah bir Dikilitaş</style> karşında duruyor. Cazibeli bir güçle uğuldayan Dikilitaşın dünyanın derinliklerine olan bağlantısını hissedebiliyorsun.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
