      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: The power of <style=objectOfInterest>The Obelisk</style> flows into you, coalescing as the new <style=stone>[var=addedOrb]</style> in your satchel.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: The power of <style=objectOfInterest>The Obelisk</style> flows into you, coalescing as the new <style=stone>[var=addedOrb]</style> in your satchel.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Le pouvoir de <style=objectOfInterest>l’obélisque</style>s’écoule en vous, fusionnant en un nouvel <style=stone>[var=addedOrb]</style> dans votre sacoche.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: El poder de <style=objectOfInterest>El Obelisco</style> fluye en ti, y un nuevo <style=stone>[var=addedOrb]</style> entra en tu bolso.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Die Macht des <style=objectOfInterest>Obelisks</style> fließt in dich und vereinigt sich schließlich in deiner Tasche als ein neues <style=stone>[var=addedOrb]</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: De kracht van <style=objectOfInterest>De Obelisk</style> stroomt in je, samenvloeiend tot de nieuwe <style=stone>[var=addedOrb]</style> in je schoudertas.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Il potere dell'<style=objectOfInterest>obelisco</style> scorre in te, materializzandosi come la nuova <style=stone>[var=addedOrb]</style> nel tuo zaino.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: O poder do <style=objectOfInterest>Obelisco</style> corre por você, se materializando como <style=stone>[var=addedOrb]</style> em sua bolsa.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Сила <style=objectOfInterest>обелиска</style> течет в вас и превращается в новый <style=stone>[var=addedOrb]</style> в сумке.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: '<style=objectOfInterest>方尖碑</style>的力量流入你的体内，在挎包里凝聚成了一个<style=stone>[var=addedOrb]</style>。'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: '<style=objectOfInterest>方尖碑</style>的力量流入你的體內，在彈珠袋中凝聚成了一個<style=stone>[var=addedOrb]</style>。'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "<style=objectOfInterest>オベリスク</style>の力が体内へと流れ込み、\n「<style=stone>[var=addedOrb]</style>」となって新たにカバンへと入った。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: '<style=objectOfInterest>오벨리스크</style>의 힘이 당신에게 흘러들어와, 가방 속에 <style=stone>[var=addedOrb]</style>의 모습으로 굳어집니다.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: Kraften av <style=objectOfInterest> Obelisken</style> flöder in i dig, växandes samman som den nya <style=stone>[var=addedOrb]</style> i din skolväska.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Moc <style=objectOfInterest>Obelisku</style> wpływa w ciebie, koncentrując się w <style=stone>[var=addedOrb]</style> w twojej torbie.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: '<style=objectOfInterest>Dikilitaş</style> büyülü gücünü sana bahşetti ve çantanda bir <style=stone>[var=addedOrb]</style> belirdi.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
