      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: You feel a slight disappointment from <style=objectOfInterest>The Obelisk</style> for not utilizing its true potential, but it does absorb the [var=removedOrb].
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: You feel a sense of disappointment from <style=objectOfInterest>The Obelisk</style> for not utilizing its true potential, but it does absorb the [var=lostOrb].
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous ressentez une légère déception de la part de <style=objectOfInterest>l’obélisque</style> pour ne pas avoir utilisé son véritable potentiel, mais il absorbe votre [var=lostOrb].
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Te das cuenta de que <style=objectOfInterest>El Obelisco</style> está un poco decepcionado porque no usaste su verdadero potencial, pero termina absorbiendo el [var=lostOrb].
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Du bist etwas enttäuscht, dass der <style=objectOfInterest>Obelisk</style> nicht sein volles Potential entfaltet hat, aber er absorbiert tatsächlich dein [var=lostOrb].
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Je voelt een lichte teleurstelling van <style=objectOfInterest>De Obelisk</style> voor het niet benutten van zijn ware potentieel, maar het absorbeert wel de [var=lostOrb].
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Percepisci un senso di delusione provenire dall'<style=objectOfInterest>obelisco</style> per aver rifiutato il suo vero potenziale, tuttavia l’oggetto assorbe la [var=lostOrb].
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você percebe uma pequena decepção vinda do <style=objectOfInterest>Obelisco</style> por não aproveitar seu verdadeiro potencial, mas ele absorve [var=lostOrb] de qualquer jeito.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Вы чувствуете, что <style=objectOfInterest>Обелиск</style> слегка разочарован тем, что он не раскрыл свой потенциал, но всё равно поглотил [var=lostOrb].
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 你对<style=objectOfInterest>方尖碑</style>有一点失望，它只是单纯吸收了[var=lostOrb]，而不是好好发挥其真正潜力。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 你對<style=objectOfInterest>方尖碑</style>有點失望，它沒有發揮真正力量只是單純吸收了[var=lostOrb]。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "<style=objectOfInterest>オベリスク</style>が本来の力を発揮しなかったのは少々残念だったが、\n「<style=stone>[var=lostOrb]</style>」を吸い上げてくれたようだ。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: '<style=objectOfInterest>오벨리스크</style>는 자신의 진정한 힘을 사용하지 않은 것에 대해 실망한 듯 하지만, [var=lostOrb] 하나는 오벨리스크에 얌전히 흡수됩니다.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value: Du känner en lätt besvikelse från <style=objectOfInterest> Obelisken</style> för att den inte utnyttjade sin sanna potenial, men den absorberar ju [var=lostOrb].
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Odczuwasz lekkie rozczarowanie ze strony <style=objectOfInterest>Obelisku</style> za niewykorzystanie jego prawdziwego potencjału, ale pomimo tego zabiera on [var=lostOrb].
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: '[var=lostOrb] karanlıkta kaybolurken <style=objectOfInterest>Dikilitaştan</style> gelen hayal kırıklığı hissi içini pişmanlık ve utançla dolduruyor.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
