        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: The walls of the corridor appear to be tearing, revealing worlds that look very similar to your own. The tears grow larger and larger as you progress, revealing countless monsters. Near the end of the corridor you see a <style=damage>Forest Boss</style> through a Peglin-sized tear.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: The walls of the corridor appear to be <wiggle>tearing</wiggle>, revealing worlds that look very similar to your own. The tears grow larger and larger as you progress, revealing countless monsters. Near the end of the corridor you see a <style=damage>Forest Boss</style> through a Peglin-sized tear.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Les murs apparaissent <wiggle>déchirés</wiggle>, révélant des mondes très similaires au vôtre. Les déchirures deviennent de plus en plus grandes quand vous avancez, dévoilant d’innombrables monstres. Vers le bout du couloir, vous voyez un <style=damage>boss de la forêt</style> à travers une déchirure de la taille d’un Peglin.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Las paredes del pasillo se están <wiggle>agrietando</wiggle> y dejan ver mundos parecidos al tuyo. Las grietas se hacen más grandes mientras avanzas, revelando incontables monstruos. Cerca del final del pasillo ves un <style=damage>Jefe del Bosque</style> a través de una grieta del tamaño de un Peglin.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: 'Die Wände des Ganges scheinen auseinanderzureißen und enthüllen dahinter Welten, die ganz genau wie deine aussehen. Die Weltenrisse werden größer und größer und du siehst in ihnen zahllose Ungeheuer. Nah am Ende des Ganges kannst du durch einen Spalt in Peglingröße einen alten Bekannten erblicken: <style=damage>ein Waldboss!</style> '
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: De muren van de gang lijken te <wiggle>scheuren</wiggle> en onthullen werelden die erg lijken op die van jou. De scheuren worden groter en groter naarmate je verder komt en onthullen ontelbare monsters. Aan het einde van de gang zie je door een scheur, ter grootte van een Peglin, een <style=damage>Woudbaas</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: I muri del corridoio paiono <wiggle>strapparsi</wiggle>, mostrando dei mondi molto simili al tuo. Gli strappi si allargano sempre più, rivelando innumerevoli mostri. Verso la fine del corridoio vedi un <style=damage>boss della foresta</style>, attraverso uno strappo grande come un Peglin.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: As paredes do corredor parecem se <wiggle>despedaçar</wiggle>, revelando mundos muito parecidos com o seu. As rachaduras ficam cada vez maiores enquanto você avança, revelando incontáveis monstros. Perto do final do corredor você vê um <style=damage>Chefão da Floresta</style> através de uma rachadura do tamanho de um Peglin.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Стены коридора будто бы <wiggle>разрываются</wiggle>, обнажая миры, очень похожие на этот. С каждым шагом разрывы становятся все больше и больше, сквозь них видны орды бесчисленных монстров. Ближе к концу коридора сквозь разрыв размером с пеглина вы видите <style=damage>Лесного Босса</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 走廊的墙壁似乎正在被<wiggle>撕裂</wiggle>，露出和你所处世界相仿的另一个世界。越往前走，裂缝越大，露出的怪物不计其数。在走廊尽头，透过一个和你身形大小相近的裂缝，你看到了一个<style=damage>森林Boss</style>。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 走廊的牆壁似乎正在被<wiggle>撕裂</wiggle>，露出和你所處世界相仿的另一個世界。越往前走，裂縫越大，露出了無數的怪物。在走廊盡頭，透過一個和你身形相近的裂縫，你看到了一個<style=damage>森林首領</style>。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "通路の壁に、「君が見知った世界」が映る<wiggle>裂け目</wiggle>がある……\n\n前に進むにつれてそれは大きくなり、無数のモンスターがその中で\nひしめく姿が垣間見える。通路の最奥にあるペグリンほどの\n小さな裂け目には、<style=damage>森林エリアのボス</style>の姿があった。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 복도의 벽이 <wiggle>찢어지면서</wiggle> 당신의 것과 아주 비슷한 모습의 다른 세계들을 보여줍니다. 당신이 나아가는 동안 균열은 점점 더 커지고, 수많은 괴물들이 그 속에 보입니다. 복도의 끝에서, 당신은 페글린이 들어갈 수 있을 만큼의 균열 속에 <style=damage>숲의 보스</style>가 있는 것을 봅니다.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Ściany korytarza zdają się rozrywać, odsłaniając światy podobne do twojego. Im dalej idziesz, tym rozdarcia coraz bardziej rosną, ukazując niezliczone liczby potworów. Na końcu korytarza, przez wyrwę wielkości Peglina, widzisz <style=damage>Leśnego Bossa</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: Koridorun duvarları çatlamaya başladı, çatlakların arasından seninkine çok benzeyen başka dünyalar görebiliyorsun. Sen ilerledikçe çatlaklar büyümeye devam ediyor ve her birinden sayısız canavarlar beliriyor. Koridorun sonuna doğru tam senin boyunda bir çatlağın arasında bir <style=damage>Orman Bossunu</style> görebiliyorsun.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
