    - id: 1
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Pictures
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Description
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: The walls of this section of tunnel are reflective and <shake>fragmented</shake> like a shattered mirror. You catch glimpses of various <style=peglin>Peglins</style> holding out various orbs that are just beyond your grasp... or are they?
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: The walls of this section of tunnel are reflective and <shake>fragmented</shake> like a shattered mirror. You catch glimpses of various <style=peglin>Peglins</style> holding out various orbs that are just beyond your grasp... or are they?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Les murs de cette section de la galerie sont réfléchissants et <shake>fragmentés</shake> comme un miroir brisé. Vous apercevez du coin de l’œil divers <style=peglin>Peglins</style> qui vous tendent différents orbes, tout juste hors de votre portée... ou pas ?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Los muros de esta sección de túnel son reflectantes y están <shake>fragmentados</shake> como un espejo roto. Vislumbras varios <style=peglin>Peglins</style> sosteniendo orbes que están fuera de tu alcance... ¿o no lo están?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Die Wände dieses Tunnelabschnittes sind reflektierend und <shake>zerbrochen</shake>, wie ein zerschlagener Spiegel. Du siehst, schemenhaft, einige <style=peglin>Peglins</style>, die vor sich verschiedene Orbs halten, aber gerade außer Reichweite sind... oder?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: De wanden van dit gedeelte van de tunnel zijn reflecterend en <shake>gefragmenteerd</shake> als een verbrijzelde spiegel. Je vangt een glimp op van verschillende <style=peglin>Peglins</style> die verschillende bollen vasthouden net buiten je bereik... of toch niet?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: I muri di questa parte di tunnel sono riflettenti e <shake>frammentati</shake>, come uno specchio rotto. Intravedi diversi <style=peglin>Peglin</style> porgere varie sfere che sono appena oltre la tua portata... o forse no?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: As paredes dessa seção refletem e estão <shake>fragmentadas</shake> como um espelho quebrado. Você consegue ver vários <style=peglin>Peglins</style> segurando vários orbes que estão além de seu alcance... ou será que não?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Стены этого участка туннеля усеяны блестящими <shake>осколками</shake> и напоминают разбитое зеркало. В них мелькают разные <style=peglin>пеглины</style>, которые протягивают вам всевозможные шары. Их не достать... или все же можно?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 这截隧道的墙壁就像一面<shake>破碎</shake>的镜子。你瞥见其中有许多<style=peglin>哥布林</style>手握各色弹珠，但你却无法伸手够到它们。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 這條隧道的牆壁就像一面<shake>破碎</shake>的鏡子。你瞥見其中有許多<style=peglin>哥布林</style>握著各種不同的彈珠，它們是幻象 ···還是真物呢？
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "この坑道には、粉々に砕かれた鏡のような壁が\n<shake>各所</shake>に存在し、周囲の景色を鮮明に映し出している。\n君が鏡のような壁をチラリと覗き込むと、\nさまざまな<style=peglin>ペグリン</style>が、さまざまなオーブをつかむ姿が写っていた。\n\n鏡面に映り込むオーブは、本当に\n君の手の届かない場所にあるのだろうか……それとも……？"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 터널 벽의 한 부분이 마치 깨진 거울처럼 모습이 반사되고 <shake>조각나</shake> 있습니다. 그 속에서 당신은 여러 <style=peglin>페글린</style>들이 손을 뻗으면 닿을 거리에서 여러가지 구슬을 들고 서 있는 모습을 봅니다... 정말 손만 뻗으면 닿을 수 있을까요?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Ściany w tej części tunelu odbijają światło i są <shake>potrzaskane</shake> jak zbite lustro. Zauważasz fragmenty różnych <style=peglin>Peglinów</style> trzymających różne kulki nieco poza zasięgiem twoich rąk... ale czy aby na pewno?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: Tünelin bu kısmındaki duvarlar <shake>çatlamış</shake> bir aynaya benziyor. Bazı yansımalarda sana toplar uzatan başka <style=peglin>Peglinler</style> görüyorsun. Acaba uzanıp o toplardan birini alabilir misin?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
