    - id: 4
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Pictures
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Description
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "You mimic <style=peglin>the Peglins</style> by holding out an orb in both hands. Your mind is flooded with \"memories\" of holding out countless orbs countless times, with <style=peglin>other Peglins</style> reaching through the mirrors and accepting your offerings.\nYour mind is much heavier now, but your satchel is much lighter."
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: "You mimic <style=peglin>the Peglins</style> by holding out an orb in both hands. Your mind is flooded with \"memories\" of holding out countless orbs countless times, with <style=peglin>other Peglins</style> reaching through the mirrors and accepting your offerings.\nYour mind is much heavier now, but your satchel is much lighter."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous imitez <style=peglin>les Peglins</style> en tendant un orbe de chaque main. Votre esprit est inondé de « souvenirs » où vous tendez d’innombrables orbes, un nombre incalculable de fois, les <style=peglin>autres Peglins</style> se penchant à travers les miroirs et acceptant votre offrande. Votre cœur est bien plus lourd, mais votre sacoche est plus légère.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Imitas a <style=peglin>los Peglins</style> sosteniendo un orbe en ambas manos. Tu mente se inunda de "recuerdos" de haber sostenido incontables orbes incontables veces, mientras <style=peglin>otros Peglins</style> pasaban sus propias manos a través del espejo y tomaban tus ofrendas. Tu mente se siente pesada, pero tu bolso se siente mucho más liviano.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Du imitierst <style=peglin>die Peglins</style>, indem du ein Orb in beide Hände nimmst. Dein Geist wird überflutet mit "Erinnerungen", in denen du unzählige Male unzählige Orbs gehalten hast, während <style=peglin>die anderen Peglins</style> durch die Spiegel greifen und deine Gaben annehmen. Dein Geist ist jetzt unfassbar schwer, aber dafür ist deine Tasche viel leichter.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: "Je bootst <style=peglin>de Peglins</style> na door je armen uit te steken met een bol in beide handen. Je hoofd wordt overspoeld met \"herinneringen\" aan het ontelbare keren uitsteken van je armen met ontelbare bollen, met <style=peglin>andere Peglins</style> reikend door de spiegels om je aanbod te accepteren.\nJe hoofd is nu veel zwaarder, maar je schoudertas is veel lichter."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Imiti <style=peglin>i Peglin</style>, porgendo una sfera in ogni mano. La tua mente viene inondata da "ricordi" di aver porto infinite sfere infinite volte, con <style=peglin>altri Peglin</style> che si sporgono attraverso gli specchi e accettano le tue offerte. La tua mente è molto più pesante ora, ma il tuo zaino è più leggero.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você imita <style=peglin>os Peglins</style> segurando um orbe com as duas mãos. Sua mente é inundada com "memórias" de segurar incontáveis orbes incontáveis vezes, com <style=peglin>outros Peglins</style> te alcançando através de espelhos e aceitando sua oferta. Sua mente está muito mais pesada, mas sua bolsa muito mais leve.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Вы встаете в ту же позу, что и <style=peglin>пеглины</style> в зеркале, держа шар обеими руками. В голове появляются «воспоминания» о том, как вы множество раз протягивали множество шаров, а <style=peglin>другие пеглины</style> тянулись сквозь зеркало и принимали ваши подношения. На душе стало намного тяжелее, но зато сумка стала намного легче.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: "你试图模仿碎镜中的<style=peglin>哥布林</style>，用双手捧着一颗弹珠。刹那间，你的脑海充斥着无数次手捧各色弹珠的“记忆”。<style=peglin>镜中的哥布林</style>伸出手来取走了你献出的弹珠。\n你的脑袋昏昏沉沉，但挎包却轻了不少。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: "你試圖模仿碎鏡中的<style=peglin>哥布林</style>，用雙手捧著一顆彈珠。剎那間，你的腦海充斥著無數次手捧各種彈珠的「記憶」。<style=peglin>鏡中的哥布林</style>伸出手取走了你獻出的彈珠。\n你的腦袋昏昏沉沉，但彈珠袋卻輕了不少。 "
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "<style=peglin>鏡面に映るペグリン</style>を真似て両手でオーブを差し出す。\nその瞬間、君が無数のオーブを何度も差し出す中、<style=peglin>鏡の中のペグリン</style>が\n手を伸ばし、それらを供物としてつかみ取ろうとする\n「記憶」で頭の中がいっぱいになった……\n\n……だいぶ気が重くなったものの、カバンはすっかり軽くなっていた。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: "당신은 <style=peglin>페글린</style>들을 따라 양손에 구슬을 잡고 내밉니다. 그 순간, 당신의 머리에는 수많은 구슬들을 내밀었던 수많은 '기억들'이 떠오릅니다. 그 기억 속에서, <style=peglin>다른 페글린</style>들은 거울 너머로 손을 뻗어 당신이 내민 구슬을 가져갔습니다.\n 당신의 머리는 아주 복잡해졌지만, 가방은 훨씬 가벼워졌습니다."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Naśladujesz <style=peglin>Pegliny</style>, trzymając kulki w obu rękach. Twój umysł zalewają "wspomnienia" trzymania nieskończonej liczby kulek, nieskończoną liczbę razy, kiedy <style=peglin>inne Pegliny</style> sięgają przez lustra i odbierają ofiarowane im kulki. Ciężej ci z tym na umyśle, ale za to twoja torba jest znacznie lżejsza.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: Diğer <style=peglin>Peglinleri</style> taklit ederek duvara doğru bir top uzattın. Aklın sayısız uzattığın topun ve onlara sayısız kere uzanan <style=peglin>başka Peglinlerin</style> "hatıraları" ile doluyor. Aklın ağır düşünceler altında kaldı, ama çantan artık çok daha hafif.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      conversationID: 2
