      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: You grab for the nearest orb as it shifts and changes before your eyes. The mirrors grow dull as your retrieve it, but <style=objectOfInterest>the Mirrorb</style> continues to shift mysteriously.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: You grab for the nearest orb as it shifts and changes before your eyes. The mirrors grow dull as you retrieve it, but <style=objectOfInterest>the Mirrorb</style> continues to shift mysteriously.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous saisissez l’orbe le plus proche, qui se transforme et change sous vos yeux. Les miroirs se ternissent lorsque vous le touchez, mais <style=objectOfInterest>le Mirrorbe</style> continue de fluctuer mystérieusement.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Tomas el orbe más cercano, que cambia y se transforma frente a tus ojos. Al hacerlo, los espejos pierden su lustre, pero <style=objectOfInterest>el Espejorbe</style> continúa cambiando misteriosamente.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Du greifst nach dem nächsten Orb, das sich vor deinen Augen verändert und wabert. Die Spiegel werden matt, als du es nimmst, aber der <style=objectOfInterest>Spiegelball</style> wabert weiter vor sich hin.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Je grijpt naar de dichtstbijzijnde bol terwijl deze voor je ogen verschuift en verandert. De spiegels worden dof als je hem pakt, maar <style=objectOfInterest>de Spiegelbol</style> blijft op mysterieuze wijze verschuiven.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Afferri la sfera più vicina, che cambia e muta davanti ai tuoi occhi. Lo specchio si fa opaco quando la prendi, ma <style=objectOfInterest>la Specchiosfera</style> continua a mutare misteriosamente.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você pega o orbe mais próximo enquanto ele está diferente a cada vez que você olha para ele. Os espelhos se tornam opacos enquanto você carrega o orbe, mas <style=objectOfInterest>o Espelhorbe</style> continua a se transformar misteriosamente.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Вы хватаете ближайший шар, и он меняется и переливается у вас на глазах. Зеркала постепенно тускнеют, но <style=objectOfInterest>Подражар</style> продолжает загадочно переливаться.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 离你最近的一颗弹珠正随着你的目光移动而变化和漂移。当你抓住它时，镜子逐渐黯淡无光，但<style=objectOfInterest>镜像弹珠</style>仍然在诡异地漂移。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 離你最近的一顆彈珠正隨著你的目光移動而變化轉動。當你抓住它時，鏡子逐漸黯淡無光，但<style=objectOfInterest>鏡像彈珠</style>仍然詭異地轉動著。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "一番近くにあったオーブに手を伸ばすと、\n目の前でその形状が変わるのがはっきりと見えた。\nオーブをつかんだ瞬間、鏡のような壁はくすみ、煌めきを失った。\n\n――手に入れた「<style=objectOfInterest>ミラーオーブ</style>」は今もなお、\n不可思議な変化を続けている……"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 당신이 가장 가까운 구슬을 집자 눈앞에서 구슬의 모양이 바뀝니다. 구슬을 회수하자 거울은 흐릿해졌지만, <style=objectOfInterest>비치구</style>는 계속 신비하게 모양이 변합니다.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Łapiesz najbliższą kulkę, gdy ta migocze i zmienia się na twoich oczach. Lustro staje się zamglone, gdy ją wyciągasz, ale <style=objectOfInterest>Zwierciulka</style> nadal tajemniczo migocze.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: En yakındaki topu yakaladın ve ellerinin arasına başka bir topa dönüştü! Ayna duvar parlaklığını kaybetti ve gizemli <style=objectOfInterest>Aynatopunu</style> çantana attın.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
