      - title: ru
        value: Aguentar o impacto. <style=damage>(-[var=brace_dmg] PV)</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Приготовиться к удару <style=damage>(-[var=brace_dmg] ОЗ)</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 抗下撞击<style=damage>（ - [var=brace_dmg] 血量）</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 準備承受撞擊（<style=damage>- [var=brace_dmg] 點血量</style>）
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: 衝撃に備える <style=damage>（HP -[var=brace_dmg]）</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 받아내기 <style=damage>(체력 -[var=brace_dmg])</style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value:
        type: 4
