      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: You brace yourself as best you can as the minecart rams you against the stone wall and continues on its way. You think you'll avoid the cart tracks from now on...
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: You brace yourself as best you can as the minecart rams you against the stone wall and continues on its way. You think you'll avoid the cart tracks from now on...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous tenez bon alors que le chariot vous projette contre le mur de pierre et continue sa course. Vous vous dites que vous allez dorénavant éviter les chemins de fer...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Te proteges lo mejor que puedes mientras el vagón minero te embiste contra el muro de piedra. Decides evitar las vías de ahora en adelante...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Du versuchst, die Lore so gut es geht abzufangen, doch sie rammt dich einfach in die hinter dir liegende Steinwand und fährt dann weiter. Du solltest die Gleise in Zukunft meiden...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Je zet je schrap zo goed als je kan terwijl het mijnkarretje je tegen de stenen muur ramt en zijn weg vervolgt. Je denkt dat je vanaf nu de rails zult vermijden...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Ti prepari meglio che puoi, mentre il carrello scaraventa contro al muro di pietra e continua per la sua strada. Forse d’ora in poi meglio evitare di seguire i binari...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você tenta aguentar o impacto o máximo que pode enquanto o carrinho de mina te arremessa contra uma parede de pedra e continua seu caminho. Você acha melhor evitar trilhos de agora em diante...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Вы как следует группируетесь. Вагонетка отбрасывает вас на каменную стену и мчится дальше. Вы думаете, что с этого момента будешь сторониться тележек...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 矿车将你撞向石墙后继续轰轰驶去，你勉强支撑起自己。或许之后该考虑避开铁轨了 ······
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 你被彈向了石牆，礦車則繼續轟轟駛去。你決定之後要避開鐵軌了 ······
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "トロッコは、覚悟を決めた君を\n背後の石壁にぶつけながら走り去っていった。\n\nこれからは線路の上を歩くのはよそう……"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 광산차는 충격에 대비하고 있던 당신을 돌 벽으로 날려버리고는 갈 길을 가버립니다. 이제부터 철도는 피하는 게 좋을 것 같네요...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Przygotowałeś się jak mogłeś, ale i tak wózek cię staranował i rozpłaszczył na kamiennej ścianie. Chyba dobrym pomysłem będzie omijanie szyn...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: Vagon sana çarpıp duvara yapıştırdı ve yoluna devam etti. Bundan sonra raylardan uzak dursan iyi olur...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
