      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: You manage to spring out of the way but you twist your ankle on the landing. It's not ideal, but you can carry on.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: You manage to spring out of the way but you twist your ankle on the landing. It's not ideal, but you can carry on.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous réussissez à vous jeter à l’écart, mais vous vous tordez la cheville en vous réceptionnant. Ce n’est pas idéal, mais vous pouvez continuer.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Alcanzas a saltar fuera del camino, pero te tuerces el tobillo al caer. No es lo ideal, pero puedes seguir adelante.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Du schaffst es, rechtzeitig zur Seite zu springen, knickst bei der Landung allerdings mit deinem Fuß um. Nicht ideal, aber du kannst wenigstens weiterlaufen.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Het lukt je om uit de weg te springen, maar je verdraait je enkel bij je landing. Het is niet ideaal, maar je kunt doorgaan.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Riesci a saltare via dai binari, ma ti storci la caviglia nell'atterraggio. Non è il massimo, ma riesci a proseguire.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você consegue pular para fora do caminho mas acaba torcendo seu tornozelo na aterrissagem. Não seria o ideal, mas você pode continuar.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: У вас получается отпрыгнуть, но при приземлении подворачиваете ногу. Не все прошло гладко, но жить можно.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 你在撞击前及时跳开，却在落地时扭伤了脚踝。虽然并不如意，但你仍可以负伤前行。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 你在撞擊前及時跳開，卻在落地時扭傷了腳踝。雖然不盡人意，但也只能繼續前行。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "なんとかして線路の外へ飛び出してみたものの、\n着地の際に<style=damage>足首をゴキッとひねってしまった</style>！\n\n……最善策ではなかったものの、ひとまず旅は続けられるだろう。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 당신은 간신히 피하는데 성공하지만, 착지하면서 발목을 삡니다. 좋은 상황은 아니지만, 나아가지 못 할 정도는 아닙니다.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Udało ci się odskoczyć, ale lądując skręciłeś sobie kostkę. Nie wyszło idealnie, ale dasz sobie radę z dalszą drogą.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: Kenara atlamayı başardın ama yere inerken bileğini burktun. İdeal değil, ama yürümeye devam edebiliyorsun.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
