    - id: 7
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Pictures
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Description
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: You jump as high as you can and manage to land in the cart! You can't avoid <style=stone>some stones ending up in your satchel</style> though, and you have no idea where you're going!
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: You jump as high as you can and manage to land in the cart! You can't avoid <style=stone>some Pebballs</style> ending up in your satchel, and you have no idea where you're going!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous bondissez le plus haut possible et atterrissez dans le chariot ! Vous ne pouvez cependant pas empêcher <style=stone> des pierres</style> de finir dans votre sacoche, et vous ne savez pas où vous allez...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: ¡Saltas lo más alto que puedes y logras caer dentro del vagón! ¡No puedes evitar que <style=stone>unos Guijarros</style> se metan dentro de tu bolso, y no tienes la menor idea de adónde vas!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Du springst so hoch du kannst und landest tatsächlich unbeschadet in der Lore! Allerdings fallen <style=stone>einige Steine</style> in deine Tasche und du hast absolut keine Ahnung, wo du eigentlich hinfährst...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Je springt zo hoog als je kunt en weet in het karretje te landen! Je kunt echter niet voorkomen dat <style=stone>een paar stenen in je schoudertas belanden</style>, en je hebt geen idee waarheen je gaat!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Salti più in alto che puoi e riesci ad atterrare nel carrello! Non puoi evitare che <style=stone>delle Sassosfere</style> finiscano nel tuo zaino, e non hai idea di dove stai andando!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você pula o mais alto que consegue e entra dentro do carrinho! Você não consegue evitar que <style=stone>alguns Cascalhorbes entrem em sua bolsa</style>, além de que, você não tem ideia de onde está indo!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Вы прыгаете так высоко, как только можете, и умудряетесь приземлиться в вагонетке! <style=stone>Несколько камней</style> попадает к вам в сумку, а еще вы без понятия, куда теперь едете!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 你竭尽所能跳上矿车！但无法避免<style=stone>一些石头</style>滚进你的挎包，你也不知道矿车会将你带向何方。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 你竭盡所能跳上了礦車！但不小心讓<style=stone>一些圓石彈珠</style>滾進你的彈珠袋中，並且不知道礦車會將你帶向何方。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "勢いよくジャンプしたおかげで、\nなんとかトロッコに乗ることができた！\nしかしながら、「<style=stone>石ころ</style>」がいくつかカバンに入ってくるし、\nトロッコの行き先も分からないままだ！"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 당신은 높이 뛰어올라 광산차에 올라타는데 성공합니다! 몇 개의 <style=stone>펩볼</style>이 가방 안에 들어오는 거에 더해, 대체 어느 방향으로 가고 있는지조차도 모르겠지만요!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Wyskoczyłeś tak wysoko jak to możliwe i wylądowałeś w wózku! Nie udało ci się uniknąć <style=stone> kamieni wpadających do twojej torby </style> i co więcej, nie masz pojęcia dokąd jedziesz!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: Atlayabildiğin kadar yükseğe atlayıp vagona girmeyi başardın! Ama <style=stone>birkaç taş çantana girdi</style> ve nereye gittiğin hakkında hiçbir fikrin yok!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
