        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "You encounter a <style=peglin>weathered old Peglin</style> <bounce>flipping a poker chip</bounce> through their nimble fingers.\n\"Do you consider yourself a gambler?\""
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: "You encounter a <style=peglin>weathered old Peglin</style> <bounce>flipping a poker chip</bounce> through their nimble fingers.\n\"Do you consider yourself a gambler?\""
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous rencontrez un <style=peglin>vieux Peglin</style> qui <bounce>fait tourner un jeton de poker</bounce> entre ses doigts agiles. « Vous considérez-vous comme un joueur ? »
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Te encuentras con un <style=peglin>Peglin viejo y curtido</style> <bounce>dando vueltas una ficha de póker</bounce> entre sus ágiles dedos.  "¿Te sientes afortunado?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: "Du triffst einen <style=peglin>betagten alten Peglin</style>, der <bounce>einen Poker-Chip</bounce> durch seine flinken Finger schnippt.\n\"Siehst du dich als ein Gewinner?\""
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: "Je komt een <style=peglin>verweerde oude Peglin</style> tegen die <bounce>een pokerchip aan het rollen is</bounce> over zijn behendige vingers.\n\"Beschouw je jezelf als een gokker?\""
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Incontri un <style=peglin>Peglin molto vecchio</style>, intento a <bounce>far rigirarsi una chip da poker</bounce> tra le agili dita. "Tu giochi d'azzardo?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você encontra um <style=peglin>velho e cansado Peglin</style> <bounce>girando uma ficha de pôquer</bounce> entre seus ágeis dedos. "Você se considera um apostador?"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Вы встречаете <style=peglin>потрепанного старого Азартлина</style>, который проворно подбрасывает <bounce>покерную фишку</bounce>. — Ты считаешь себя азартным игроком?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: "你遇到了一个<style=peglin>饱经风霜的老哥布林</style>，他灵活的指间<bounce>正把玩着一枚筹码</bounce>。\n“你想和我来上一局吗？”"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: "你遇到了一個<style=peglin>飽經風霜的老哥布林</style>，他靈活的指間<bounce>正把玩著一枚籌碼</bounce>。\n「你想和我來上一局嗎？」"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "軽快に<bounce>ポーカーチップを投げる</bounce><style=peglin>年老いたペグリン</style>と出会った。\n「お前さん、自分のことをギャンブラーだと考えたことは？」"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: "당신은 <style=peglin>늙고 야윈 페글린</style>이 날렵한 손가락을 움직이며 <bounce>포커 칩을 튕기고 있는 것</bounce>을 발견합니다.\n \"자네, 도박 좀 하는가?\""
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: "Spotkałeś <style=peglin>wymęczonego, starego Peglina </style> <bounce>bawiącego się żetonem pokerowym</bounce> swoimi zręcznymi palcami.\n\"Myślisz może, że jesteś ryzykantem?\" "
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: "Karşına parmaklarının arasında <bounce>bir poker çipi çeviren</bounce> <style=peglin>yaşlı bir Peglin</style> çıktı.\n\"İyi bir kumarbaz mısın?\""
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
