        value: "<style=heal>You win the flip!</style> The <style=peglin>other Peglin</style> gives you a wry smile and hands over <style=objectOfInterest>the chip</style>.\n\"Thanks for playing, can't wait until next time!\""
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: '<style=heal>Vous gagnez le pari !</style> L’<style=peglin>autre Peglin</style> vous fait un sourire en coin et vous tend <style=objectOfInterest>le jeton</style>. « Merci d’avoir joué, j’ai hâte de remettre ça ! »'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: '<style=heal>¡Ganas el lanzamiento!</style> El <style=peglin>otro Peglin</style> esboza una ligera sonrisa y te da <style=objectOfInterest>la ficha</style>.  "Gracias por jugar. ¡Hasta la próxima!"'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: "<style=heal>Du gewinnst das Glücksspiel!</style> Der <style=peglin>andere Peglin</style> gibt dir ein schiefes Grinsen und überreicht dir <style=objectOfInterest>den Chip</style>.\n\"Danke fürs Spielen. Bis zum nächsten Mal!\""
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: "<style=heal>Jij wint de toss!</style> De <style=peglin>andere Peglin</style> geeft je een droge glimlach en overhandigt <style=objectOfInterest>de chip</style>.\n\"Bedankt voor het spelen, ik kan niet wachten tot de volgende keer!\""
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: '<style=heal>Hai vinto al lancio!</style> <style=peglin>Il vecchio Peglin</style> ti sorride con una smorfia e ti dona <style=objectOfInterest>la chip</style>. "Grazie di aver giocato, non vedo l''ora di farlo di nuovo!"'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: '<style=heal>Você ganha a aposta!</style> O <style=peglin>outro Peglin</style> te dá um sorriso irônico e entrega <style=objectOfInterest>a ficha</style>. "Obrigado por jogar, mal posso esperar pela próxima vez!"'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: '<style=heal>Вы выиграли!</style> <style=peglin>Азартлин</style> криво улыбается и отдает вам <style=objectOfInterest>фишку</style>. — Спасибо за игру, приятель. Жду не дождусь новой встречи!'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: "你赢了！赌徒哥布林报以狡猾的微笑，递给你一个筹码。\n“感谢参与，我们下次什么时候才能再来一局呢？”"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: "<style=heal>你贏了賭局！</style><style=peglin>賭徒哥布林</style> 露出苦笑並遞給你一枚<style=objectOfInterest>籌碼</style>。\n「玩得不錯，真期待下次的交手！」"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "<style=heal>ギャンブルに勝った！！</style>\n<style=peglin>年老いたペグリン</style>は苦笑いしながら君に『<style=objectOfInterest>チップ</style>』を手渡す。\n「へへ、付き合ってくれてありがとな……次が楽しみだ！」"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: "당신은 칩 뒤집기에서 <style=heal>승리</style>했습니다! <style=peglin>다른 페글린</style>은 당신에게 씁쓸한 웃음을 짓더니 <style=objectOfInterest>칩</style>을 건넵니다.\n \"놀아줘서 고맙네, 다음이 기대되는구만!\""
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: "<style=heal>Wygrałeś rzut!</style> <style=peglin>Drugi Peglin</style> w wykrzywionym uśmiechu oddaje ci <style=objectOfInterest>pokerowy żeton</style>.\n\"Dzięki za grę, do zobaczenia!\""
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: "<style=heal>Kazandın!</style> <style=peglin>Diğer Peglin</style> sana alaycı bir şekilde sırıttı ve <style=objectOfInterest>çipi</style> uzattı.\n\"Oynadığın için teşekkürler, bir dahaki sefer için sabırsızlanıyorum!\""
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
