      - title: en
        value: As you're running your hand down the corridor wall you discover the entrance to a small passageway.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: En passant votre main le long du mur du couloir, vous découvrez l’entrée d’un petit passage.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Mientras pasas la mano por la pared del pasillo, encuentras la entrada a un pequeño pasadizo.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Während du mit deiner Hand langsam an der Wand des Korridors hinabfährst, entdeckst du den Beginn eines schmalen Durchgangs.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Terwijl je met je hand over de muur van de gang gaat, ontdek je de ingang van een kleine doorgang.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Stai facendo passare la tua mano sul muro del corridoio quando scopri un piccolo passaggio.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Enquanto você anda por um corredor, você encontra uma pequena passagem na parede.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Вы проводите рукой по стене коридора и находите незаметный узкий проход.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 你用手沿着走廊壁摸索时，发现了一处小通道的入口。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 在你用手沿著走廊牆壁摸索時，發現了一處小密道的入口。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "壁を手でなぞりながら進んでいると、\n小さな通路への抜け道を発見した。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 당신은 복도 벽에 손을 대고 걷다가 작은 통로로 이어지는 입구를 발견합니다.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Przesuwając rękę po ścianie korytarza, odkrywasz wejście do małego przejścia.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: Elini duvarlara sürterken duvarların arasında ufak bir geçit keşfettin.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
