      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: You catch a glimpse of an <style=echo><dangle>ethereal Peglin</dangle></style>. It appears to be some kind of echo of its former self, or... of yourself?
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: You catch a glimpse of an <style=echo><dangle>ethereal Peglin</dangle></style>. It appears to be some kind of echo of its former self, or... of yourself?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous apercevez un <style=echo><dangle>Peglin éthéré</dangle></style>. Il semble être une sorte de vestige de lui-même, ou... de vous-même ?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Vislumbras un <style=echo><dangle>Peglin etéreo</dangle></style>. Parece ser algún tipo de eco de su ser anterior, o... ¿de ti mismo?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Du erblickst einen <style=echo><dangle>geisterhaften Peglin</style></dangle>. Er scheint irgendwie das Echo seines früheren Selbst zu sein, oder... ein Echo von dir?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Je vangt een glimp op van een <style=echo><dangle>etherische Peglin</dangle></style>. Het lijkt een soort echo te zijn van z'n vroegere zelf, of... van jouzelf?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Scorgi un <style=echo><dangle>Peglin etereo</dangle></style>. Sembra che sia una sorta di eco del vecchio sé... o... forse di te?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você observa um <style=echo><dangle>Peglin etéreo</dangle></style>. Ele parece ser algum tipo de fantasma do que já foi antes, ou... de você mesmo?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Вы замечаете <style=echo><dangle>призрачного пеглина</dangle></style>. Кажется, это отголосок его прежнего или... или же вас?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 你看到了一个<style=echo><dangle>空灵的哥布林</dangle></style>。似乎是某个哥布林的幽灵，又或者 ······这是你自己的幽灵？
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 你看見了一個<style=echo><dangle>飄渺的哥布林</dangle></style>。它似乎是某個哥布林的幽靈，還是說 ···這是你自己的？
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "<style=echo><dangle>この世ならざるペグリン</dangle></style>の姿がふと目に入った。\nそれはかつての自分、あるいは今の自分の残像のようにも見えるが……？"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 당신은 <style=echo><dangle>천사 같은 모습의 페글린</dangle></style>을 발견합니다. 옛 주인의 메아리... 어쩌면 당신의 메아리일지도 모릅니다.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Zauważasz <style=echo><dangle>wiecznego Peglina</dangle></style>. Wydaje się być cieniem samego siebie lub... ciebie?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: Gözlerinin önüne <style=echo><dangle>ruhani bir Peglinin</dangle></style> görüntüsü geldi. Geçmişin bir yankısına benziyor... senin geçmişinin?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
