      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: You find yourself looking at <color=white>two identical altars</color>, each with a perfect location to place an orb.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: You find yourself looking at <color=white>two identical altars</color>, each with a perfect location to place an orb.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous êtes en train de regarder <color=white>deux autels identiques</color>, chacun avec un emplacement parfait pour placer un orbe.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Te encuentras ante <color=white>dos altares idénticos</color>, cada uno con un agujero perfecto para colocar un orbe.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Du stößt auf <color=white>zwei vollkommen identische Altare</color>, jeder mit einem kleinen perfekten Platz, um ein Orb darauf abzulegen.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Je kijkt naar <color=white>twee identieke altaren</color>, elk met een perfecte locatie om een bol te plaatsen.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Ti trovi di fronte a <color=white>due altari identici</color>, ciascuno con un incavo perfetto per collocare una sfera.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você se encontra olhando para <color=white>dois altares idênticos</color>, cada um com um lugar perfeito pra colocar um orbe.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Оказывается, вы уже какое-то время смотрите на <color=white>два абсолютно одинаковых алтаря</color>. На каждом из них есть идеальное углубление для шара.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 你的面前有<color=white>两座完全相同的祭坛</color>，每座祭坛上都有一个恰好可以容纳一颗弹珠的凹槽。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 你的面前有<color=white>兩座完全相同的祭壇</color>，它們上面都有一個可以放置一顆彈珠的凹槽。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "目の前に、<color=white>全く同じ形の二つの祭壇</color>がひっそりと佇んでいる。\n各祭壇には、オーブを置くのにちょうど良いくぼみがある。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 당신은 구슬을 올려놓기 딱 알맞은 공간이 있는 <color=white>두 개의 똑같은 제단</color>과 마주쳤습니다.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Spostrzegasz <color=white>dwa identyczne ołtarze</color>, każdy z nich z idealnym wgłębieniem na kulkę.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: Karşına <color=white>birbiriyle aynı iki sunak</color> çıktı. Üzerlerinde bir topun tam oturacağı çukurluklar var.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
