      - title: en
        value: Another <style=objectOfInterest>[var=chosenOrb]</style> appears on the matching altar! You scoop it up and continue on your way.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Un autre <style=objectOfInterest>[var=chosenOrb]</style> apparaît sur l’autel adjacent ! Vous le ramassez et continuez votre chemin.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: ¡Otro <style=objectOfInterest>[var=chosenOrb]</style> aparece en el otro altar! Lo recoges y continúas tu camino.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Ein weiteres <style=objectOfInterest>[var=chosenOrb]</style> erscheint auf dem passenden Altar! Du greifst es schnell und nimmst es mit.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Nog een <style=objectOfInterest>[var=chosenOrb]</style> verschijnt op het andere altaar! Je pikt het op en vervolgt je weg.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Una seconda<style=objectOfInterest>[var=chosenOrb]</style> appare sul secondo altare! La raccogli e prosegui il tuo cammino.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Outro <style=objectOfInterest>[var=chosenOrb]</style> aparece no outro altar! Você o pega e continua sua jornada.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: На втором алтаре появляется такой же <style=objectOfInterest>[var=chosenOrb]</style>! Вы забираете оба шара и продолжаете путь.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 另一座祭坛上出现了一颗<style=objectOfInterest>[var=chosenOrb]</style>！你把它捡起来，继续上路。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 在另一座祭壇上出現另一顆<style=objectOfInterest>[var=chosenOrb]</style>！你撿起了它，並繼續上路。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "もう一方の祭壇に「<style=objectOfInterest>[var=chosenOrb]</style>」が出現した！\n――君はそれを拾い、旅を続けるのだった。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 새로운 <style=objectOfInterest>[var=chosenOrb]</style> 하나가 옆에 있는 제단에 나타납니다! 당신은 그걸 잽싸게 줍고 여정을 계속합니다.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: '<style=objectOfInterest>[var=chosenOrb]</style> pojawia się na sąsiednim ołtarzu! Zabierasz nową kulkę i ruszasz w dalszą drogę.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value: Diğer sunakta bir <style=objectOfInterest>[var=chosenOrb]</style> ortaya çıktı! Topu aldın ve yoluna devam ettin.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
