    - id: 1
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Pictures
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Description
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "<style=objectOfInterest>A trio of mysterious spirits</style> {rdir}pop out{/rdir} and surprise you on your journey.\n\"I think this little one could use our help!\", one of the spirits <bounce>shouts gleefully</bounce>."
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: "<style=objectOfInterest>A trio of mysterious spirits</style> {rdir}pop out{/rdir} and surprise you on your journey.\n\"I think this little one could use our help!\", one of the spirits <bounce>shouts gleefully</bounce>."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: '<style=objectOfInterest>Un trio d’esprits mystérieux</style> {rdir}surgit{/rdir} et vous surprend au cours de votre voyage. « Je pense que ce petit a besoin de notre aide ! », l’un des esprits <bounce>s’écrie joyeusement</bounce>.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: '<style=objectOfInterest>Un trío de espíritus misteriosos</style> {rdir}aparecen{/rdir} y te sorprenden en tu viaje. "¡Creo que a este pequeñín le vendría bien nuestra ayuda!", <bounce>grita alegremente</bounce> uno de los espíritus.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: '<style=objectOfInterest>Ein Trio mysteriöser Gespenster</style> {rdir}taucht auf{/rdir} und überrascht dich auf deiner Reise. "Ich glaube, dieses kleine Etwas hier könnte unsere Hilfe gebrauchen!", ruft einer der Geister <bounce>fröhlich</bounce>.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: "<style=objectOfInterest>Een trio van mysterieuze geesten</style> {rdir}komt tevoorschijn{/rdir} en verrast je op je reis.\n\"Ik denk dat dit kleintje onze hulp kan gebruiken!\", roept een van de geesten <bounce>vrolijk</bounce>."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: '<style=objectOfInterest>Un trio di misteriosi spiriti</style> {rdir}sbuca fuori{/rdir} e ti sorprende nella tua avventura. "Credo che questo piccoletto possa tornarci utile!", <bounce>esclama allegramente</bounce> uno degli spiriti.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: '<style=objectOfInterest>Um trio de espíritos misteriosos</style> {rdir}aparece{/rdir} e te surpreende na sua jornada. "Eu acho que esse pequenino pode receber uma mãozinha nossa!", um dos espíritos <bounce>diz alegremente</bounce>.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: '<style=objectOfInterest>Три таинственных духа</style> {rdir}появляются из ниоткуда{/rdir} на вашем пути и удивляют вас. «Я думаю, этой мелюзге пригодится наша помощь!», <bounce>радостно воскликнул</bounce> один из духов.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: "<style=objectOfInterest>神秘的精灵三人组</style>在你赶路时{rdir}突然出现{/rdir}，把你吓了一跳。\n“我觉得这个小家伙需要我们的帮助！” 其中一个精灵<bounce>雀跃地</bounce>喊道。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: "<style=objectOfInterest>神秘的精靈三人組</style>在你趕路時{rdir}突然出現{/rdir}，嚇了你一大跳。\n「我覺得這個小傢伙需要我們的幫助！」，其中一個精靈<bounce>雀躍地</bounce>喊道。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "突然、<style=objectOfInterest>3人組の神秘的な精霊</style>が{rdir}飛び出し{/rdir}、君を驚かせた。\n「この子には、ボクらの助けが必要だ！」\n――精霊の1人が<bounce>嬉しそうに叫ぶ</bounce>。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: "\"<style=objectOfInterest>신비로운 유령 셋</style>이 {rdir}나타나{/rdir} 당신을 놀래킵니다.\n \"이 애는 우리 도움이 필요할 거 같아!\" 한 유령이 <bounce>신이 나 외칩니다</bounce>.\""
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: "<style=objectOfInterest>Trójka tajemniczych duszków</style> {rdir}wyskakuje{/rdir} i zaskakuje cię podczas twej podróży.\n\"Wygląda na to, że temu maluchowi przyda się pomoc!\", jeden z duszków <bounce>radośnie wykrzykuje</bounce>."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
