      - title: en
        value: One of the spirits whisks away your <style=loseOrb>[var=orb1Name]</style> as they <style=subtle><incr>disappear into thin air...</incr></style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Un des esprits emporte votre <style=loseOrb>[var=orb1Name]</style> alors qu’ils <style=subtle><incr>disparaissent tous dans les airs...</incr></style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Uno de los espíritus se lleva tu <style=loseOrb>[var=orb1Name]</style> antes de <style=subtle><incr>desaparecer por completo...</incr></style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Eines der Gespenster wischt dein <style=loseOrb>[var=orb1Name]</style> flugs hinfort und <style=subtle><incr>verschwindet ins Nirgendwo...</incr></style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Één van de geesten pikt je <style=loseOrb>[var=orb1Name]</style> weg terwijl ze <style=subtle><incr>verdwijnen...</incr></style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Uno degli spiriti sgraffigna la tua <style=loseOrb>[var=orb1Name]</style> e subito dopo <style=subtle><incr>scompaiono nel nulla...</incr></style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Um dos espíritos pega seu <style=loseOrb>[var=orb1Name]</style> enquanto <style=subtle><incr>desaparece no ar...</incr></style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Один из духов уносит ваш <style=loseOrb>[var=orb1Name]</style> и они <style=subtle><incr> растворяются в воздухе...</incr></style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 其中一个精灵带走了你的<style=loseOrb>[var=orb1Name]</style>，随后他们便<style=subtle><incr>消失在稀薄的空气中······</incr></style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: '其中一個精靈帶走了你的<style=loseOrb>[var=orb1Name]</style>，隨後他們便<style=subtle><incr>消失在稀薄的空氣中 ······</incr></style> '
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "精霊の1人が「<style=loseOrb>[var=orb1Name]</style>」を持ち去ると、\n残りの精霊達も<style=subtle><incr>空の彼方へと消えてしまった……</incr></style>"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 유령 하나가 당신의 <style=loseOrb>[var=orb1Name]</style>을(를) 채가더니 <style=subtle><incr>눈앞에서 사라집니다...</incr></style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Jeden z duszków zabiera twoją <style=loseOrb>[var=orb1Name]</style> podczas, gdy <style=subtle><incr>duszki rozpływają się w powietrzu...</incr></style>
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
