    - id: 6
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Pictures
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Description
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: One of the spirits <style=objectOfInterest><incr>glows with a mysterious light</incr></style> before they all disappear, leaving you slightly stronger with your upgraded <style=objectOfInterest>[var=upgradedOrbVerbose]</style>.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: One of the spirits <style=objectOfInterest><incr>glows with a mysterious light</incr></style> before they all disappear, leaving you slightly stronger with your upgraded <style=objectOfInterest>[var=upgradedOrbVerbose]</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: L’un des esprits <style=objectOfInterest><incr>luit d’une lumière mystérieuse</incr></style> juste avant qu’ils ne disparaissent tous, vous laissant légèrement plus fort avec votre <style=objectOfInterest>[var=upgradedOrbVerbose]</style> amélioré.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Uno de los espíritus <style=objectOfInterest><incr>brilla con una luz misteriosa</incr></style> antes de desaparecer junto a los demás, dejándote un poco más fuerte con tu <style=objectOfInterest>[var=upgradedOrbVerbose]</style> mejorado.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Eines der Gespenster <style=objectOfInterest><incr>leuchtet mit einem geheimnisvollen Licht auf</incr></style>, bevor sie alle verschwinden, dich aber mit deinem verbesserten <style=objectOfInterest>[var=upgradedOrbVerbose]</style> zurücklassen.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Één van de geesten <style=objectOfInterest><incr>gloeit met een mysterieus licht</incr></style> voordat ze allemaal verdwijnen, waarbij je iets sterker wordt achtergelaten met een opgewaardeerde <style=objectOfInterest>[var=upgradedOrbVerbose]</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Uno degli spiriti <style=objectOfInterest><incr>brilla di luce propria</incr></style> prima che tutti scompaiano, lasciandoti leggermente più forte con la tua <style=objectOfInterest>[var=upgradedOrbVerbose]</style> potenziata.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Um dos espíritos <style=objectOfInterest><incr>brilha com uma luz misteriosa</incr></style> antes de desaparecerem, te deixando um pouco mais forte com seu <style=objectOfInterest>[var=upgradedOrbVerbose]</style> melhorado.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Один из духов <style=objectOfInterest><incr>засветился странным светом</incr></style>, а потом они исчезли, а вы стали сильнее с улучшенным <style=objectOfInterest>[var=upgradedOrbVerbose]</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 其中一个精灵<style=objectOfInterest><incr>发出神秘的光芒</incr></style>，随后他们就全部消失了，只留下了一颗升级后的<style=objectOfInterest>[var=upgradedOrbVerbose]</style>。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 其中一個精靈<style=objectOfInterest><incr>發出神秘的光芒</incr></style>，隨後後他們就全部消失，只留下升級後的<style=objectOfInterest>[var=upgradedOrbVerbose]</style >。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "精霊の1人が<style=objectOfInterest><incr>不思議な光を放つ</incr></style>と、精霊達は跡形もなく姿を消した。\n\n――強化された「<style=objectOfInterest>[var=upgradedOrbVerbose]</style>」と、\nほんの少し強くなった君を残して。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 유령 하나가 <style=objectOfInterest><incr>신비로운 빛으로 빛나더니</incr></style> 갑자기 모든 유령이 사라졌습니다. 당신의 손에는 더 강해진 <style=objectOfInterest>[var=upgradedOrbVerbose]</style>이(가) 남아있었습니다.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Jeden z duszków <style=objectOfInterest><incr>świeci tajemniczym światłem</incr></style> zanim wszystkie znikają, pozostawiając cię trochę silniejszym z twoją ulepszoną <style=objectOfInterest>[var=upgradedOrbVerbose]</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
