        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: You peek into your satchel to see a <style=objectOfInterest>shiny new [var=orb3Name]</style>. and when you look up the spirits have <style=fade>disappeared</style>.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: You peek into your satchel to see a <style=objectOfInterest>shiny new [var=orb3Name]</style>. and when you look up the spirits have <style=subtle><incr>disappeared</incr></style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous jetez un coup d’œil dans votre sacoche pour y trouver un <style=objectOfInterest>nouveau [var=orb3Name]</style>. et quand vous levez les yeux, les esprits ont <style=subtle><incr>disparu</incr></style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Revisas tu bolso y encuentras un <style=objectOfInterest>nuevo y reluciente [var=orb3Name]</style>; cuando levantas la vista, los espíritus han <style=subtle><incr>desaparecido</incr></style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Du spähst in deine Tasche und erblickst ein <style=objectOfInterest>hübsches neues [var=orb3Name]</style>. Als du wieder aufblickst, sind die Gespenster <style=subtle>verschwunden</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value: Je gluurt in je schoudertas een ziet een <style=objectOfInterest>glinsterende nieuwe [var=orb3Name]</style>en wanneer je weer omhoog kijkt zijn de geesten <style=subtle><incr>verdwenen</incr></style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Guardi dentro il tuo zaino e vedi <style=objectOfInterest>una nuova [var=orb3Name] luminosa</style>. Ma quando rialzi lo sguardo, gli spiriti sono <style=subtle><incr>scomparsi</incr></style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você dá uma olhada dentro de sua bolsa e vê um <style=objectOfInterest>[var=orb3Name] novinho</style>. Quando olha para cima, os espíritos <style=subtle><incr>desapareceram</incr></style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Вы заглядываете в свою сумку и видите <style=objectOfInterest>блестящий и новый [var=orb3Name]</style>. А когда вы поднимаете свой взгляд, духи уже <style=subtle><incr>исчезли</incr></style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 你瞄了一眼挎包，看到一颗<style=objectOfInterest>闪亮的新[var=orb3Name]</style>。当你抬起头时，精灵们已经<style=subtle>全部消失了</style>。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 你瞄了一眼彈珠袋，看到一個<style=objectOfInterest>閃亮的新 [var=orb3Name]</style>。 當你抬頭看時，精靈已經<style=subtle>全部消失了</style>。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "カバンに顔を突っ込むと、中には光り輝く\n「<style=objectOfInterest>[var=orb3Name]</style>」が増えていた。\nその後カバンから顔を出すと、精霊達は既に<style=subtle><incr>いなくなっていた</incr></style>。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 당신이 가방 안을 보자 <style=objectOfInterest>새로운 [var=orb3Name]</style>이(가) 있었습니다. 당신이 다시 앞을 보자 유령들은 <style=subtle><incr>사라져 있었습니다</incr></style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Zaglądasz do swojej torby, aby ujrzeć <style=objectOfInterest>nową, błyszczącą [var=orb3Name]</style>, a kiedy spoglądasz wzrokiem ku górze, duszki już <style=subtle><incr>zniknęły</incr></style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
