      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "You find a <style=objectOfInterest>forge, hot and ready to smelt,</style> yet oddly unattended.\nYou think that you could use it, but <style=peglin>your little Peglin hands</style> aren't made to handle the heat."
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: "You find a <style=objectOfInterest>forge, hot and ready to smelt,</style> yet oddly unattended.\nYou think that you could use it, but <style=peglin>your little Peglin hands</style> aren't made to handle the heat."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous trouvez une <style=objectOfInterest>forge, chaude et prête à fondre du métal,</style> pourtant étrangement sans surveillance. Vous pensez que vous pourriez l’utiliser, mais <style=peglin>vos petites mains de Peglin</style> ne sont pas faites pour supporter la chaleur.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Encuentras una <style=objectOfInterest>fragua, caliente y lista para fundir,</style> pero curiosamente desatendida. Piensas que podrías usarla, pero <style=peglin>tus pequeñas manos de Peglin</style> no están hechas para soportar el calor.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: "Du findest eine <style=objectOfInterest>heiße und zum Schmelzen bereite Schmiede,</style> die aber seltsamerweise unbewacht ist.\nDu denkst, dass du sie nutzen könntest, aber <style=peglin>deine kleinen Peglin-Hände</style> sind nicht dafür gemacht, mit dieser Hitze umzugehen."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Ti trovi di fronte a una <style=objectOfInterest>forgia, calda e pronta all'uso,</style> stranamente incustodita. Pensi di potertene servire, ma <style=peglin>le tue piccole mani da Peglin</style> non sono adatte a maneggiare questi strumenti.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você encontra uma <style=objectOfInterest>forja, quente e pronta para uso,</style> mas estranhamente sozinha. Você acha que poderia usá-la, mas <style=peglin>suas pequenas mãos de Peglin</style> não foram feitas pra aguentar o calor.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Вы находите <style=objectOfInterest>кузницу, раскаленную и готовую к плавке,</style> но никого рядом нет. Вы уверены, что сможете использовать ее, но <style=peglin>ваши маленькие Пеглинские ручки</style> не приспособлены к такому жару.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: "你发现了一个<style=objectOfInterest>烧的通红的铁砧</style>，但周围似乎无人看管。\n你觉得它可能会派得上用场，但<style=peglin>你的哥布林小手</style>可耐不了高温。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: "你發現了一個<style=objectOfInterest>燒得通紅的鐵砧</style>，但奇怪的是周圍無人看管。\n你覺得它派得上用場，但<style=peglin>你的哥布林小手</style>可耐不了高溫。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "<style=objectOfInterest>金床</style>を見つけた。 <style=objectOfInterest>熱を帯び、すぐにでも利用できそう</style>ではあるものの、\n周囲には人の気配すら無い……金床でオーブを強化するのもアリだが、\n<style=peglin>ペグリンの小さなお手々</style>は、その熱さに耐えられそうにない……"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: "<style=objectOfInterest>뜨겁고 제련 준비가 완료된 용광로</style>를 발견했지만 이상하게도 아무도 없는 상태입니다.\n 용광로를 사용하고 싶지만 <style=peglin>페글린의 작은 손</style>은 그 열을 감당할 수 없습니다."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: "Znajdujesz <style=objectOfInterest>kowadło, gorące i gotowe do kucia,</style> jednakże dziwnie pozostawione bez pilnowania.\nMyślisz, że mógłbyś je użyć, ale <style=peglin>twoje małe, Peglinowe dłonie</style> nie są stworzone do wytrzymania gorąca."
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
