      - title: en
        value: You're <style=damage>a little scalded</style> but your <style=objectOfInterest>[var=orb0]</style> has been upgraded to <style=objectOfInterest>[var=orb1]</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous êtes <style=damage>un peu échaudé</style>, mais votre <style=objectOfInterest>[var=orb0]</style> a été amélioré en <style=objectOfInterest>[var=orb1]</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Terminas <style=damage>un poco chamuscado</style>, pero tu <style=objectOfInterest>[var=orb0]</style> se ha convertido en un <style=objectOfInterest>[var=orb1]</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Du bist <style=damage>ein bisschen angesengt</style>, aber dein <style=objectOfInterest>[var=orb0]</style> wurde zu einem <style=objectOfInterest>[var=orb1]</style> verbessert.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Hai <style=damage>qualche scottatura</style>, ma la tua <style=objectOfInterest>[var=orb0]</style> è stata migliorata in <style=objectOfInterest>[var=orb1]</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você levou <style=damage>uma chamuscada</style>, mas seu <style=objectOfInterest>[var=orb0]</style> foi melhorado para <style=objectOfInterest>[var=orb1]</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Вы <style=damage>получили небольшой ожог,</style> но ваш <style=objectOfInterest>[var=orb0]</style> был улучшен до <style=objectOfInterest>[var=orb1]</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 你<style=damage>被轻微烫伤</style>，但是你的 <style=objectOfInterest>[var=orb0]</style> 已升级成 <style=objectOfInterest>[var=orb1]</style> 。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 你<style=damage>有點燙傷</style>，但是你的 <style=objectOfInterest>[var=orb0]</style> 已升級成 <style=objectOfInterest>[var=orb1]</style> 。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "<style=damage>ほんの少しやけどを負った</style>ものの、\n「<style=objectOfInterest>[var=orb0]</style>」が\n「<style=objectOfInterest>[var=orb1]</style>」へと強化された。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 손은 <style=damage>약간 데였지만</style> <style=objectOfInterest>[var=orb0]</style>가 <style=objectOfInterest>[var=orb1]</style>로 업그레이드됐습니다.
