      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: You manage to slide your satchel over the forge and it disappears into the void. You're not sure why you thought this would work but you're glad you tried it.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: EventGuid
        value: de7fcb19-c2cb-48c4-bd0d-e87dda9f2723
        type: 0
        typeString:
      - title: en
        value: You manage to slide your satchel over the forge and it disappears into the void. You're not sure why you thought this would work but you're glad you tried it.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous parvenez à faire glisser votre sacoche sur la forge et elle disparaît dans le vide. Vous ne savez pas trop pourquoi vous avez pensé que ça marcherait, mais vous êtes content d’avoir essayé.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Deslizas tu bolso sobre la fragua y esta desaparece en las profundidades. No estás seguro de por qué pensaste que esto funcionaría, pero estás feliz de haberlo intentado.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Du bewegst deine Tasche über die Schmiede und sie verschwindet im Nirgendwo. Du bist dir nicht sicher, warum du eigentlich dachtest, dass das überhaupt funktionieren könnte, aber du bist froh, es probiert zu haben.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Riesci ad avviluppare il tuo zaino sulla forgia, che scompare nel vuoto. Non sai perché hai pensato che avesse potuto funzionare, ma per fortuna ci hai provato.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você consegue cobrir a forja com sua bolsa e ela desaparece em suas profundezas. Você não sabe o motivo de ter pensado que isso funcionaria mas está feliz que tentou.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Вы смогли натянуть свою сумку на кузницу, и она исчезла в ее глубинах. Вы не уверены, почему вы решили, что это сработает, но вы рады, что попытались
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 你设法把挎包甩到铁砧上，铁砧瞬间就消失无踪。你也不知道为什么这个主意会奏效，但你很高兴能够这样尝试。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 你設法將彈珠袋滑過鐵砧，然後它就神奇地消失無蹤。你也不知道為什麼這主意會奏效，但你很高興有嘗試過。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "なんとか金床をカバンに滑り込ませると、\nそれはカバンの中に広がる虚空へと消えていった……\n\nどうしてこんな芸当が上手くいくと思ったかは\nさっぱり分からないが、試した甲斐はあっただろう。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 용광로 위로 가방을 밀어 넣자 가방이 감쪽같이 사라졌습니다. 왜 이런 방법이 통할 거라고 생각했는지는 모르겠지만, 시도하길 잘했다는 생각이 듭니다.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Udaje Ci się nasunąć sakwę na kowadło, ale ono zniknęło w nicości. Nie jesteś pewnien dlaczego myślałeś, że się uda, ale cieszysz się, że spróbowałeś.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
