      - title: EventGuid
        value: 075a68f7-87ae-456e-a12b-2a2705b0ce35
        type: 0
        typeString:
      - title: en
        value: The hammer is quite heavy for your <style=peglin><wave>tiny tiny arms</wave></style> but you should be able to make some use of it with your <style=objectOfInterest>special satchel</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Le marteau pèse lourd dans vos <style=peglin><wave>frêles bras</wave></style>, mais vous devriez pouvoir vous en servir grâce à votre <style=objectOfInterest>sacoche spéciale</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: El martillo es bastante pesado para tus <style=peglin><wave>bracitos diminutos</wave></style>, pero puedes hacer buen uso de él con tu <style=objectOfInterest>bolso especial</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Der Hammer ist für deine <style=peglin><wave>winzigen, winzigen Ärmchen</wave></style> ganz schön schwer, aber mithilfe deines <style=objectOfInterest>magischen Beutels</style> solltest du einigen Nutzen daraus ziehen können.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Il martello è piuttosto pesante per le tue <style=peglin><wave>braccine</wave></style>, ma forse riuscirai a usarlo con il tuo <style=objectOfInterest>zaino speciale</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: O martelo é muito pesado pra seus <style=peglin><wave>bracinhos pequenininhos</wave></style>, mas você deve conseguir usá-lo pra algo com sua <style=objectOfInterest>bolsas especial</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Молот довольно тяжел для ваших <style=peglin><wave>крошечных ручонок</wave></style>, но вы найдете ему применение в своей<style=objectOfInterest> сумке</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 对于你的<style=peglin><wave>瘦小手臂</wave></style>来说，这根锤子相当重，但你应该能够通过你的<style=objectOfInterest>神奇挎包</style>来使用它。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 對於你的<style=peglin><wave>瘦小手臂</wave></style>來說這槌子相當重，但你應該能夠通過你的<style=objectOfInterest>神奇彈珠袋</style>來使用它。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "その金槌は、<style=peglin>ペグリンの小さなお手々</style>にはあまりにも重い……\nとはいえ、背中にしょっている<style=objectOfInterest>特別なカバン</style>を上手いこと使えば、\nきっと何らかの役に立ってくれるはずだ。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: '<style=peglin><wave>자그마한 팔</wave></style>이 들기에는 꽤 무겁지만, <style=objectOfInterest>특별한 가방</style>을 활용하면 어느 정도는 사용할 수 있을 것입니다.'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Młot jest za cięźki na twoje <style=peglin><wave>malutkie, malutkie paluszki</wave></style>, ale powinieneś coś z nim zrobić, używając swojego <style=objectOfInterest>specjalnego worka</style>.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
