    - id: 4
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Pictures
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Description
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: The humming intensifies to an almost unbearable level until you begin humming as well, as deep and steady as Radia's crust. With a sudden shift the orbelisks begin powering down around you, and the humming fades alongside their light. You are left with an overwhelming silence and an immense earthly power in your satchel.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: EventGuid
        value: 9e2a7d8f-7c82-44d0-a4ab-0e602979c117
        type: 0
        typeString:
      - title: en
        value: The humming intensifies to an almost unbearable level until you begin humming as well, as deep and steady as Radia's crust. With a sudden shift the orbelisks begin powering down around you, and the humming fades alongside their light. You are left with an overwhelming silence and an immense earthly power in your satchel.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Le bourdonnement s’intensifie jusqu’à un niveau presque insupportable. Vous commencez alors à entonner un chant de prière dans des tons aussi profonds et calmes que la croûte de votre planète mère, Radia. Puis soudain, en un éclair, la puissance des obélisques qui vous entourent s’affaiblit et le bourdonnement s’estompe. Dans le silence écrasant, vous sentez maintenant la puissance de la planète battre dans votre sacoche.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: El zumbido se intensifica y alcanza un nivel casi inaguantable, hasta que empiezas a zumbar tú también, tan profundo y constante como la misma corteza de Radia. De repente, los Orbeliscos empiezan a desactivarse a tu alrededor, y el zumbido desaparece al igual que su luz. Te quedas con un silencio contundente y un inmenso poder terrenal en tu bolso.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Das Summen wird immer stärker, bis du es schließlich nicht mehr aushältst und plötzlich selbst zu summen beginnst, tief und gleichmäßig wie die Erdkruste von Radia. Mit einem Mal fahren die Obeliske um dich herum herunter, deren Summen verstummt ebenso wie ihr Licht. Du bleibst zurück mit einer überwältigenden Stille und einer atemberaubenden, irdischen Kraft.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Il ronzio si intensifica fino a divenire quasi insopportabile, non puoi trattenerti dal mormorare, seguendo la tonalità forte e profonda tanto quanto la crosta terrestre di Radia. All’improvviso gli obelischi si quietano, il ronzio si affievolisce insieme alla loro luce. Resti con un soverchiante silenzio e un immenso potere di terra nel tuo zaino.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: O murmúrio se intensifica a um nível quase insuportável até que você começa a murmurar também, tão profundamente e firme quanto a crosta de Rádia. Com uma mudança repentina os Obeliscos começam a desativar a sua volta, e o murmúrio desvanece junto com suas luzes. Você é deixado soterrado pelo silêncio e com um imenso poder terrestre em sua bolsa.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Гудение усиливается до почти невыносимого уровня, а потом вы сами начинаете гудеть, словно поверхность Радии. Внезапно, монумячи начинают останавливаться рядом с вами, и гудение прекращается. Вас окружила невыносимая тишина и невероятная земная сила в вашей сумке.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 嗡嗡响声增强到了你几乎无法忍受的程度，直到你也开始与之共鸣，像 “弹珠星球” 的地壳一样深沉而稳定。随着方尖碑突然停止移动，响声也随着它们的光芒一起消失。只在你的挎包中留下了深沉寂静的大地之力。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 地鳴聲增強到幾乎無法忍受的程度，直到你也開始嗡嗡作響，像這個世界「瑞迪亞」的地殼一樣深沉而穩定。 隨著周圍方尖碑的突然停止，地鳴聲也隨著它們的光芒一起消失。只留下在你的彈珠袋中的深沉寂靜和巨量的大地之力。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "耐えられないほどに轟音が激しくなる中、君は母星ラディアの\n地殻のように深く落ち着いたトーンで祈りの歌を口ずさみ始めた。\nすると突然、閃光とともにオベリスクの力が弱まり、轟音が消えた。\n\n……圧倒的な静寂に包まれる中、君は今、\n大地の強大な力が脈々とカバンに流れてくるのを感じている。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 웅웅거리는 소리가 거의 견딜 수 없을 정도로 강해지다가, 라디아의 지각처럼 깊고 일정한 소리를 내기 시작합니다. 갑작스러운 변화와 함께 오벨리스구가 주위를 감싸기 시작하고, 웅웅거리는 소리도 빛과 함께 서서히 사라집니다. 압도적인 고요함과 대지의 거대한 힘만이 가방에 남았습니다.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Szum nabiera mocy do poziomu prawie nie do wytrzymania dopóki nie zaczynasz podśpiewywać razem z szumem, tak głęboko i stabilnie jak skorupa Radii. Z nagłą zmianą Orbeliski zaczynają spadać w okół Ciebie, a szum zanika wraz z ich światłem. Zostajesz sam wśród paraliżującej ciszy i mocnej, ziemistej mocy w swojej sakwie.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
