        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: Picking up the orb seems to make all of the gold in your satchel disappear, but perhaps the coins protected you from the statue's fate...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Récupérer l’orbe semble faire disparaître tout l’or de votre sacoche, mais peut-être que les pièces vous ont protégé du destin de la statue…
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Al levantar el orbe, todo el oro en tu bolso parece desaparecer, pero tal vez las monedas te protegieron del destino de esa estatua...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Als du das Orb aufnimmst, verschwindet alles Gold aus deiner Tasche - aber vielleicht haben dich diese Münzen vor dem Fluch der Statue geschützt...?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Raccogliere la sfera sembra aver fatto sparire tutto l'oro dal tuo zaino, ma forse le monete ti hanno protetto dal destino della statua...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Pegar o orbe faz com que todo ouro na sua bolsa desapareça, mas talvez as moedas tenham te protegido do destino da estátua...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Если вы поднимете шар, то, похоже, все ваше золото исчезнет, но, вероятно, именно эти монеты защитили вас от участи статуи...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 拿起金球后，你身上的所有金币都神秘消失了，也许正是这些金币保护了你，以免落得像这座雕像一样的下场 ······
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 拿走金球後你身上的金幣都神秘的消失了，也許是它們保護你免受跟雕像一樣的下場 ······
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "黄金のオーブを拾うと、カバンに入っていた金貨が全て消えてしまった。\nしかし、おそらく金貨のおかげで、ペグリン像がもたらす『破滅』から\n身を守れたような気がする……そう思わずにはいられなかった。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 구슬을 주우면 가방 안의 골드가 모두 사라지는 것 같지만, 조각상의 운명으로부터 코인이 당신을 지켜준 것일지도 모르는 일입니다...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Wydaje się, że wzięcie kulki sprawiło, że całe złoto z Twojej sakwy zniknęło, ale może monety uchroniły Cię przed losem posągu?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
