      - title: en
        value: Smashing the statue <shake>into bits</shake> takes tremendous effort but you're able to salvage <style=gold>some tradable gold</style> from the wreckage.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Briser la statue en mille morceaux vous demande un effort considérable, mais vous pouvez récupérer de l’or échangeable dans les débris.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Romper la estatua en pedazos requiere un esfuerzo tremendo, pero logras rescatar un poco de oro de los restos.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Die Statue in Kleinteile zu zerbrechen kostet dich unheimlich viel Kraft, aber wenigstens kannst du etwas eintauschbares Gold aus den Trümmern bergen.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Distruggere la statua richiede uno sforzo tremendo, ma riesci a recuperare dell'oro dalle macerie.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você precisou de muito esforço para quebrar a estátua, mas conseguiu salvar alguns pedaços de ouro para troca nos escombros.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Разбить статую вдребезги требует огромных усилий, но из получившихся обломков вы взяли некоторое количество золота.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 将雕像砸成碎片需要耗费大量的体力，但你可以从残骸中挑选出一些可交易的黄金。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 將雕像砸成碎片需要耗費大量的體力，但你可以從殘骸中挑選出一些可交易的黃金。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "ペグリン像を粉々に砕くのに大変な労力を要したものの、\nその残骸から金貨を何枚か回収することができた。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 조각상을 부수는 데는 엄청난 노력이 필요하지만, 잔해에서 골드를 얻어 교환할 수 있습니다.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Rozbicie posągu wymaga ogromnego wysiłku, ale udaje Ci się zebrać trochę wartościowego złota z pozostałości.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
