        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: You round a corner and are faced with an eerie life-sized Peglin statue made <style=gold>entirely out of gold</style>. It's holding a <wave><style=gold>radiant golden orb</style></wave> in its outstretched hand, and though you're wary of the potential risks, you can't help but be tempted by the statue's alluring gleam...
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: You round a corner and are faced with an eerie life-sized Peglin statue made <style=gold>entirely out of gold</style>. It's holding a <wave><style=gold>radiant golden orb</style></wave> in its outstretched hand, and though you're wary of the potential risks, you can't help but be tempted by the statue's alluring gleam...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous tournez à un coin et vous retrouvez face à une étrange statue de Peglin grandeur nature réalisée <style=gold>entièrement en or</style>. Elle tient un <wave><style=gold>orbe doré brillant</style></wave> dans sa main tendue, et bien que vous méfiant des risques potentiels, vous ne pouvez vous empêcher d’être tenté par la lueur séduisante de la statue…
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Al doblar una esquina te encuentras con una inquietante estatua de un Peglin de tamaño real, hecha <style=gold>completamente de oro</style>. En su mano extendida sostiene un <wave><style=gold>radiante orbe dorado</style></wave>. Aunque desconfías de los riesgos potenciales, no puedes evitar sentirte tentado por el atractivo brillo de la estatua...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Hinter einer Ecke siehst du plötzlich eine gespenstische, lebensgroße Peglin-Statue aus <style=gold>purem Gold</style>. Sie hält ein <wave><style=gold>strahlendes, goldenes Orb</style></wave> in ihrer ausgestreckten Hand, und trotz dessen, dass du dir der potentiellen Risiken dieses Gegenstandes bewusst bist, ist die Versuchung des verführerischen Glanzes stärker...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Svolti un angolo e ti trovi di fronte a un'inquietante statua di Peglin a grandezza naturale, realizzata <style=gold>interamente in oro</style>. Regge una <wave><style=gold>radiosa sfera dorata</style></wave> nella mano tesa e, sebbene rischioso, percepisci il richiamo tentatore della statua luccicante...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você vira uma curva e dá de cara com uma estranha estátua do tamanho de um Peglin feita <style=gold>completamente de ouro</style>. Ela está segurando um <wave><style=gold>radiante orbe dourado</style></wave> na sua mão esticada, e, apesar de temer os potenciais riscos, você não deixa de ficar tentado pelo brilho da estátua...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Вы сворачиваете за угол и оказываетесь лицом к лицу с жуткой статуей пеглина в натуральную величину, сотворенной <style=gold>целиком из золота</style>. В вытянутой руке она держит <wave><style=gold>сияющий золотой шар</style></wave>. Хоть вы и опасаетесь возможного риска, вы не можете не поддаться соблазну манящего блеска...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 你在拐过墙角后，迎面遇上了一座<style=gold>由纯金打造</style>但十分诡异的真人大小哥布林雕像。它伸出的手中捧着一个<wave><style=gold>光芒四射的金球</style></wave>，尽管你对潜在的风险很警惕，但你还是不禁被它的动人光芒所吸引······
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 你在拐過牆角後，迎面遇上一座<style=gold>純金打造</style>並且十分詭異的真人大小哥布林雕像。它伸出的手中捧著一個<wave><style=gold>光芒四射的金球</style></wave>，儘管你對潛在的風險很警惕，但你還是不禁被它的動人光芒所吸引 ······
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "角を曲がると、不気味なオーラを放つ<style=gold>黄金</style>のペグリン像が目に入った。\nその差し出された手には、ピカピカと光る<wave><style=gold>黄金のオーブ</style></wave>が握られている。\n君は、身の危険を感じながらも、その魔性の輝きに抗えずにいる……"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 모퉁이를 돌자 <style=gold>전체가 황금으로 만들어진</style> 섬뜩한 실물 크기의 페글린 조각상이 보입니다. 조각상은 뻗은 손에 <wave><style=gold>찬란한 황금 구슬</style></wave>을 들고 있는데, 위험할 수 있다는 건 알면서도 조각상이 뿜어내는 매혹적인 광채의 유혹을 뿌리칠 수 없습니다...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Wyłaniasz się zza rogu i spotykasz niepokojący posąg Peglina naturalnej wielkości, <style=gold>zrobiony całkowicie ze złota</style>.Trzyma <wave><style=gold>błyszczącą złotą kulkę</style></wave> w swojej wyciągniętej dłoni i chociaż jesteś świadomy potencjalnego zagrożenia, nie możesz się oprzeć zachęcającemu blaskowi posągu...
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
