    - id: 1
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Pictures
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Description
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 2
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: You find Gamblin standing alone with a spaced out look. Upon seeing you their expression changes to surprise with perhaps just a hint of disappointment... "Ah, my friend! It's good to see you again. I was able to get quite the return on your investment!"
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: You find Gamblin standing alone with a spaced out look. Upon seeing you their expression changes to surprise with perhaps just a hint of disappointment... "Ah, my friend! It's good to see you again. I was able to get quite the return on your investment!"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous trouvez Gamblin debout seul avec un regard vide. En vous voyant, son expression se change en surprise, avec peut-être une pointe de déception… « Ah, mon ami ! C’est bon de vous revoir. J’ai obtenu un bon retour sur votre investissement ! »
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Te encuentras a Gamblin de pie, solo y con una apariencia distraída. Al verte, su expresión cambia a una de sorpresa, con una pizca de decepción... "¡Ah, mi amigo! Qué bueno volver a verte. ¡Pude obtener un buen rédito de tu inversión!"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Du findest den Glücksspieler mit einem abwesenden Blick. Als er dich sieht, wechselt sein Gesichtsausdruck zu grenzenloser Überraschung (vielleicht mit einem kleinen Anteil der Enttäuschung)... "Ach, mein Freund! Schön, dich wiederzusehen. Ich konnte auf deine Investition gut anlegen und Verzinsungen erlangen!"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Trovi Giochin da solo, con lo sguardo perso nel vuoto. Non appena ti vede, la sua espressione si muta in sorpresa, forse con un pizzico di delusione. “Ah, sei tu! Che piacere vederti. L’ho fatto fruttare per benino, quel tuo investimento!”
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você encontra Gamblin sozinho olhando para o nada. Depois de te ver, seu rosto muda para surpresa e um pouco de decepção... "Ah, meu amigão! É bom te ver de novo... Olha só, eu consegui um baita retorno no seu investimento!"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Вы замечаете Азартлина, стоящего одиночестве с отсутствующим видом. Когда вы подходите, выражение его мордочки меняется. Он удивлен и слегка разочарован... — О, дружище! Рад снова тебя видеть. Я получил неплохую отдачу от твоих инвестиций!
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 你发现赌布林神情恍惚地独自站在一旁。看到你，他非常惊讶，又或许还带着一丝失望 ······ “啊，我的朋友！很高兴再次见到你，我刚刚从你的投资中获得了相当可观的回报！”
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 你發現甘博林神情恍惚地在一旁獨自站著。看到你，他的表情變得驚訝，或許還帶著一絲失望 ······「啊，我的朋友！很高興再次見到你，我剛從你的投資中獲得相當可觀的回報！」
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "君は、ぼーっとした顔でその場に立ち尽くすギャンブリンを見つけた。\n彼は、君を見るなりビックリし、その後すぐに\nガッカリした表情を浮かべた……\n\n「あ、ああ！お前さんか！……また会えて嬉しいよ。\n　お前さんの投資のおかげで、ガッポリ稼ぐことができたんだ！」"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 갬블린이 멍한 표정으로 홀로 서 있는 것을 발견했습니다. 당신을 보자마자 표정이 놀라움과 약간의 실망감으로 바뀝니다... "아, 친구! 다시 만나니 반갑네. 자네 투자로 꽤 많은 수익을 얻었어!"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Widzisz Gamblina stojącego samotnie z pustym wzrokiem. Gdy Cię zauważa, jego wyraz twarzy zmienia się na zaskoczony z nutą... zawiedzenia. "A, kolego! Dobrze Cię znów zobaczyć. Udało mi się dostać całkiem niezły zwrot z Twojej inwestycji!"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
