        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: Gamblin wistfully watches you (and your gold) continue on your way.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Gamblin vous regarde (vous et votre or) continuer votre chemin avec mélancolie.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Gamblin observa con melancolía como tú (y tu oro) siguen su camino.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Der Glücksspieler sieht dir (und deinem Gold) wehmütig hinterher und du gehst deines Weges.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Giochin osserva mestamente te (e il tuo oro) continuare per la tua strada.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Gamblin, quase chorando, observa você (e seu ouro) continuarem seu caminho.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Азартлин с тоской наблюдает, как вы (и ваши монеточки) продолжаете свой путь.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 赌布林不舍地看着你（和你的金币）离去。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 甘博林不捨地看著你（和你的金幣）離去。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "ギャンブリンは、君（と金貨）が去っていくのを\n寂しそうに見つめている……"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 갬블린은 당신과 (골드가) 떠나는 것을 안타까운 눈빛으로 바라봅니다.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Gamblin tęsknie spogląda jak Ty (i Twoje złoto) odchodzicie w dalszą podróż.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
