      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: An altar with a horrible aura stands in your way. Power radiates from it... power that could tend to your extensive wounds. Are you willing to pay its terrible price?
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: An altar with a horrible aura stands in your way. Power radiates from it... power that could tend to your extensive wounds. Are you willing to pay its terrible price?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Ein Altar mit einer schrecklichen Aura baut sich vor dir auf. Er strahlt eine Kraft ab... Kraft, die deine schweren Wunden lindern könnte. Bist du bereit, seinen furchtbaren Preis zu zahlen?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Un altare dall’aura terrificante, che emana uno strano potere, ostacola il tuo cammino. Questo potere potrebbe curare le tue gravi ferite... ma te la senti di pagarne il terribile prezzo?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Um altar com uma aura horrível fica no seu caminho. Poder emana dele... poder para curar todas as suas feridas. Você deseja pagar seu terrível preço?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Алтарь с ужасающей аурой преграждает вам дорогу. Он излучает силу... силу, что может затянуть ваши раны. Готовы ли вы заплатить за это ужасающую цену?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 一座充滿恐怖氛圍的祭壇擋住了你的路。它散發出某種力量 ······似乎能治癒你全身的創傷。但你願意付出慘痛的代價嗎？
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 끔찍한 기운이 감도는 제단이 앞을 가로막고 있습니다. 힘이 뿜어져 나오는데... 그 힘은 당신의 수많은 상처를 치료할 수 있습니다. 그 끔찍한 대가를 치를 용의가 있습니까?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Un autel dégageant une aura particulièrement sinistre se tient devant vous. Un grand pouvoir en émane... pouvoir qui pourrait guérir vos blessures les plus graves, à condition d’en payer le terrible prix. Acceptez-vous de le payer ?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Un altar con una aura horrible se interpone en tu camino. Irradia un gran poder... un poder que podría curar tus graves heridas. ¿Estás dispuesto a pagar su terrible precio?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 一座充满恐怖氛围的祭坛挡住了你的路。它散发出某种力量 ······ 似乎能治愈你全身的创伤。但你愿意付出惨痛的代价吗？
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "目の前に、禍々しいオーラを放つ祭壇がある。\nどうやらそこから放たれる力には、君の傷を治す効果があるらしい。\n\n……君に、その恐ろしい「代償」を払う覚悟があるだろうか？"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Ołtarz z przerażającą aurą blokuje ci drogę. Wyłania się z niego moc... moc która może uleczyć twoje rany. Czy chcesz zapłacić za jego okrutną cenę?
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
