        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Nimm sein Angebot an (<style=damage>-[var=maxHPLoss] Max HP</style>, <style=heal2>heile all deine HP</style>)
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Accetta la sua offerta (<style=damage>-[var=maxHPLoss] PS max</style>, <style=heal2>Recupera tutti i PS</style>)
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Aceitar a oferta. (<style=damage>-[var=maxHPLoss] PV máximo</style>, <style=heal2>recupera todos PV</style>)
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Согласиться (<style=damage>-[var=maxHPLoss] Макс. ОЗ</style>, <style=heal2>восстановить все ОЗ</style>)
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 接受交易（<style=damage>- [var=maxHPLoss] 點最大血量</style>，<style=heal2>使血量全滿</style>）
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 수락하기 (<style=damage>-[var=maxHPLoss] 최대 체력</style>, <style=heal2>모든 체력 회복</style>)
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
