      - title: es
        value: Accepter (<style=damage>-[var=maxHPLoss] PV max.</style>, <style=heal2>restaure tous les PV</style>)
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Aceptar su oferta (<style=damage>-[var=maxHPLoss] PV Máximos</style>, <style=heal2>cura todos los PV</style>)
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 接受交易（<style=damage>- [var=maxHPLoss]点最大血量</style>，<style=heal2>完全恢复血量</style>）
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: 代償を払う（<style=damage>最大HP -[var=maxHPLoss]</style>、<style=heal2>HP全快</style>）
        type: 4
