      - title: Menu Text
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: It feels as though a chunk of your soul is... missing. But at least your physical wounds have been addressed.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Parenthetical
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Audio Files
        value: '[]'
        type: 3
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Files
      - title: Sequence
        value:
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: en
        value: It feels as though a chunk of your soul is... missing. But at least your physical wounds have been addressed.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: nl
        value: Es fühlt sich an, als würde nun ein Teil deiner Seele... nun ja, fehlen. Wenigstens wurde sich um deine physischen Wunden gekümmert.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: it
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pt-BR
        value: Senti come se un pezzo della tua anima fosse... scomparso. Ma almeno le tue ferite fisiche sono state guarite.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ru
        value: Você sente como se um pedaço da sua alma estivesse... faltando. Pelo menos suas feridas físicas foram resolvidas.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-CN
        value: Вы чувствуете, что кусок вашей души... пропал. Но хотя бы ваши физические раны исцелились
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ja
        value: 你感覺不太舒服 ······ 就像是你的靈魂缺失了一角。但至少你解決了身體上的創傷。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sv
        value: 영혼의 일부가... 사라진 것 같은 느낌입니다. 하지만 적어도 육체적 상처는 치유됐으니까요.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: es
        value: Vous avez la sensation qu’une partie de votre âme a... disparu. Mais au moins, vos blessures ne vous dérangeront plus.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: de
        value: Se siente como si una parte de tu alma estuviera... ausente. Pero al menos tus heridas físicas han sido curadas.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: zh-TW
        value: 你感觉不太舒服 ······ 就像是灵魂缺失了一部分。但至少解决了身体上的创伤。
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ko
        value: "魂がごっそりと抜け落ちたような、強烈な「喪失感」を感じる……\nしかし少なくとも、全身にあった傷は綺麗さっぱり消えたようだ。"
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: pl
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: tr
        value: Czujesz, jakby kawałek twojej duszy... wyparował. Ale przynajmniej już nie masz swych ran.
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: sk
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: ua
        value:
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
