      - title: en
        value: '"Ohhhhhh hello there. It''s not often you see your kind around here, unless they''re <style=damage>angry</style> and covered in <style=crystal>crystals</style>! I hope my brethren haven''t been giving you too much trouble... They get a little carried away <bounce>stomping</bounce> around sometimes!"'
        type: 4
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Localization
      - title: fr
