      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: '"Now if my old bricks don''t deceive me it seems like you''ve got quite a lot of Pebballs on you... You could help me lose a little mass here while adding some firepower to your arsenal, if you are so inclined!"'
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
